  ["20"] = "Ah Sim. Well, the magic that led us here seems to be most potent at a certain time, close before sunrise. \\z\n\t\t\tPerhaps like a giant pulse, or beacon. Maybe the gods set it here, or a mad sorcerer, \\z\n\t\t\twe don't kNãow for sure yet... The portal deep down in the caves, resonating with magical energy where you came \\z\n\t\t\tthrough, can maybe bring something else into this world as well. \\z\n\t\t\tSo it must be carefully guarded while we investigate the island for more clues... \\z\n\t\t\tThere are some very interesting archeological findings here on the island throughout. \\z\n\t\t\tSeems the island has drawn some cults here, but why they are gone Nãow, Não one kNãows.",
  ["21"] = "[PT] It seems that throughout its history, this island was inhabited by very different species. \\z\n\t\t\tI like to study their remains.",
