  ["3i"] = "Also Vendering runes, potions and magical equipment!",
  ["3j"] = "[PT] Passages to Senja, Folda and Vega.",
  ["3k"] = "[PT] Do you want a round-trip passage to ",
  ["3l"] = "[PT] Have a nice trip!",
  ["3m"] = "[PT] You shouldn't miss the experience.",
  ["3n"] = "[PT] Where do you want to go today? We serve the routes to {Folda}, {Senja} and {Vega} and back to Tibia.",
  ["3o"] = "[PT] We are ferrymen. We transport goods and passengers to the Ice Islands.",
  ["3p"] = "[PT] We are ferrymen. We transport goods and passengers to the Ice Islands.",
  ["3q"] = "[PT] Passages to Senja, Folda and Vega.",
  ["3r"] = "[PT] The lizards here are the chosen ones of their kind. We believe them to be the strongest warriors in these lands.So I lead my people here to learn their ways. We are mere assassins but they are using foreign techniques and seem to be far more efficient",
  ["3s"] = "[PT] We of the Grey Shadow clan are studying the ways of the Chosen. Our training is hard, encounters with the lizards often deadly. Every one of us fights on his own. Each one more deadly than the other. Under my lead we wil rise renewed, as the Shadow Nina.",
  ["3t"] = "[PT] I am Nina, leader of the Grey Shadow clan. Me and my followers, the Shadow Nina, are exploring the largely uncharted parts of the continent Zao.",
  ["3u"] = "Alright, I guess you need a stake first. Maybe Gamon can Ajuda you, the leg of a chair or something could just do. Try asking him for a stake, and if you have one, bring it back to me.",
  ["3v"] = "[PT] Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  ["3w"] = "[PT] Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  ["3x"] = "[PT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["3y"] = "Não problem.",
  ["3z"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 Ouro?",
  ["40"] = "[PT] There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["41"] = "I can sense that the druids Nãorth of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["42"] = "[PT] I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["43"] = "[PT] Great drinks and snacks at fair prices!",
  ["44"] = "[PT] I've never been better! I love my new {job}!",
  ["45"] = "Não sorry, I'm out of that business. Please ask {Obi} or {Lee'Delle} if you need a weapon.",
  ["46"] = "[PT] As an adventurer, you should always have at least a {backpack}, a {rope}, a {shovel}, a {weapon}, an {armor} and a {shield}.",
  ["47"] = "Ah, the Monstros are far away. Let's party Nãow!",
  ["48"] = "[PT] If you really want to talk about dungeons, visit Dallheim on the bridge near my bar.",
  ["49"] = "Ewww, I don't even want to think about the smell from the sewers right Nãow!",
  ["4A"] = "[PT] I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["4B"] = "[PT] I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["4C"] = "[PT] I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["4D"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["4E"] = "The druids Nãorth of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["4F"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["4G"] = "Sim, I was informed what to do. Are you prepared to receive my line of the prayer?",
  ["4H"] = "[PT] The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["4I"] = "[PT] Talk to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya about this blessing.",
  ["4J"] = "So receive my prayer: 'Light shall be near - and darkness afar'. Nãow, bring your stake to Tibra in the Carlin church for the next line of the prayer. I will inform her what to do.",
  ["4K"] = "[PT] I will wait for you.",
  ["4L"] = "You should visit Tibra in the Carlin church Nãow.",
  ["4M"] = "[PT] You already received my line of the prayer.",
  ["4N"] = "[PT] So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["4O"] = "[PT] Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["4P"] = "Bem-vindo to the post office!",
  ["4Q"] = "If you need Ajuda with letters or parcels, just ask me. I can explain everything.",
  ["4R"] = "Hey, send a letter to your friend Nãow and then. Keep in touch, you kNãow.",
  ["4S"] = "I'm Vendering magic equipment. Come and have a look.",
  ["4T"] = "[PT] If you need runes, this is the market stall for you!",
  ["4U"] = "I am able to grant you the heart of the mountain's blessing. But I must ask of you to sacrifice |BLESSCOST| Ouro. Are you willing to part with that amount of wealth?",
  ["4V"] = "[PT] The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["4W"] = "[PT] Talk to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya about this blessing.",
  ["4X"] = "The druids Nãorth of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["4Y"] = "I kNãow of a mysterious djinn, bound to an existence of slavery far to the Nãorth of Tiquanda's jungles. He is bound to tell you his secrets and offer you the 'blood of the mountain'. ...\\nI do Nãot kNãow where exactly but I guess you must first dig that one out to actually talk to him.",
  ["4Z"] = "I am one with nature, one with the ice and the cold. Names are of Não worth out here. Out here, you face isolation and loneliness. Only your strength, willpower and {training} can keep you alive.",
  ["4a"] = "My life is one of hardship, hardship I chose freely. Endurance, strength and the power of the will are my only companions in this frigid wilderness. My strength comes from disciplined training and kNãowledge of the outdoors.",
  ["4b"] = "[PT] Receive the heart of the mountain then.",
  ["4c"] = "[PT] Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["4d"] = "[PT] You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["4e"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't Ajuda you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["4f"] = "Besides the {enhanced} blessing available from me, I kNãow of one other, granted by a solitary {Nãomad} far west of Svargrond. There are also five different other blessings available, each in a sacred place. ...\\nThese blessings are: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}.",
  ["4g"] = "[PT] Well, as I am quite in a {fix} currently, my only hope to escape this situation may be to grant you {healing} or an {enhanced} blessing if you wish. You must desire SOMETHING, right? Sure you do.",
  ["4h"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["4i"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["4j"] = "[PT] Grrrrrrr.",
  ["4k"] = "[PT] <wiggles>",
  ["4l"] = "[PT] <sniff>",
  ["4m"] = "[PT] Woof! Woof!",
  ["4n"] = "[PT] Wooof!",
  ["4o"] = "Here in the whiteflower temple you may receive the blessing of spiritual shielding. But we must ask of you to sacrifice |BLESSCOST| Ouro. Are you still interested?",
  ["4p"] = "[PT] I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["4q"] = "[PT] I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["4r"] = "The druids Nãorth of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["4s"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["4t"] = "[PT] The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["4u"] = "[PT] Talk to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya about this blessing.",
  ["4v"] = "[PT] So receive the shielding of your spirit, pilgrim.",
  ["4w"] = "[PT] Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["4x"] = "[PT] You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["4y"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't Ajuda you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["4z"] = "[PT] Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["50"] = "[PT] Oh, Thais, I'll be back. One day, I'll be back.",
  ["51"] = "[PT] My good old cousin Sam. Oh, how I miss him.",
  ["52"] = "[PT] I think good practice is better than reading a boring book. Of course, you will need proper {equipment} to be able to get practice!",
  ["53"] = "Comprar your weapons here!",
  ["54"] = " told them to let me Vender food, but Não! Sorry, you have to ask {Willie} or {Billy} on the farms west of here.",
  ["55"] = "Good Monstros to start with are rats. They live in the {sewers} under the village of {Rookgaard}.",
  ["56"] = "There are many sewer entrances throughout Rookgaard. One is right outside this shop and to the left. For more details about Monstros and dungeons, best talk to one of the {guards}.",
  ["57"] = "The bridge guard {Dallheim} is Nãorth of here, just follow the street, you can't miss it.",
  ["58"] = "Sadly, Nãot many merchants are as honest as I am.",
  ["59"] = "I wish I could Ajuda you with that, but Não, I was told to stick to weapons. Go see {Lily}.",
  ["5A"] = "Oooh, I wouldn't dare gossiping about the king. He might have his spies here somewhere, you kNãow.",
  ["5B"] = "[PT] This is the world we live in, oh-oh-oh, and these are the hands we're given, oh-oh... oh, I'm sorry, I got carried away!",
  ["5C"] = "[PT] As a premium adventurer you have many advantages, you should check them out!",
  ["5D"] = "I serve the best drinks in town! What's it gonna be, lemonade? Wine? Milk? Beer? Just ask me for a {Comércio}!",
  ["5E"] = "You kNãow you want a party after all that tiring hunting!",
  ["5F"] = "[PT] The temple is a good place to visit if you're in urgent need for healing.",
  ["5G"] = "Well, the only Ajuda I could give you are some general {hints}. And a delicious {drink} along with it.",
  ["5H"] = "Não sorry, I'm out of that business. Please ask {Al Dee} or {Lee'Delle} if you need equipment.",
  ["5I"] = "Não sorry, I'm out of that business. Please ask {Dixi} or {Lee'Delle} if you need equipment.",
  ["5J"] = "Oh, would you like something to eat or drink? Ask me for a {Comércio} to see my offers!",
  ["5K"] = "<gets a dreamy look in her eSim>",
  ["5L"] = "[PT] Al Dee treats his customers friendly, but he's badmouthing them once he had a few beers.",
  ["5M"] = "[PT] I'm curious about her adventures. She really should come here more often!",
  ["5N"] = "[PT] He got lucky when Willie and him played a game of dice about who gets to farm on which side of the river. Ever since, Willie holds a grudge against him.",
  ["5O"] = "[PT] Hehe, that guy doesn't pretend to be anyone that he isn't. He is what he is - rude, but honest.",
  ["5P"] = "[PT] <sings> ... are a girl's best friieeend...",
  ["5Q"] = "[PT] Oh shush! It's kinda disgusting when he walks in here with animal blood on his hands!",
  ["5R"] = "[PT] What Seymour doesn't teach you is how much fun you can have here!",
  ["5S"] = "[PT] I invited her to my bar, but she refused. Oh well, it was worth a try!",
  ["5T"] = "[PT] I think that poor guy never gets a break from work. At least he never comes here.",
  ["5U"] = "[PT] That guy seriously needs some partying and a girlfriend.",
  ["5V"] = "[PT] The oracle is on the top floor of the academy. You should go there once you are level 8 to leave this island.",
  ["5W"] = "I think it's rather strange that he lives here with his granddaughter. Não one's ever seen the parents of {Dixi}.",
  ["5X"] = "I hate that name, it sounds so boring. Almost like 'Nãormal'. I think I should change my name to something more exciting. Like... Marylin! Oh, what a glamorous sound!",
  ["5Y"] = "[PT] She told me that she dreams of leaving this island to go on a big adventure.",
  ["5Z"] = "They tell me strange stories about him and some Monstros in a hole. Weird!",
  ["5a"] = "[PT] Sing and dance at my bar! Yeah!",
  ["5b"] = "[PT] That girl thinks that she is soooo special and 'high society'. We used to be friends, but well, things change.",
  ["5c"] = "[PT] That's probably someone I'll never see in my bar.",
  ["5d"] = "<giggles> That monk with his holier-than-thou attitude hasn't anything against a good mug of wine Nãow and then.",
  ["5e"] = "If you listen to him, you could get the impression my little bar is the devil himself. He says he has more work Nãow keeping drunken adventurers in than Monstros out of the city. Such an exaggeration!",
  ["5f"] = "[PT] Best place in town! Come to my bar!",
  ["5g"] = "Well, my name is {Nãorma}.",
  ["5h"] = "[PT] I used to be a merchant, but being a barkeeper is so much more fun. It's been my dream since I was a little girl.",
  ["5i"] = "[PT] It's about |TIME|. Time just flies, doesn't it?",
  ["5j"] = "To view the offers of a merchant, simply talk to him or her and ask for a {Comércio}. They will gladly show you their offers and also the things they Comprar from you.",
  ["5k"] = "[PT] Great drinks and snacks at fair prices!",
  ["5l"] = "You kNãow you want a party after all that tiring hunting!",
  ["5m"] = "[PT] <sings> ... are a girl's best friieeend...",
  ["5n"] = "[PT] Sing and dance at my bar! Yeah!",
  ["5o"] = "[PT] Best place in town! Come to my bar!",
  ["5p"] = "Well, as you can see, I Vender furniture. Ask me for a {Comércio} if you're interested to see my wares.",
  ["5q"] = "[PT] My name is Nydala. I run this store.",
  ["5r"] = "[PT] It is |TIME|. Do you need a clock for your house?",
  ["5s"] = "[PT] Only quality steel and wood used for my weapons!",
  ["5t"] = "It's about |TIME|. Sim, |TIME|. I'm so sorry, I have Não watches for sale.",
  ["5u"] = "My name is Obi, just Obi, the honest merchant. If you like to {Comércio}, just ask.",
  ["5v"] = "I'm a merchant and the local {weapon} smith. If you like to see my quality wares or Vender weapons to me, ask me for a {Comércio}.",
  ["5w"] = "[PT] As an adventurer you should always have at least a {backpack}, a {rope}, a {shovel}, a {weapon}, an {armor} and a {shield}.",
  ["5x"] = "[PT] If I were you, I'd invest my money in quality steel rather than putting it in a so-called safe bank account!",
  ["5y"] = "[PT] Well, the mainland also consists of several continents. You can go there once you are level 8 and have talked to the {oracle}.",
  ["5z"] = "[PT] Ah, Rookgaard. Home sweet home, that's what it became for me, but I will always miss {Thais} and {Sam}.",
  ["60"] = "I'm a pirate. Nãormally I'm sailing the seas, boarding other ships and gathering treasures. But at the moment my captain graciously assigned me to watch this {cursed} entrance.",
  ["61"] = "[PT] I'm One-Eyed Joe. From Josephina, got that? And I regard this eye patch as a personal feature of beauty!",
  ["62"] = "[PT] Good bye adventurer. It was nice to talk with you.",
  ["63"] = "[PT] Ah, the brave adventurer who sought to destroy the evil crystal down there. Have you been successful?",
  ["64"] = "[PT] Did you hear that, too?",
  ["65"] = "[PT] Did you hear that, too?",
  ["66"] = "Great, aNãother supply ship is due. How is a dwarf supposed to work under these conditions?",
  ["67"] = "Ah, there's Nãothing like the sound of hammers in the morning.",
  ["68"] = "Then you should join the ranks of the paladins, Nãoble hunters and rangers of the wild, who rely on the \\z\n\t\t\t\t\tswiftness of movement and ranged attacks. ...",
  ["69"] = "Paladins are jacks of all Comércios. They are tougher than the magically gifted and can carry more items \\z\n\t\t\t\t\tthan druids or sorcerers, but they can take Nãot as much damage as a knight can. ...",
  ["6A"] = "[PT] There are many blueberry bushes in and around this village. Nature's for free.",
  ["6B"] = "[PT] I'm fine. It's a little hot near the crucible, but I enjoy the sound of forging {weapons}.",
  ["6C"] = "Just ask me for a {Comércio} to see which things I Comprar from you.",
  ["6D"] = "Oh, just upstairs. My granddaughter {Dixi} is in charge of Vendering armors and shields.",
  ["6E"] = "Vendering and Compraring all sorts of weapons, come and have a look!",
  ["6F"] = "Sim, I'm Vendering weapons. Just ask me for a {Comércio} to see my offers and the things I Comprar from you.",
  ["6G"] = "Well, Não Ouro, Não deal. Earn Ouro by fighting {Monstros} and picking up the things they carry. Vender it to {merchants} to make profit!",
  ["6H"] = "I wish I could Ajuda you with that, but Não, I was told to stick to weapons. Go see {Al Dee} or {Lee'Delle}.",
  ["6I"] = "I Vender {weapons} of all kinds. Just ask me for a {Comércio} if you like to see my offers.",
  ["6J"] = "I don't kNãow how anyone could give up the flourishing business she led. She should have listened to me and find someone who continues that business for her.",
  ["6K"] = "I told him there was Não danger, but he wouldn't listen to me, Não one listens to me.",
  ["6L"] = "[PT] I suggested him opening a tourist guide company with me, Obi's and Santiago's, but he didn't approve. I really don't understand why.",
  ["6M"] = "An old woman shouldn't be treated like that, Não way, that's bad.",
  ["6N"] = "[PT] Oh, this guy is so greedy, so greedy. Ripping off poor adventurers like you!",
  ["6O"] = "[PT] She is beautiful, very, very beautiful. I hope I can impress her somehow.",
  ["6P"] = "Give those Monstros a good whipping with my weapons!",
  ["6Q"] = "[PT] He's just like his cousin {Willie}.",
  ["6R"] = "[PT] This guy doesn't understand that he should entrust me with the food business, too. He really should do. Then he had time for his farm.",
  ["6S"] = "He shouldn't heal people for free, Não he shouldn't. That would be a great source of income for the village that could be invested in enhancing the smithy.",
  ["6T"] = "Oh, what an endearing little girl, and she's working so hard to Ajuda me, even without receiving payment. Such a sweet little girl!",
  ["6U"] = "[PT] I don't like him, actually I dislike him deeply. He is so greedy that he doesn't want to share his profit he gains from health potions.",
  ["6V"] = "[PT] She ruins the market with her offers! This is bad for us honest merchants, really bad.",
  ["6W"] = "I knew it! I knew she would try to get the moNãopoly on potions in this village! But Não one has listened to me!",
  ["6X"] = "The oracle, ah, such a weird being! It will lead you off this island once you are level 8, Sim it will, mark my words.",
  ["6Y"] = "[PT] I told everyone he will cause trouble. He talks people into giving him their money and putting it on the {bank}! They rather should leave it here with us honest merchants!",
  ["6Z"] = "He is the head of the local academy. I encouraged him to sponsor you, but Não one listens to Obi, Não one listens to me, as usual.",
  ["6a"] = "Well, how can I Ajuda you? Do you need some general {hints}? Or, if you're interested in a {Comércio}, just ask.",
  ["6b"] = "Well, he just Comprars what Não one else wants. Stuff that's long dead. I can live with that, Sim, I can live with that.",
  ["6c"] = "[PT] What a hero, what a hero.",
  ["6d"] = "What kind of information do you need? I could tell you about different topics such as {equipment}, {Monstros} or {Rookgaard} in general.",
  ["6e"] = "{Al Dee} Venders torches.",
  ["6f"] = "Be careful down there! Make sure you bought eNãough {torches} and a {rope} or you might get lost.",
  ["6g"] = "[PT] The king encouraged salesmen to travel here, but only I dared to take the risk, and a risk it was!",
  ["6h"] = "[PT] Only quality steel and wood used for my weapons!",
  ["6i"] = "Comprar your weapons here!",
  ["6j"] = "Vendering and Compraring all sorts of weapons, come and have a look!",
  ["6k"] = "Give those Monstros a good whipping with my weapons!",
  ["6l"] = "[PT] Hm.",
  ["6m"] = "Sim. I listen, master.",
  ["6n"] = "[PT] I understand.",
  ["6o"] = "Nãot yet, my brothers. Wait.",
  ["6p"] = "[PT] Do you seek a passage to the ",
  ["6q"] = "Maybe aNãother time.",
  ["6r"] = "[PT] I can bring you either to the east end of Port Hope or to the west end of the town, where would you like to go?",
  ["6s"] = "[PT] Typical. Easy come, easy go.",
  ["6t"] = "[PT] He will PAY for this... They will ALL pay!",
  ["6u"] = "[PT] <groan>",
  ["6v"] = "[PT] If I ever lay hands on him again...",
  ["6w"] = "Hmm. Não, I don't think so. I still feel this strange prickling in my toes.",
  ["6x"] = "[PT] Too bad.",
  ["6y"] = "Protect your ears? Hmm ... Wasn't there some fabulous seafarer who used wax or something to plug his ears? There was a story about horrible bird-women or something ...? Não, sounds like hogwash, doesn't it.",
  ["6z"] = "[PT] Great! Good luck and be careful down there!",
  ["70"] = "[PT] I can't imagine a better place to live.",
  ["71"] = "[PT] He used to visit me for a chat, but ever since that new tavern opened I haven't seen him much anymore.",
  ["72"] = "[PT] He sometimes delivers fruit and vegetables to this quarter.",
  ["73"] = "[PT] Though the city has seen better days, the quality of life is still much better than in most other cities.",
  ["74"] = "[PT] I can't imagine a better place to live",
  ["75"] = "[PT] Whatever that's supposed to mean.",
  ["76"] = "[PT] I don't have anything that I could give you as a reward. Guess you aren't so selfless after all, huh?",
  ["77"] = "They try to protect the city and do a decent job. Well - Não, a poor job, I mean a poor job.",
  ["78"] = "[PT] You can bring me a mug of tea if you want to.",
  ["79"] = "[PT] Though the city has seen better days, the quality of life is still much better than in most other cities.",
  ["7A"] = "[PT] Paladins deal more damage than knights but less than druids or sorcerers, and have the longest range \\z\n\t\t\t\t\tin their distance attacks. ...",
  ["7B"] = "[PT] They can also use holy magic to slay the unholy and undead in particular. ...",
  ["7C"] = "[PT] Then you should choose the {vocation} of a knight and become a valiant fighter with sword and shield. ...",
  ["7D"] = "[PT] Then you should learn the ways of the druids, healers and powerful masters of natural magic. ...",
  ["7E"] = "[PT] Druids can heal their friends and allies, but they can also cast powerful ice and earth magic to kill their enemies. They can do a little energy, fire or death damage as well. ...",
  ["7F"] = "Druids canNãot take much damage or carry many items, but they deal much more damage than paladins or knights. ...",
  ["7G"] = "So tell me: DO YOU WISH TO BECOME A SAGACIOUS DRUID? Answer with a proud {Sim} if that is your choice!",
  ["7H"] = "[PT] Then you should become a sorcerer, a mighty wielder of deathly energies and arcane fire. ...",
  ["7I"] = "[PT] Sorcerers are powerful casters of magic. They use fire, energy and death magic to lay low their enemies. They can do a little ice or earth damage as well. ...",
  ["7J"] = "Sorcerers canNãot take much damage or carry many items, but they deal much more damage than paladins or knights. ...",
  ["7K"] = "So tell me: DO YOU WISH TO BECOME A POWERFUL SORCERER? Answer with a proud {Sim} if that is your choice!",
  ["7L"] = "SO BE IT. CAST OFF YOUR TRAINING GEAR AND RISE, NãoBLE",
  ["7M"] = "[PT] ! ...",
  ["7N"] = "[PT] Knights are the toughest of all vocations. They can take more damage and carry more items than the other vocations, but they will deal less damage than paladins, druids or sorcerers. ...",
  ["7O"] = "Go through the second door from the right. Open the chest and take the equipment inside before you leave to the Nãorth. ...",
  ["7P"] = "[PT] Take the ship to reach the Mainland. Farewell, friend and good luck in all you undertake!",
  ["7Q"] = "[PT] As you wish. If you wish to learn something about the",
  ["7R"] = "[PT] vocation, tell me.",
  ["7S"] = "Knights can wield one- or two-handed swords, axes and clubs, and they can cast a few spells to draw a Monstro's attention to them. ...",
  ["7T"] = "So tell me: DO YOU WISH TO BECOME A VALIANT KNIGHT? Answer with a proud {Sim} if that is your choice!",
  ["7U"] = "Then you should join the ranks of the paladins, Nãoble hunters and rangers of the wild, who rely on the swiftness of movement and ranged attacks. ...",
  ["7V"] = "Paladins are jacks of all Comércios. They are tougher than the magically gifted and can carry more items than druids or sorcerers, but they can take Nãot as much damage as a knight can. ...",
  ["7W"] = "[PT] Paladins deal more damage than knights but less than druids or sorcerers, and have the longest range in their distance attacks. ...",
  ["7X"] = "[PT] They can also use holy magic to slay the unholy and undead in particular. ...",
  ["7Y"] = "DO YOU WISH TO BECOME A DARING PALADIN? Answer with a proud {Sim} if that is your choice!",
  ["7Z"] = "You can't take it all with you - Vender your Dawnport things before \\z\n\t\tyou receive the gear of your definite vocation!",
  ["7a"] = "I can {heal} you if you are hurt. I can also Ajuda you choose your {vocation}. ",
  ["7b"] = "[PT] Behind each of those doors, the equipment and skills of one vocation lies - \\z\n\t\tsorcerer, paladin, knight or druid. ...",
  ["7c"] = "He has seen much, and likes to Ajuda the younger ones. If you have Missãoions about what to do, \\z\n\t\t\tor whom to ask for anything, go to Inigo.",
  ["7d"] = "[PT] Found a new way of living and took to it like a fish to water.",
  ["7e"] = "Ah. Some wounds never heal. <sighs> Shipwrecked in body and mind. Nãowhere to go, so he doesn't leave.",
  ["7f"] = "He broods over problems he won't share. But maybe you can Ajuda him with a little Missão or two.",
  ["7g"] = "[PT] He lives only for his experiments and potions",
  ["7h"] = "I have heard of it, Sim.",
  ["7i"] = "[PT] Leave all Dawnport things behind you and choose your destiny!",
  ["7j"] = "[PT] Come to me if you need healing!",
  ["7k"] = "[PT] Choose your vocation and explore the mainland!",
  ["7l"] = "[PT] Talk to me to choose your definite vocation! Become a knight, paladin, druid or sorcerer!",
  ["7m"] = "[PT] World needs brave adventurers like you. Choose your vocation and sail to the mainland!",
  ["7n"] = "Poisoned? Bleeding? Wounded? I can Ajuda!",
  ["7o"] = "[PT] I am Oressa Fourwinds, the {healer}. ",
