  ["8D"] = "Sim, it's a bit messy down there. Sorry.",
  ["8E"] = "[PT] Doesn't ring a bell.",
  ["8F"] = "[PT] He rarely comes here.",
  ["8G"] = "[PT] A man of the seas.",
  ["8H"] = "[PT] I think the gods are too busy to care about us mortals, hmm... that makes me feel godlike, too.",
  ["8I"] = "[PT] It is nearly tea time, so please hurry!",
  ["8J"] = "It's rumoured that Sam does Nãot forge all weapons himself, but Comprars them from his cousin, who is married to a cyclops.",
  ["8K"] = "[PT]  If you want to see dungeons just don't pay your taxes.",
  ["8L"] = "It's beyond all doubt that certain sinister elements in our city have certain kNãowledge about this myth.",
  ["8M"] = "You are Nãot the first one to ask about that. Am I the only one that preferes wine to such disgusting stuff?",
  ["8N"] = "[PT] What do you expect from ex-soldiers? He is nuts! Hacked on the head far too often.",
  ["8O"] = "Isn't he the artist formerly kNãown as the prince?",
  ["8P"] = "[PT] I never found any rumour concerning him, isn't that odd?",
  ["8Q"] = "[PT] They say she killed over a dozen husbands already.",
  ["8R"] = "This man lives in the darkness like a rat and is also as handsome as one of them. He surely is up to Não good and often consorts with sinister strangers.",
  ["8S"] = "I am hoNãored to be the assistant of the great, the illustrious, the magnificent {Durin}!",
  ["8T"] = "[PT] Just last week a one eyed man, who had a room at Frodo's, met him in the middle of the night.",
  ["8U"] = "He Venders his scrolls far too expensive.",
  ["8V"] = "I was told he lost a body part or two in duels... if you kNãow what I mean.",
  ["8W"] = "He is rumoured to summon kinky demons to... well you kNãow.",
  ["8X"] = "You kNãow a rumour? TELL ME! TELL ME! TELL ME!",
  ["8Y"] = "[PT] Fascinating! Absolutely fascinating!",
  ["8Z"] = "I heard he was a ladies' man in younger days. In our days he is rumoured to wear women clothes Nãow and then.",
  ["8a"] = "A simple shopkeeper with miNãor intelligence.",
  ["8b"] = "[PT] They say he isn't truly dead. He was... or is a necromant after all.",
  ["8c"] = "[PT]  Some say he is Ferumbras in disguise.",
  ["8d"] = "I am hoNãored to be the assistant of the great, the illustrious, the magnificent {Durin}!",
  ["8e"] = "[PT] What a shame. He claimed to be the king of thiefs and was caught stealing some fruit.",
  ["8f"] = "[PT] Just between you and me, he can be quite a tyrant.",
  ["8g"] = "[PT] AHHHH!!! WHERE??? WHERE???",
  ["8h"] = "I have a job of great responsibility, mostly I keep anNãoying persons away from my boss.",
  ["8i"] = "[PT] You better don't ask, you wouldn't like the answer.",
  ["8j"] = "Ah, Sim, Sim, hail to King {Tibianus}! Long live the king and so on...",
  ["8k"] = "[PT] I overheard a conversation of officials, that magic will be forbidden soon.",
  ["8l"] = "[PT] My name is Oswald, but let's proceed, I am a very busy man.",
  ["8m"] = "Hey, I am Nãot a shopkeeper, I am an important man!",
  ["8n"] = "[PT] I am the grand druid of Carlin. I am responsible for the guild, the fields, and our citizens' health.",
  ["8o"] = "[PT] Every druid is able to learn the numerous spells of our craft.",
  ["8p"] = "[PT] Sorry, I don't teach spells for your vocation.",
