  ["B9v"] = "[PT] dead shaburak prince",
  ["B9w"] = "[PT] dead shaburak prince",
  ["B9x"] = "[PT] dead clay guardian",
  ["B9y"] = "[PT] unholy ashes",
  ["B9z"] = "[PT] dead clay guardian",
  ["BA"] = "[PT] Cruel beings. Large and monstrous, with a single eye, staring at their prey. ",
  ["BA0"] = "Sorry, you don't have eNãough money.",
  ["BA1"] = "[PT] Ahhhh!",
  ["BA2"] = "[PT] Have mercy!",
  ["BA3"] = "[PT] I admit! I admit!",
  ["BA4"] = "[PT] I repent!",
  ["BA5"] = "Nãoooooo!",
  ["BA6"] = "[PT] Please! I beg you to stop!",
  ["BA7"] = "[PT] Take it away! Please!",
  ["BA8"] = "[PT] In this category I have '{Bruise Bane}', '{Cure Bleeding}', '{Wound Cleansing}', \\z\n\t\t'{Cure Poison}'', '{Intense Wound Cleansing}'', '{Recovery}'' and '{Intense Recovery}''.",
  ["BA9"] = "[PT] In this category I have '{Light}', '{Find Person}', '{Magic Rope}', '{Levitate}', \\z\n\t\t'{Haste}', '{Charge}' and '{Great Light}'.",
  ["BAA"] = "[PT] Every Adventurer has one. The big advantage is that you can access your money in every branch of the World Bank! ...",
  ["BAB"] = "Would you like to kNãow more about the {basic} functions of your bank account, the {advanced} functions, or are you already bored, perhaps?",
  ["BAC"] = "Waste Nãot, want Nãot!",
  ["BAD"] = "Arrr. Nãot a very profitable place.",
  ["BAE"] = "[PT] Arr! I'm a pira... er, I mean <cough> <cough> ... clerk. Banking clerk. \\z\n\t\t\tThat's what I am. You need somethin'? Bank business, p'raps?",
  ["BAF"] = "[PT] There's a choice of four: knight, sorcerer, paladin or druid.",
  ["BAG"] = "I'm afraid this service is Nãot available to you until you reach the World mainland.",
  ["BAH"] = "He's an ol' trapper and kNãows his away around in Tibia, aye. \\z\n\t\t\tAsk him how a thing works and he'll be sure to have an answer. ...",
  ["BAI"] = "Gloomy sort. Keeps glaring at me for some reason. Or maybe for Não reason, harr. \\z\n\t\t\tFormidable blacksmith, anyway. Sharpest sword blade I've seen in a long time.",
  ["BAJ"] = "Fetching white beard, I hope I grow one in due time, would impress the younger folk Não end! \\z\n\t\t\tKNãowing some sorcerer and druid spells like he does wouldn't come amiss, either. \\z\n\t\t\tGo to him if you need mage spells.",
  ["BAK"] = "Could've used his talent to brew up some more explosive runes back in the sea fight against... \\z\n\t\t\tah well, you wouldn't kNãow the name anyway. Gotta admit, his potions are good stuff.",
  ["BAL"] = "[PT] <shifts uneasily> Well, maybe I did come across his ship some time. In bad weather. \\z\n\t\t\tAnd couldn't do a thing for those poor souls. And anyway, he swam ashore here. \\z\n\t\t\tSo it all worked out in the end, see.",
  ["BAM"] = "That's Mr Morris to you, friend. \\z\n\t\t\tGo get yourself a useful thing to do and ask him about a Missão, will you.",
  ["BAN"] = "[PT] Don't burden yourself with too much cash - store it here!",
  ["BAO"] = "Harrr, what a dame! Would like to Comprar her a pint one day. \\z\n\t\t\t<leers> Unless she kills me with one of her icy looks first. Anyway, decent healer. \\z\n\t\t\tCan Ajuda ya with choosing a vocation.",
  ["BAP"] = "[PT] Aye, what about my name? You don't like it? Well, you don't have to wear it! \\z\n\t\t\tAnd I am quite happy with that!",
  ["BAQ"] = "Nãot my line of Comércio, friend! Mr Morris next door will tell you what needs doin' around here.",
  ["BAR"] = "[PT]  I could swear he looks like that old pal I met back on... \\z\n\t\t\tah well, much salt water passed my ship since then. \\z\n\t\t\tIf ye need a spell or two for a knight or paladin, he's the spell teacher to go to.",
  ["BAS"] = "Arrr. We go wayyyy back, Keeran an' me. Best you ask him, I'm Não good at details.",
  ["BAT"] = "[PT] Don't take the money and run - deposit it and walk instead!",
  ["BAU"] = "[PT] Yeah, well, some romantic at work there. \\z\n\t\t\tIsland was reached at dawn, new heroes and adventurers forthcoming, stuff like that.",
  ["BAV"] = "Ah, wonderful stuff! That and a bottle o' rum, o'course! Harrharr. \\z\n\t\t\tYou have some Ouro you want to deposit or withdraw, just tell me.",
  ["BAW"] = "[PT] You can deposit and withdraw money from your bank account here.",
  ["BAX"] = "Once you are on the Tibian mainland, you can access new functions of your bank account, \\z\n\t\t\tsuch as changing money, transferring money to other Jogadors safely or taking part in house auctions.",
  ["BAY"] = "[PT] Abram Plunderpurse, at your service. <bows>",
  ["BAZ"] = "Here on Dawnport, I run the bank. I keep any Ouro you deposit safe, \\z\n\t\t\tso you can't lose it when you're out fighting or dying, heh. \\z\n\t\t\tAsk me for your balance to learn how much money you've already saved",
  ["BAa"] = "Waste Nãot, want Nãot!",
  ["BAb"] = "[PT] Don't burden yourself with too much cash - store it here!",
  ["BAc"] = "[PT] Don't take the money and run - deposit it and walk instead!",
  ["BAd"] = "[PT] So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["BAe"] = "Não problem.",
  ["BAf"] = "[PT] You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["BAg"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't Ajuda you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BAh"] = "[PT] Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["BAi"] = "[PT] There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BAj"] = "[PT] I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BAk"] = "I can sense that the druids Nãorth of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BAl"] = "[PT] I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BAm"] = "[PT] I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BAn"] = "[PT] I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["BAo"] = "[PT] Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["BAp"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BAq"] = "The druids Nãorth of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BAr"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BAs"] = "[PT] The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BAt"] = "[PT] Talk to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya about this blessing.",
  ["BAu"] = "[PT] Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  ["BAv"] = "[PT] Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  ["BAw"] = "[PT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BAx"] = "Não problem.",
  ["BAy"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 Ouro?",
  ["BAz"] = "[PT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BB"] = "[PT] 485611800364197.",
  ["BB0"] = "[PT] I am Queen Eloise. For you it's 'My Queen' or 'Your Majesty', of course.",
  ["BB1"] = "[PT] I don't care about gossip like a simpleminded male would do.",
  ["BB2"] = "[PT] Soon the whole land will be ruled by women at last!",
  ["BB3"] = "Obrigado, I'm fine.",
  ["BB4"] = "[PT] It's my humble domain.",
  ["BB5"] = "Vender? Your Missãoion shows that you are a typical member of your gender!",
  ["BB6"] = "We hoNãor the gods of good in our fair city, especially CruNãor, of course.",
  ["BB7"] = "[PT] All citizens of Carlin are my subjects. I see them more as my childs, though, epecially the male population.",
  ["BB8"] = "[PT] This beast scared my cat away on my last diplomatic mission in this filthy town.",
  ["BB9"] = "[PT] He is the scourge of the whole continent!",
  ["BBA"] = "[PT] I can teach you {healing spells}, {attack spells} and {support spells}. \\z\n\t\tWhat kind of spell do you wish to learn? \\z\n\t\tYou can also tell me for which level you would like to learn a spell, if you prefer that.",
  ["BBB"] = "The Spark of the Phoenix is given by me and by the great geomancer of the local earth temple. Do you wish to receive my part of the Spark of the Phoenix for |BLESSCOST| Ouro?",
  ["BBC"] = "[PT] May the great flame devour them all!",
  ["BBD"] = "[PT] Life feeds on fire and ultimately fire will feed on life.",
  ["BBE"] = "[PT] A weapon too powerful to be wielded by mortals. It has to be returned to the fire which gave birth to it.",
  ["BBF"] = "[PT] If he ever dares enter Kazordoon I will gladly dump him into the lava. Tthe sacred flame shall bring justice upon him.",
  ["BBG"] = "[PT] Our city was founded in ancient times. Abandoned by the gods we once fought for, we created a secure haven for our people.",
  ["BBH"] = "[PT] This mountain is said to be the oldest in the world. It is the place where fire and earth meet and separate at the same time.",
  ["BBI"] = "Bezil and Nezil are Compraring and Vendering equipment of all kinds.",
  ["BBJ"] = "Bezil and Nezil are Compraring and Vendering equipment of all kinds.",
  ["BBK"] = "[PT] She is the first knight of Kazordoon. She is responsible for teaching our young warriors how to handle an axe.",
  ["BBL"] = "[PT] Etzel is a true master of the elements. He is a role-model for our youngsters, jawoll.",
  ["BBM"] = "[PT] So receive the spark of the phoenix, pilgrim.",
  ["BBN"] = "[PT] He and his wife are running the Jolly Axeman tavern.",
  ["BBO"] = "[PT] He is a smith. If you are looking for exquisite weapons and armour just talk to him.",
  ["BBP"] = "[PT] She and her husband are running the Jolly Axeman tavern.",
  ["BBQ"] = "[PT] Uzgod is a weaponsmith just like those in the old legends.",
  ["BBR"] = "[PT] Though we are through with the so-called gods, Durin, the first dwarf to aquire divine powers of his own, is considered a protector of our race.",
  ["BBS"] = "[PT] Unlike the gods, the elements don't use mortals as toys, A skilled mind can understand and even control them to some extent.",
  ["BBT"] = "[PT] The ways of the gods are imprehensible to mortals. On the other hand, the elements are raw forces and can be understood and tamed.",
  ["BBU"] = "[PT] You can receive the Spiritual Shielding in the Whiteflower Temple south of Thais.",
  ["BBV"] = "[PT] Ask for the Fire of the Suns in the Suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BBW"] = "The druids Nãorth of Carlin can provide you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BBX"] = "Maybe aNãother time.",
  ["BBY"] = "[PT] Talk to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya about this blessing.",
  ["BBZ"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't Ajuda you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes.",
  ["BBa"] = "[PT] I'm the head pyromancer of Kazordoon. I guess you are here for healing or looking for a blessing.",
  ["BBb"] = "[PT] There are five different blessings available in five sacred places. These blessings are: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}.",
  ["BBc"] = "[PT] We are the keepers and shepherds of the elemental force of {fire}.",
  ["BBd"] = "[PT] The ways of the gods are imprehensible to mortals. On the other hand, the elements are raw forces and can be understood and tamed.",
  ["BBe"] = "[PT] I am the head pyromancer of Kazordoon.",
  ["BBf"] = "[PT] My name is Pydar Firefist, Son of Fire, from the Savage Axes.",
  ["BBg"] = "[PT] Ask around. There's a lot to do, jawoll.",
  ["BBh"] = "[PT] That is our world.",
  ["BBi"] = "[PT] It's the fourth age of the yellow flame.",
  ["BBj"] = "[PT] LIKE MY TREASURE? WANNA PICK SOMETHING OUT OF IT?",
  ["BBk"] = "[PT] YOU LITTLE MAGGOT. COME BACK TO ME WHEN YOU CAN HANDLE A FIGHT AGAINST MY KIND.",
  ["BBl"] = "[PT] I HAVE A MISSION FOR YOU BUT YOU NEED TO DIE FIRST AND RETURN AS AN {UNDEAD} CREATURE. COME BACK TO ME WHEN YOU ACHIEVED THIS GOAL.",
  ["BBm"] = "[PT] EVERYTHING YOU CARRY WITH YOU CAN ALSO BE FOUND IN MY {TREASURE}. BRING ME SOMETHING I DON'T OWN!!!",
  ["BBn"] = "[PT] I HAVE A MISSION FOR YOU BUT YOU NEED TO DIE FIRST AND RETURN AS AN {UNDEAD} CREATURE. COME BACK TO ME WHEN YOU ACHIEVED THIS GOAL.",
  ["BBo"] = "[PT] BOON AND BANE. I HAVE CHOSEN THIS LIFE VOLUNTARILLY AND I NEVER REGRET IT. MY {TREASURE} IS GROWING BIGGER EACH DAY.",
  ["BBp"] = "[PT] ALRIGHT. BUT FIRST OF ALL I WANT YOU TO BRING ME SOMETHING IN EXCHANGE. SURPRISE ME....AND IF I LIKE IT, YOU MAY GET WHAT YOU DESERVE.",
  ["BBq"] = "[PT] HAVE YOU SEEN THESE LEGENDARY ITEMS BACK THERE? WHO COULD REFUSE THE CHANCE OF OBTAINING ONE?!? SO WHAT IS YOUR ANSWER?",
  ["BBr"] = "I GRANT YOU ACCESS TO THE DUNGEON IN THE NãoRTH. YOU'LL FIND SOME OF MY LIVING BROTHERS THERE....BUT.....EVERY TIME YOU WANT TO ENTER YOU HAVE TO GIVE ME SOMETHING PRECIOUS. ALRIGHT?",
  ["BBs"] = "[PT] AS YOU WISH. WHAT DO YOU HAVE TO OFFER?",
  ["BBt"] = "I LIKE THAT AND GRANT YOU ACCESS TO THE DUNGEON IN THE NãoRTH FOR THE NEXT FEW MINUTES. COME BACK ANYTIME AND BRING ME MORE TREASURES.",
  ["BBu"] = "THIS IS NãoT WORTH BEING PART OF MY TREASURE! BRING ME SOMETHING ELSE.",
  ["BBv"] = "THIS IS NãoT WORTH BEING PART OF MY TREASURE! BRING ME SOMETHING ELSE",
  ["BBw"] = "TELL ME IF YOU CHANGE YOUR MIND. MY TREASURE THIRSTS FOR Ouro.",
  ["BBx"] = "[PT] I greet thee, my loyal {subject}.",
  ["BBy"] = "[PT] I greet thee, my loyal {subject}.",
  ["BBz"] = "I can promote you for 20000 Ouro coins. Do you want me to promote you?",
  ["BC"] = "[PT] These fools and their superstitious life cult don't understand anything of importance.",
  ["BC0"] = "[PT] I guess you couldn't convince Gamon to give you a stake, eh?",
  ["BC1"] = "[PT] Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["BC2"] = "[PT] There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BC3"] = "[PT] I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BC4"] = "I can sense that the druids Nãorth of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BC5"] = "[PT] I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BC6"] = "[PT] I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BC7"] = "[PT] I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["BC8"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BC9"] = "The druids Nãorth of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BCA"] = "Congratulations! You are Nãow promoted.",
  ["BCB"] = "[PT] The royal treasure is hidden beyond the grasps of any thieves by magical means.",
  ["BCC"] = "[PT] Go and hunt them! For queen and country!",
  ["BCD"] = "Visit the church or the townguards for Ajuda.",
  ["BCE"] = "[PT] I will call for heroes as soon as the need arises again.",
  ["BCF"] = "[PT] Our city is rich and prospering.",
  ["BCG"] = "[PT] I don't want to talk about 'sewers'.",
  ["BCH"] = "[PT] Dungeons are places where males crawl around and look for trouble.",
  ["BCI"] = "[PT] Feel free to visit our town's magnificent shops.",
  ["BCJ"] = "[PT] Don't worry about time in the presence of your Queen.",
  ["BCK"] = "We need the assistance of heroes Nãow and then. Even males prove useful Nãow and then.",
  ["BCL"] = "[PT] Alright then, come back when you are ready.",
  ["BCM"] = "The taxes in Carlin are Nãot high, more a symbol than a sacrifice.",
  ["BCN"] = "[PT] I am the Queen, the only rightful ruler on the continent!",
  ["BCO"] = "[PT] Ask one of the soldiers about that.",
  ["BCP"] = "Our enemies are numerous. We have to fight vile Monstros and have to watch this silly king in the south carefully.",
  ["BCQ"] = "[PT] They dare to reject my reign over them!",
  ["BCR"] = "Isn't our city marvellous? Have you Nãoticed the lovely gardens on the roofs?",
  ["BCS"] = "[PT] My subjects maintain many fine shops. Go and have a look at their wares.",
  ["BCT"] = "[PT] Ask around about them.",
  ["BCU"] = "[PT] The four major guilds are the Knights, the Paladins, the Druids, and the Sorcerers.",
  ["BCV"] = "[PT] They haven't troubled our city lately. I guess, they fear the wrath of our druids.",
  ["BCW"] = "[PT] I remember about those uniforms, they had a camouflage inlay so they could be worn the inside out too. I will send some color samples via mail to Mr. Postner.",
  ["BCX"] = "[PT] The paladins are great hunters.",
  ["BCY"] = "It's a shame that the High Paladin does Nãot reside in Carlin.",
  ["BCZ"] = "[PT] The knights of Carlin are the bravest.",
  ["BCa"] = "The sorcerers have a small isle for their guild. So if they blow something up it does Nãot burn the whole city to ruins.",
  ["BCb"] = "[PT] The druids of Carlin are our protectors and advisors. Their powers provide us with wealth and food.",
  ["BCc"] = "[PT] Carlin is a center of the forces of good, of course.",
  ["BCd"] = "[PT] The forces of evil have a firm grip on this puny city to the south.",
  ["BCe"] = "The order, CruNãor gives the world, is essential for survival.",
  ["BCf"] = "[PT] Chaos is common in the southern regions, where they allow a man to reign over a realm.",
  ["BCg"] = "A mans tale ... that means 'Nãonsense', of course.",
  ["BCh"] = "[PT] I greet thee, my loyal {subject}.",
  ["BCi"] = "[PT] If you want a reward, go and bring me something this silly King Tibianus wants dearly!",
  ["BCj"] = "[PT] A dusgusting organisation, which could be only created by men.",
  ["BCk"] = "It is said that he lives on a small island near Edron. Maybe the people there kNãow more about him.",
  ["BCl"] = "[PT] I greet thee, my loyal {subject}.",
  ["BCm"] = "[PT] The uniforms of our guards and soldiers are of unparraleled quality of course.",
  ["BCn"] = "I am {Queen} Eloise. It is my duty to reign over this marvellous {city} and the {lands} of the Nãorth.",
  ["BCo"] = "[PT] We women try to bring justice and wisdom to all, even to males.",
  ["BCp"] = "Alright, I guess you need a stake first. Maybe Gamon can Ajuda you, the leg of a chair or something could just do. Try asking him for a stake, and if you have one, bring it back to me.",
  ["BCq"] = "[PT] Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  ["BCr"] = "[PT] Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  ["BCs"] = "[PT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BCt"] = "Não problem.",
  ["BCu"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 Ouro?",
  ["BCv"] = "[PT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BCw"] = "Sorry, you don't have eNãough money.",
  ["BCx"] = "Não problem.",
  ["BCy"] = "[PT] You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["BCz"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't Ajuda you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BD"] = "[PT] Only inferior species need weapons.",
  ["BD0"] = "[PT] Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  ["BD1"] = "[PT] Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  ["BD2"] = "[PT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BD3"] = "Não problem.",
  ["BD4"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 Ouro?",
  ["BD5"] = "[PT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BD6"] = "Please, Nãot so loud, Nãot so loud. Some of us are trying to rest in peace here.",
  ["BD7"] = "Nãow that we have arrived you should waste Não time and fight your way to the lair of evil and destroy its master before its too late!",
  ["BD8"] = "[PT] Me humble name is Rapanaio. Good old goblin name meaning honest, generous and nice person, I swear!",
  ["BD9"] = "[PT] Passage to {Evil Isle}.",
  ["BDA"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BDB"] = "[PT] Ah, I see you brought a stake with you. Are you ready to receive my line of the prayer then?",
  ["BDC"] = "[PT] The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BDD"] = "[PT] Talk to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya about this blessing.",
  ["BDE"] = "So receive my prayer: 'Light shall be near - and darkness afar'. Nãow, bring your stake to Tibra in the Carlin church for the next line of the prayer. I will inform her what to do.",
  ["BDF"] = "[PT] I will wait for you.",
  ["BDG"] = "You should visit Tibra in the Carlin church Nãow.",
  ["BDH"] = "[PT] You already received my line of the prayer.",
  ["BDI"] = "[PT] So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["BDJ"] = "[PT] Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["BDK"] = "[PT] Okay, then just browse through all of my wares.",
  ["BDL"] = "[PT] Don't forget to deposit your money here in the Global Bank before you head out for adventure.",
  ["BDM"] = "[PT] Are you here to get a task or to report you finished task?",
  ["BDN"] = "They are mean and cruel. Humble goblin rarely Comércios with them. They would rather kill poor me if Nãot too greedy for stuff only me can get them. Still, they rob me of it for a few spare coins and there is Nãoooo profit for poor goblin.",
  ["BDO"] = "Me job merchant is. Me Comércio with all kinds of things. Me Nãot good Comércior though, so you get everything incredibly cheap! You might think me mad, but please don't rip off poor goblin too much. Me has four or five wives and dozens of kids to feed!",
  ["BDP"] = "[PT] Humans so clever. Much, much smarter than poor, stupid goblin. They have big rich town. Goblin lives here poor and hungry. Me so impressed by you strong and smart humans. So much to learn from you. Poor goblin only sees pretty city from afar. Poor goblin too afraid to go there.",
  ["BDQ"] = "Me have seen a Ouro coin once or twice. So bright and shiny it hurt me poor eSim. You surely are incredibly rich human who has even three or four coins at once! Perhaps you want to exchange them for some things me offer? Just don't rob me too much, me little stupid goblin, have Não idea what stuff is worth... you look honest, you surely pay fair price like I ask and tell if it's too cheap.",
  ["BDR"] = "Furry guys are strange fellows. Always collecting things and stuff. Nãot easy to make them share, oh there is Nãoooo profit for little, poor me to be made. They build underground dens that can stretch quite far. Rumour has it the corym have strange tunnels that connect their different networks all over the world.",
  ["BDS"] = "[PT] Me humble name is Rafzan. Good old goblin name meaning honest, generous and nice person, I swear!",
  ["BDT"] = "Most goblins so afraid of everything, that they fight everything. Me different. Me just want Comércio.",
  ["BDU"] = "[PT] You humans are so big, strong, clever and beautiful. Me really feel little and green beside you. Must be sooo fun to be human. You surely always make profit!",
  ["BDV"] = "[PT] To be honest to me human friend, me only heard about it, never seen one. I imagine it's something cute and cuddly.",
  ["BDW"] = "Swamp is horrible. Slowly eating away at health of poor little goblin. Não profit here at all. Me will die poor and desperate, probably eaten by giant mosquitoes.",
  ["BDX"] = "Beardmen are nasty. Always want to kill little goblin. Não Comércio at all. Nãot good, Nãot good.",
  ["BDY"] = "So much to do, so little Ajuda. Me poor goblin desperately needs Ajuda. Me have a few tasks me need to be done. I can offer you all money I made if you only Ajuda me a little with stuff which is easy to strong smart human but impossible for poor, little me.",
  ["BDZ"] = "Me heard Thais is big city with king! Must be strong and clever, to become chief of all humans. Me canNãot imagine how many people you have to beat up to become king of all humans. Surely he makes lot of profit in his pretty city.",
  ["BDa"] = "Please, Nãot so loud, Nãot so loud. Some of us are trying to rest in peace here.",
  ["BDb"] = "Sorry, you don't have eNãough money.",
  ["BDc"] = "Não problem.",
  ["BDd"] = "[PT] You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["BDe"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't Ajuda you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BDf"] = "[PT] I think you have forgotten to bring your stake, pilgrim.",
  ["BDg"] = "Sim, I was informed what to do. Are you prepared to receive my line of the prayer?",
  ["BDh"] = "So receive my prayer: 'Let there be power and compassion'. Nãow, bring your stake to Brewster in Port Hope for the next line of the prayer. I will inform him what to do.",
  ["BDi"] = "[PT] I will wait for you.",
  ["BDj"] = "You should visit Brewster in Port Hope Nãow.",
  ["BDk"] = "[PT] You already received my line of the prayer.",
  ["BDl"] = "[PT] So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["BDm"] = "A blessed stake? That is a strange reMissão. Maybe Quentin kNãows more, he is one of the oldest monks after all.",
  ["BDn"] = "[PT] Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["BDo"] = "[PT] There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BDp"] = "[PT] I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BDq"] = "I can sense that the druids Nãorth of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BDr"] = "[PT] I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BDs"] = "[PT] I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BDt"] = "[PT] I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["BDu"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BDv"] = "The druids Nãorth of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BDw"] = "[PT] Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["BDx"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BDy"] = "[PT] The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BDz"] = "[PT] Talk to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya about this blessing.",
  ["BE"] = "[PT] I heard that elves moved in upstairs.",
  ["BE0"] = "Cormaya? Nãot a good place to make business, it's way too far and small.",
  ["BE1"] = "It's Nãot the real thing, but almost as good. The merchants there claim ridiculous prices, which is fine for my own business.",
  ["BE2"] = "Ah Sim, Edron! Such a lovely and quiet island! I usually make some nice business there.",
  ["BE3"] = "Meep? I mean - Olá! Sorry, |JogadorNAME|... Being a {rat} has kind of grown on me.",
  ["BE4"] = "Your power of observation is stunning. Sim, I'm a rat.",
  ["BE5"] = "Meep? I mean - Olá! Sorry, |JogadorNAME|... Being a {rat} has kind of grown on me.",
  ["BE6"] = "[PT] Come visit my little pawnshop! General equipment and such. Don't miss it!",
  ["BE7"] = "[PT] What interest could a king have in this little settlement? If a king cares about us, there must be something important behind all this.",
  ["BE8"] = "[PT] Liberty comes, liberty goes, only the bay stays. Hehe.",
  ["BE9"] = "I Vender torches, candelabra, and oil.",
  ["BEA"] = "[PT] Do you seek a passage to ",
  ["BEB"] = "[PT] We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["BEC"] = "[PT] My name is Rapanaio from the Royal Tibia Line.",
  ["BED"] = "[PT] I am the captain of this sailing-ship.",
  ["BEE"] = "[PT] Passage to {Evil Isle}.",
  ["BEF"] = "[PT] Passage to {Kazordoon}.",
  ["BEG"] = "[PT] Do you seek a passage to ",
  ["BEH"] = "[PT] We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["BEI"] = "[PT] My name is Rapanaio from the Royal Tibia Line.",
  ["BEJ"] = "[PT] I am the captain of this sailing-ship.",
  ["BEK"] = "[PT] Passage to {Kazordoon}.",
  ["BEL"] = "I am a travelling Comércior. I don't Comprar everything, though. And Nãot from everyone, for that matter.",
  ["BEM"] = "Too few customers there, it's Nãot worth the trip.",
  ["BEN"] = "[PT] Um... I don't think so.",
  ["BEO"] = "[PT] I don't like being underground much. I also tend to get lost in these labyrinthine dwarven tunnels, so I rather avoid them.",
  ["BEP"] = "When you avoid the slums, it's a really pretty city. Almost as pretty as the goverNãor's daughter.",
  ["BEQ"] = "[PT] Um... I don't think so.",
  ["BER"] = "[PT] I like the settlement itself, but I don't set my foot into the jungle. Have you seen the size of these centipedes??",
  ["BES"] = "[PT] Um... I don't think so.",
  ["BET"] = "[PT] I wish it was a little bit warmer there, but with a good mug of barbarian mead in your tummy everything gets a lot cosier.",
  ["BEU"] = "[PT] I feel uncomfortable and rather unsafe in Thais, so I don't really travel there.",
  ["BEV"] = "[PT] Um... I don't think so.",
  ["BEW"] = "[PT] I am Rashid, son of the desert.",
  ["BEX"] = "Although it's the flourishing Comércio centre of Tibia, I don't like going there. Too much competition for my taste.",
  ["BEY"] = "[PT] It's almost time to journey on.",
  ["BEZ"] = "[PT] Kings, queens, emperors and kaliphs... everyone claims to be different and unique, but actually it's the same thing everywhere.",
  ["BEa"] = "[PT] Of course, old friend. You can also browse only armor, legs, shields, helmets, boots, weapons, enchanted weapons, jewelry or miscellaneous stuff.",
  ["BEb"] = "[PT] Elves... I don't really trust them. All this talk about nature and flowers and treehugging... I'm sure there's some wicked scheme behind all this.",
  ["BEc"] = "[PT] My beloved hometown! Ah, the sweet scent of the desert sands, the perfect shape of the pyramids... stunningly beautiful.",
  ["BEd"] = "[PT] I have to go to Carlin once in a while, since the queen wishes to see my exclusive wares in regular intervals.",
  ["BEe"] = "Cormaya? Nãot a good place to make business, it's way too far and small.",
  ["BEf"] = "It's Nãot the real thing, but almost as good. The merchants there claim ridiculous prices, which is fine for my own business.",
  ["BEg"] = "Ah Sim, Edron! Such a lovely and quiet island! I usually make some nice business there.",
  ["BEh"] = "I am a travelling Comércior. I don't Comprar everything, though. And Nãot from everyone, for that matter.",
  ["BEi"] = "Too few customers there, it's Nãot worth the trip.",
  ["BEj"] = "[PT] Um... I don't think so.",
  ["BEk"] = "[PT] I don't like being underground much. I also tend to get lost in these labyrinthine dwarven tunnels, so I rather avoid them.",
  ["BEl"] = "When you avoid the slums, it's a really pretty city. Almost as pretty as the goverNãor's daughter.",
  ["BEm"] = "[PT] Um... I don't think so.",
  ["BEn"] = "[PT] I like the settlement itself, but I don't set my foot into the jungle. Have you seen the size of these centipedes??",
  ["BEo"] = "[PT] Um... I don't think so.",
  ["BEp"] = "[PT] I wish it was a little bit warmer there, but with a good mug of barbarian mead in your tummy everything gets a lot cosier.",
  ["BEq"] = "[PT] I feel uncomfortable and rather unsafe in Thais, so I don't really travel there.",
  ["BEr"] = "[PT] Um... I don't think so.",
  ["BEs"] = "[PT] I am Rashid, son of the desert.",
  ["BEt"] = "Although it's the flourishing Comércio centre of Tibia, I don't like going there. Too much competition for my taste.",
  ["BEu"] = "[PT] It's almost time to journey on.",
  ["BEv"] = "[PT] Kings, queens, emperors and kaliphs... everyone claims to be different and unique, but actually it's the same thing everywhere.",
  ["BEw"] = "[PT] Of course, old friend. You can also browse only armor, legs, shields, helmets, boots, weapons, enchanted weapons, jewelry or miscellaneous stuff.",
  ["BEx"] = "[PT] Elves... I don't really trust them. All this talk about nature and flowers and treehugging... I'm sure there's some wicked scheme behind all this.",
  ["BEy"] = "[PT] My beloved hometown! Ah, the sweet scent of the desert sands, the perfect shape of the pyramids... stunningly beautiful.",
  ["BEz"] = "[PT] I have to go to Carlin once in a while, since the queen wishes to see my exclusive wares in regular intervals.",
  ["BF"] = "[PT] Numbers are essential. They are the secret behind the scenes. If you are a master of mathematics you are a master over life and death.",
  ["BF0"] = "[PT] This tower, of course, silly one. It holds my {master'}s {treasure}.",
  ["BF1"] = "His name is Nãone of your business",
  ["BF2"] = "[PT] I am guarding the treasures of the tower. Only those who pass the {test} of the three sigils may pass.",
  ["BF3"] = "I am kNãown as the riddler. That is all you need to kNãow.",
  ["BF4"] = "[PT] I am the guardian of the paradox tower.",
  ["BF5"] = "[PT] The key of this tower! You will never find it! A malicious plant spirit is guarding it!.",
  ["BF6"] = "[PT] <mumbles>",
  ["BF7"] = "Just great. Getting stranded on a remote underground isle was Nãot that bad but Nãow I'm becoming a tourist attraction!",
  ["BF8"] = "Have you Nãoticed that I'm actually the only rock on this island with a proper job? Those lazy pebbleheads! I'm proud to anNãounce: I'm a Comércior",
  ["BF9"] = "Não, you got it all wrong! I said I'm stuck between a rock and a hard place!",
  ["BFA"] = "That guy is a shrewd Comércior, sweetie. I bet even I could learn a thing or two from him.",
  ["BFB"] = "I have shovels, picks, scythes, bags, ropes, backpacks, plates, scrolls, watches, some lightsources, and other stuff. Just ask me for a {Comércio}.",
  ["BFC"] = "[PT] Mostly, pirates are bad for business. But sometimes, they are good for business.",
  ["BFD"] = "Sadly the workers have hardly eNãough money to Comprar something to eat and to drink. That is bad also for my business.",
  ["BFE"] = "[PT] Ah, there is little in the world that comes close to the taste of rum.",
  ["BFF"] = "[PT] I heard there is a fine bounty on his head. Would be a shame though to lose such a handsome man to the executioner <winks>.",
  ["BFG"] = "[PT] Sugar lets the money flow. We depend heavily on it.",
  ["BFH"] = "[PT] Just between you and me hun, that woman is a witch. Love potions, poison, voodoo dolls to torture your neighbour. You name it, she got it.",
  ["BFI"] = "Thais might be a splendid town, but this is of Não use to us here. The situation in our town gets worse with every ship full of foreigners that arrives here.",
  ["BFJ"] = "I heard VeNãore will soon acquire several Comércio moNãopolies that will grant them wealth for centuries.",
  ["BFK"] = "Well, <lowers the voice to a whisper> there are several people around who kNãow this or that about voodoo and Nãot all of them are up to something good. Just Comprar some lucky charms from that old hag Charlotta to be on the safe side.",
  ["BFL"] = "A handsome man but a bit too stiff. I think Não one has ever had a chance to see him smiling.",
  ["BFM"] = "I will pay you 5 Ouro for every empty vial. Ok?",
  ["BFN"] = "[PT] Hmm, but please keep Tibia litter free.",
  ["BFO"] = "[PT] You don't have any empty vials.",
  ["BFP"] = "Uh! <whispers> There are ... rumours, you kNãow? About bloody rituals and gruesome curses ... better don't talk aloud about such issues.",
  ["BFQ"] = "Kshh!! Não talks about ... the magic folk here ... This might draw their attention.",
  ["BFR"] = "[PT] Hard to imagine that this fat man has such a pretty daughter.",
  ["BFS"] = "[PT] Don't mention HIM in my house you fool. You call evil and mayhem upon us.",
  ["BFT"] = "I am Nãot dealing with food.",
  ["BFU"] = "[PT] I won't say anything bad about such a high-born person. That's why I remain silent hun .",
  ["BFV"] = "[PT] I run this little pawnshop, hun, but I think you knew that already.",
  ["BFW"] = "[PT] Come visit my little pawnshop! General equipment and such. Don't miss it!",
  ["BFX"] = "[PT] I was a carpenter, back on Main. Wanted my own little shop. Didn't sit with the old man. \\z\n\t\t\t\t\tSo I shipped to somewhere else. Terrible storm.",
  ["BFY"] = "[PT] Woke up on this island. Had to eat squirrels before the adventurers found me and took me in. End of story.",
  ["BFZ"] = "[PT] I was a carpenter, back on Main. Wanted my own little shop. Didn't sit with the old man. So I shipped to somewhere else. Terrible storm.",
  ["BFa"] = "[PT] Woke up on this island. Had to eat squirrels before the adventurers found me and took me in. End of story.",
  ["BFb"] = "[PT] Only the best quality, I assure you. A rope in need is a friend indeed! Imagine you stumble into a rat hole without a rope - heh, your bones will be gnawed clean before someone finds ya!",
  ["BFc"] = "Nãow, about that rope - ask me for {equipment} to see my wares. <winks>",
  ["BFd"] = "Don't forget to always have a rope with you! Comprar one here, only the best quality!",
  ["BFe"] = "You kNãow, I really don't want to poke into someone else's private life. \\z\n\t\t\tSuffice it to say that everyone has chapters of his life he doesn't want to mention. \\z\n\t\t\tJudging by Coltrayne's looks, we're looking at a trilogy here.",
  ["BFf"] = "[PT] Old Inigo was the one who found me, actually, and brought me to the outpost. \\z\n\t\t\tI was half starved by then. He taught me how to make better traps and how to fish... I owe much to Inigo.",
  ["BFg"] = "[PT] Can you believe how old he is? He won't say it, \\z\n\t\t\tbut I wouldn't be surprised if he had been around for loooooong time.",
  ["BFh"] = "[PT] Don't talk to ME about squirrels! <shudders> Had to live off them the first days, \\z\n\t\t\twhen they were the only thing to go into my self-made acorn traps. Nasty.",
  ["BFi"] = "Don't kNãow what to make of him. Great researcher in all Dawnport matters, though. \\z\n\t\t\tAlways has a Missão or two where he needs Ajuda, if you're looking for adventuring work.",
  ["BFj"] = "Quiet little lady, her. KNãows her way around the isle, looking for herbs and stuff \\z\n\t\t\tbut mostly spends her time in the temple, Ajudaing younglings like you choose a vocation.",
  ["BFk"] = "You kNãow, on the day that ol' pirate decides to make off with all that Ouro in the bank, \\z\n\t\t\tI'm gonna come with him. Should be much more fun landing on a strange island with some Ouro \\z\n\t\t\tto spend on booze and babes! <winks>",
  ["BFl"] = "[PT] Tries to act tough, but he's quite a witty and decent bloke who wouldn't hurt a fly. \\z\n\t\t\tWe enjoy a good laugh together in the evenings.",
  ["BFm"] = "Don't complain to ME when you fell down a hole without a rope to get you out! You can Comprar one here Nãow!",
  ["BFn"] = "[PT] Everything an adventurer needs!",
  ["BFo"] = "[PT] A rope is the adventurer's best friend!",
  ["BFp"] = "[PT] Fresh meat! Durable provisions! Ropes and shovels!",
  ["BFq"] = "Feeling like a bit of treasure-seeking? \\z\n\t\tComprar a shovel or a pick and investigate likely-looking stone piles and cracks!",
  ["BFr"] = "[PT] Richard. Just Richard. Lost my surname with my past in that storm. <winks>",
  ["BFs"] = "[PT] This lovely island here. Once I didn't have to live off squirrels, it became quite enjoyable. \\z\n\t\t\tNasty things though live underground, so take care where you tread and ALWAYS have a rope with you!",
  ["BFt"] = "[PT] <shrugs> Never been, mate. Heard it's kinda cute, though.",
  ["BFu"] = "Don't forget to always have a rope with you! Comprar one here, only the best quality!",
  ["BFv"] = "Don't complain to ME when you fell down a hole without a rope to get you out! You can Comprar one here Nãow!",
  ["BFw"] = "[PT] Everything an adventurer needs!",
  ["BFx"] = "[PT] A rope is the adventurer's best friend!",
  ["BFy"] = "[PT] Fresh meat! Durable provisions! Ropes and shovels!",
  ["BFz"] = "Feeling like a bit of treasure-seeking? \\z\n\t\tComprar a shovel or a pick and investigate likely-looking stone piles and cracks!",
  ["BG"] = "[PT] Our books are written in 469, of course you can't understand them.",
  ["BG0"] = "I am Nãot mad... I- Sim, that's the whole problem, isn't it? What's going on, what's happening to me? I don't even kNãow anymore.",
  ["BG1"] = "Sim, well... I'm taking a break. It will take some time. I don't kNãow how long I just... I want to get away from all this for some time, that's it.",
  ["BG2"] = "Slime is my mission. Is there anything more important? There isn't. To me. Right Nãow at least.",
  ["BG3"] = "Slime is my mission. Is there anything more important? There isn't. To me. Right Nãow at least.",
  ["BG4"] = "You want to Ajuda me? Ajuda me? You? Who... who are you anyway? Ah nevermind.",
  ["BG5"] = "[PT] Hm? What is the meaning of all this?",
  ["BG6"] = "What have I become? What is slime if it's Nãot for everyone?",
  ["BG7"] = "Slime! Everywhere! SLIME TIME! Or... Nãot?",
  ["BG8"] = "Evil little beasts... I hope someone Ajudas me fight them.",
  ["BG9"] = "[PT] Nasty creepy crawlies!",
  ["BGA"] = "I can Ajuda you Comprar trading stuff with you. Good for me, good for you. It's a win-win!",
  ["BGB"] = "Have you Nãoticed that I'm actually the only rock on this island with a proper job? Those lazy pebbleheads! I'm proud to anNãounce: I'm a Comércior",
  ["BGC"] = "[PT] So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["BGD"] = "Não problem.",
  ["BGE"] = "[PT] You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["BGF"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't Ajuda you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BGG"] = "[PT] Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["BGH"] = "[PT] There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BGI"] = "[PT] I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BGJ"] = "I can sense that the druids Nãorth of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BGK"] = "[PT] I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BGL"] = "[PT] I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BGM"] = "[PT] I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["BGN"] = "[PT] Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["BGO"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BGP"] = "The druids Nãorth of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BGQ"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BGR"] = "[PT] The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BGS"] = "[PT] Talk to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya about this blessing.",
  ["BGT"] = "[PT] Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  ["BGU"] = "[PT] Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  ["BGV"] = "[PT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BGW"] = "Não problem.",
  ["BGX"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 Ouro?",
  ["BGY"] = "[PT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BGZ"] = "Sorry, you don't have eNãough money.",
  ["BGa"] = "[PT] Don't forget to deposit your money here in the Global Bank before you head out for adventure.",
  ["BGb"] = "[PT] Check out my good and sturdy weapons!",
  ["BGc"] = "[PT] Don't go exploring without weapons. Especially you'll need a machete.",
  ["BGd"] = "[PT] I am Romella and I will be serving you today.",
  ["BGe"] = "I have many weapons to offer. If you'd like to see my offers, ask me for a {Comércio}.",
  ["BGf"] = "I Vender and Comprar weapons. If you'd like to see my offers, ask me for a {Comércio}.",
  ["BGg"] = "[PT] Our warehouse is the main supplier of the local garrison.",
  ["BGh"] = "[PT] It says the amazons are looking for a certain magical weapon in this area.",
  ["BGi"] = "[PT] I wonder how they finance themselves. I bet they are secretly trading in some strange stuff.",
  ["BGj"] = "Make sure to Comprar some extra weapons before facing that one.",
  ["BGk"] = "[PT] I heard the amazons are after it.",
  ["BGl"] = "[PT] Check out my good and sturdy weapons!",
  ["BGm"] = "[PT] <sigh> The world has grown complicated since my youth.",
  ["BGn"] = "Vendering and Compraring fine weapons!",
  ["BGo"] = "Olá there, adventurer! Need a deal in weapons or armor? I'm your man!",
  ["BGp"] = "[PT] I am the blacksmith. If you need weapons or armor - just ask me.",
  ["BGq"] = "Olá there, adventurer! Need a deal in weapons or armor? I'm your man!",
  ["BGr"] = "[PT] Great spirit potions as well as health and mana potions in different sizes!",
  ["BGs"] = "[PT] If you need alchemical fluids like slime and blood, get them here.",
  ["BGt"] = "I Vender potions and fluids. If you'd like to see my offers, ask me for a {Comércio}.",
  ["BGu"] = "[PT] Great spirit potions as well as health and mana potions in different sizes!",
  ["BGv"] = "[PT] If you need alchemical fluids like slime and blood, get them here.",
  ["BGw"] = "[PT] Hm? What is the meaning of all this?",
  ["BGx"] = "What have I become? What is slime if it's Nãot for everyone?",
  ["BGy"] = "Slime! Everywhere! SLIME TIME! Or... Nãot?",
  ["BGz"] = "I AM THE... I mean... I am - what is a mage, if he is Nãot {mad}? If he isn't... raging? I am... I am just sane. A sane mage.",
  ["BH"] = "Go and wash your eSim for using this obscene number!",
  ["BH0"] = "[PT] I have an old friend there. Haven't heard from him in a while.",
  ["BH1"] = "Oh, it's Nãot too bad here, believe me. At least I always get young and enthusiast disciples! \\z\n\t\tThough I must confess I miss the vastness of the Tibian plains. <sighs>",
  ["BH2"] = "A kind old hunter. He loves to see young life around, taking on the ways and lays of the land. \\z\n\t\tIf you have any Missãoion, ask Inigo for Ajuda.",
  ["BH3"] = "[PT] There's something about these words which makes me feel awkward. Or maybe it's you who causes that feeling. You better get lost.",
  ["BH4"] = "[PT] Heed. Your. Will. We. Will.",
  ["BH5"] = "[PT] Intruder. Intrude. Must. Explain.",
  ["BH6"] = "[PT] Ssssttttoooopppp.",
  ["BH7"] = "Our. Master. Is. Gone. You. Can. Nãot. Visit. Him! We. Stand. {Sentry}!",
  ["BH8"] = "[PT] {Master}. Conducted. Experiments. Great. Problems. You. Must. Go!",
  ["BH9"] = "[PT] {Slime}. Dangerous. We. Have. It. Under. Control. ... We. Will. Stand. {Sentry}.",
  ["BHA"] = "Hey! You over there, could you Ajuda me with a little Missão? Just say 'hi' or 'Olá' to talk to me!",
  ["BHB"] = "Don't be shy, can't hurt to greet me with 'Olá' or 'hi'!",
  ["BHC"] = "[PT] General equipment and all sorts of goods. Visit my store!",
  ["BHD"] = "[PT] Hey there, adventurer! Need a little rest in my inn? Have some food!",
  ["BHE"] = "[PT] Do you want to sail ",
  ["BHF"] = "[PT] We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["BHG"] = "[PT] Do you want to sail ",
  ["BHH"] = "[PT] We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["BHI"] = "[PT] Where do you want to go? To {Liberty bay} or to {Nargor}?",
  ["BHJ"] = "[PT] I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["BHK"] = "[PT] I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["BHL"] = "[PT] Do you want to sail ",
  ["BHM"] = "[PT] We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["BHN"] = "[PT] Where do you want to go? To {Liberty bay} or to {Meriana}?",
  ["BHO"] = "[PT] I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["BHP"] = "[PT] I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["BHQ"] = "Spells are very useful in combat - Nãot only for mages, though of course we particularly \\z\n\t\t\trely on them for much of our damage output. ...",
  ["BHR"] = "There's a broad variety of what spells can do, as you will see as you progress further. \\z\n\t\t\tThe next spells you can Comprar with level 8 and on. ...",
  ["BHS"] = "[PT] Some attack spells can be directed at a single target while others affect an area, having an \\z\n\t\t\teffect either over time or instantaneous. Even other spells protect you, or can be used to create runes. ...",
  ["BHT"] = "Each vocation has its own individual spells that Nãone of the other vocations can use. \\z\n\t\t\tYou can only learn spells at a spell trainer of your vocation. ...",
  ["BHU"] = "[PT] The spells here on Dawnport are for trying out only, and you will forget them once \\z\n\t\t\tyou choose your definite vocation and leave for the Mainland. ...",
  ["BHV"] = "[PT] There, you can go to a spell teacher in a city to permanently learn a spell.",
  ["BHW"] = "Spells are very useful in combat - Nãot only for mages, though of course we particularly rely on them for much of our damage output. ...",
  ["BHX"] = "Ah, the beauty of our world! It is vast and extraordinarily diverse. Strange islands, beautiful cities and fierce Monstros that roam the wildernesses. Mysteries, adventures, danger around every corner. ...",
  ["BHY"] = "[PT] Once you have reached level 8, you are ready to choose a vocation and go to the Tibian Mainland.",
  ["BHZ"] = "[PT] Your choice of vocation will determine your life in Tibia, and the skills and fighting techniques you may use. ...",
  ["BHa"] = "There are four vocation: knight, druid, paladin and sorcerer. If you want to kNãow more about them, talk to Oressa in the temple. ...",
  ["BHb"] = "[PT] I myself teach try-out spells for both the magical classes, whereas Tybald in the next room specialises in knight and paladin spells.",
  ["BHc"] = "A very intelligent girl. Prefers to listen to wild animals' Nãoises instead of humans', which is quite understandable when you think about it. ...",
  ["BHd"] = "[PT] However, she's also a very apt healer and can give you advice on your choice of vocation.",
  ["BHe"] = "There's a broad variety of what spells can do, as you will see as you progress further. The next spells you can Comprar with level 8 and on. ...",
  ["BHf"] = "[PT] Some attack spells can be directed at a single target while others affect an area, having an effect either over time or instantaneous. Even other spells protect you, or can be used to create runes. ...",
  ["BHg"] = "Each vocation has its own individual spells that Nãone of the other vocations can use. You can only learn spells at a spell trainer of your vocation. ...",
  ["BHh"] = "[PT] The spells here on Dawnport are for trying out only, and you will forget them once you choose your definite vocation and leave for the Mainland. ...",
  ["BHi"] = "[PT] There, you can go to a spell teacher in a city to permanently learn a spell.",
  ["BHj"] = "The Mainland offers many more adventures, dangers and Missãos than this small isle, and also has spell teachers where you can permanently learn a spell for your vocation. ...",
  ["BHk"] = "Once you reach level 8 you may choose your definite vocation and leave for Main. Go to a city and seek out the spell trainer of your vocation to learn a spell. And make sure you have eNãough Ouro! ...",
  ["BHl"] = "The art of spell teaching is complex and dangerous, and we will only impart our valuable kNãowledge of a spell to a Nãovice if they can pay the price.",
  ["BHm"] = "[PT] In this category I have '{Lighthealing}', '{Healfriend}', and '{Curepoison}'.",
  ["BHn"] = "[PT] Roughened and toughened by life's tragedies. A good man, but somber.",
  ["BHo"] = "Sim, child. If you wish to learn a spell, tell me.",
  ["BHp"] = "A very headstrong young man, though I appreciate his devotion to the craft of potion-making. \\z\n\t\tNão respect for senior authority or age at all! Except maybe for a little soft spot for Mr Morris.",
  ["BHq"] = "A strange young man. He seems driven, to my mind. By what force, I do Nãot kNãow. \\z\n\t\tI take it the world needs adventurers such as him.",
  ["BHr"] = "Redeeming one's soul by becoming a clerk? Nãot very likely. Once a pirate, always a pirate. \\z\n\t\tBut he's a charming old rogue.",
  ["BHs"] = "Nãot a half bad cook, truly. Must have been that squirrel diet, \\z\n\t\tit seems to have lead him to discover a new cuisine - everything to forget the bad taste of squirrels, he said.",
  ["BHt"] = "[PT] He is proficient in the martial arts. A very skilled teacher of spells for knights and paladins. \\z\n\t\tIf that is your vocation, you should talk to Ser Tybald.",
  ["BHu"] = "Ah, Sim. Travelled with Plunderpurse a lot as I recall. Captain Plunderpurse, then. \\z\n\t\t\tGot his head full of numbers and statistics, that boy.",
  ["BHv"] = "[PT] In this category I have '{Findperson}', '{Magicrope}', '{Levitate}', '{Light}', \\z\n\t\t'{Greatlight}', '{Haste}', '{Poisonfield}', '{Firefield}', '{Lightmagicmissile}' and '{Energyfield}'.",
  ["BHw"] = "[PT] In this category I have '{Deathstrike}', '{Firewave}', '{Apprenticesstrike}', \\z\n\t\t'{Energystrike}', '{Terrastrike}', '{Flamestrike}', '{Icestrike}', '{Physicalstrike}', '{Icewave}'.",
  ["BHx"] = "[PT] I can teach you {healing spells}, {support spells} and {attack spells}. \\z\n\t\tWhat kind of spell do you wish to learn?",
  ["BHy"] = "[PT] I am Garamond Starstream.",
  ["BHz"] = "Did you Nãot listen? I am the teacher of druid and sorcerer spells for level 8 to 18. \\z\n\t\tI teach young adventurers spells they can use once they have the proper vocation - druid or sorcerer.",
  ["BI"] = "The language of my kind. Superior to any other language and only to be spoken by entities with eNãough eSim to blink it.",
  ["BI0"] = "[PT] The world of Tibia is very large with tons of places to explore. Vast deserts, Caribbean islands, deep jungles, green meadows and jagged mountains await you!",
  ["BI1"] = "The temple is the place to go when you are very low on {health} or poisoned. Ask {Cipfried} for a heal - he usually Nãotices emergencies by himself.",
  ["BI2"] = "[PT] Your current health is shown by the red bar on the right side. {Death} awaits you if it goes down to zero.",
  ["BI3"] = "[PT] Dying in Tibia is painful, so try to avoid it. You will lose part of your {experience} points and also equipment. Make sure your {health} always stays up!",
  ["BI4"] = "You gain experience when fighting {Monstros}. You can take a look at your skill window to check your progress.",
  ["BI5"] = "Good Monstros to start hunting are {rats}. They live in the {sewers} below the village.",
  ["BI6"] = "[PT] One entrance to the sewers is south of this {academy}. Look for a sewer grate, then use it to climb down.",
  ["BI7"] = "Olá, |JogadorNAME|. Bem-vindo to the Academy of Rookgaard. May I sign you up as a {student}?",
  ["BI8"] = "[PT] The academy is the building you are standing in. We have a {library}, a {bank} and the room of the {oracle}.",
  ["BI9"] = "[PT] There are many books in the bookcases around you, unless some naughty kids stole them again. Read them for more and detailed information.",
  ["BIA"] = "[PT] Heed. Your. Will. We. Will.",
  ["BIB"] = "[PT] Intruder. Intrude. Must. Explain.",
  ["BIC"] = "[PT] Ssssttttoooopppp.",
  ["BID"] = "Good bye, |JogadorNAME|! And remember: Não running up and down in the academy!",
  ["BIE"] = "Olá, |JogadorNAME|. Bem-vindo to the Academy of Rookgaard. May I sign you up as a {student}?",
  ["BIF"] = "Newcomers - visit me! I'll answer your Missãoions!",
  ["BIG"] = "Obrigado! Here is your reward.",
  ["BIH"] = "Dixi Venders and Comprars {armors}, {shields}, {helmets} and {legs}. You can find her shop south of the academy, just go up the stairs in {Obi}'s shop.",
  ["BII"] = "A mysterious druid who lives somewhere in the wilderness. He Venders small health {potions} just like {Lily}.",
  ["BIJ"] = "Lee'Delle's shop is in the western part of town, on the {premium} side. She Venders everything cheaper.",
  ["BIK"] = "In the southern part of town, Lily Venders {potions} which might come in handy once you are deep in a dungeon and need {health}.",
  ["BIL"] = "[PT] The oracle is a mysterious being just upstairs. It will bring you to the {Island of Destiny} to choose your {vocation} once you are level 8.",
  ["BIM"] = "Sim, Paulie is very important. He is the local {bank} clerk.",
  ["BIN"] = "Sir Seymour, Sim, that's me.",
  ["BIO"] = "Tom the tanner Comprars fresh {corpses}, miNãotaur leather and paws. Always good to make some {money} if you can carry the corpses there fast eNãough.",
  ["BIP"] = "He's the guard on the Nãorth {bridge} and a great fighter. He can show you {Monstro} locations. Just ask him about Monstros!",
  ["BIQ"] = "He's the guard on the west {bridge} and a great fighter. He can show you {Monstro} locations. Just ask him about Monstros!",
  ["BIR"] = "[PT] HEY! You don't have so many!",
  ["BIS"] = "[PT] Go and find some rats to kill!",
  ["BIT"] = "[PT] Have you brought a dead rat to me to pick up your reward?",
  ["BIU"] = "Obrigado! Here is your reward.",
  ["BIV"] = "[PT] HEY! You don't have one! Stop playing tricks on me or I'll give you some extra work!",
  ["BIW"] = "[PT] Go and find some rats to kill!",
  ["BIX"] = "[PT] Do you have a suitable present box for me?",
  ["BIY"] = "Obrigado! Here is a helmet that will serve you well.",
  ["BIZ"] = "[PT] HEY! You don't have one! Stop playing tricks on me or I'll give you some extra work!",
  ["BIa"] = "[PT] Get some training in the academy!",
  ["BIb"] = "Well, I would like to send our king a little present but I do Nãot have a suitable box. If you find a nice box, please bring it to me.",
  ["BIc"] = "You are pretty inexperienced. I think killing rats is a suitable challenge for you. For each fresh {dead rat} I will give you two shiny coins of Ouro.",
  ["BId"] = "[PT] For this remark I will wash your mouth with soap, young lady!",
  ["BIe"] = "[PT] For this remark I will wash your mouth with soap, young man!",
  ["BIf"] = "[PT] This is an island with {vocation} teachers. You can learn all about the different vocations there once you are level 8.",
  ["BIg"] = "[PT] It's |TIME|, so you are late. Hurry!",
  ["BIh"] = "[PT] My name is Seymour, but for you I am 'Sir' Seymour.",
  ["BIi"] = "At least you kNãow how to address a man of my importance.",
  ["BIj"] = "[PT] I'm the master of this fine {academy}, giving {lessons} to my students.",
  ["BIk"] = "[PT] Oh, which lesson did you want to attend again? Was it {Rookgaard}, {fighting}, {equipment}, {citizens}, the {academy} or the {oracle}?",
  ["BIl"] = "Feeling lost? Ask me for Ajuda!",
  ["BIm"] = "In a bank you can deposit your earned Ouro coins safely. Just go downstairs to {Paulie} and ask him to {deposit} your money.",
  ["BIn"] = "Sim, depositing your money will keep it safe, so it is a good idea to store it in the bank. Of course, you can always withdraw it again.",
  ["BIo"] = "[PT] Well, the {king} doesn't send troops anymore, the {academy} is dreadfully low on money, and the end of the world is pretty nigh. Apart from that I'm reasonably fine, I suppose.",
  ["BIp"] = "Most of the citizens here are {merchants}. You can give me the name of any Nãon-Jogador character and I will tell you something about him or her.",
  ["BIq"] = "Merchants Comprar and Vender goods. Just ask them for a {Comércio} to see what they offer or Comprar from you.",
  ["BIr"] = "Trolls are quite nasty Monstros which you shouldn't face before level 3 or 4 depending on your {equipment}. Ask the bridge {guards} for their locations!",
  ["BIs"] = "The guards {Dallheim} and {Zerbrus} protect our village from {Monstros} trying to enter. They also mark useful {dungeon} locations on your map.",
  ["BIt"] = "[PT] There are four vocations: {knights}, {paladins}, {sorcerers} and {druids}. You can choose your vocation once you are level 8 and have talked to the {oracle}.",
  ["BIu"] = "[PT] Sorcerers are talented elemental magicians. You will learn all about them once you are level 8 and reached the Island of {Destiny}.",
  ["BIv"] = "[PT] Knights are strong melee fighters. You will learn all about them once you are level 8 and reached the Island of {Destiny}.",
  ["BIw"] = "Gain some kNãowledge in the academy!",
  ["BIx"] = "[PT] Druids are nature magic users and great healers. You will learn all about them once you are level 8 and reached the Island of {Destiny}.",
  ["BIy"] = "[PT] Paladins are swift distance fighters. You will learn all about them once you are level 8 and reached the Island of {Destiny}.",
  ["BIz"] = "We have a {weapon} and an {armor} shop south of the academy. {Equipment} such as {ropes} are sold to the Nãorth-west. {Potions} can be bought to the south. And then there are the {farms}.",
  ["BJ"] = "Nãoisy pests.",
  ["BJ0"] = "Newcomers - visit me! I'll answer your Missãoions!",
  ["BJ1"] = "[PT] Get some training in the academy!",
  ["BJ2"] = "Feeling lost? Ask me for Ajuda!",
  ["BJ3"] = "Gain some kNãowledge in the academy!",
  ["BJ4"] = "Adeus, |JogadorNAME|.",
  ["BJ5"] = "Greetings, |JogadorNAME|.",
  ["BJ6"] = "[PT] Fine elven armor and weapons. Have a look.",
  ["BJ7"] = "[PT] Looking for protective spells for druids? I can teach you.",
  ["BJ8"] = "Não news are good news.",
  ["BJ9"] = "[PT] The Bonecrusher family is ideally suited for military jobs.",
  ["BJA"] = "[PT] Don't go hunting without proper equipment. You need at least a suitable {weapon}, {armor}, {shield}, {rope} and {shovel}. A {torch} is also good as well as {legs}, a {helmet} and {shoes}.",
  ["BJB"] = "Make money by killing {Monstros} and picking up their {loot}. You can Vender many of the things they carry.",
  ["BJC"] = "Once a Monstro is dead, you can select 'Open' on the {corpse} to check what's inside. Sometimes they carry {money} or other items which you can Vender to {merchants}.",
  ["BJD"] = "You can even Vender some corpses! For example, you can Vender fresh dead rats to {Tom} the tanner or me. He also Comprars other dead creatures, just ask him for a {Comércio}.",
  ["BJE"] = "You definitely need a rope to progress in dungeons, else you might end up stuck. Comprar one from {Al Dee} or {Lee'Delle}.",
  ["BJF"] = "A shovel is needed to dig some {dungeon} entrances open. 'Use' it on a loose stone pile to make a hole large eNãough to enter.",
  ["BJG"] = "You should Nãot descend into dungeons without proper {equipment}. Once you are all prepared, ask the bridge {guards} for suitable {Monstros}.",
  ["BJH"] = "A torch will provide you with light in dark {dungeons}. 'Use' it to light it. You can Comprar them from {Al Dee} or {Lee'Delle}.",
  ["BJI"] = "[PT] Brilliant! We need fine adventurers like you! If you are ready to learn, just ask me for a lesson. You can always ask for the differently coloured words - such as this one - to continue the lesson.",
  ["BJJ"] = "Well, I could give you valuable {lessons} or some general {hints} about the game, or a small {Missão} if you're interested.",
  ["BJK"] = "The starter armor, a coat, does Nãot protect you well. First of all, earn some money and try to get a sturdy leather armor from {Dixi}'s  or {Lee'Delle}'s shop. Simply ask for a {Comércio}.",
  ["BJL"] = "The starter weapon, a club, won't get you far. You should earn some {money} and Comprar a better weapon such as a sabre from {Obi}'s or {Lee'Delle}'s shop. Simply ask for a {Comércio}.",
  ["BJM"] = "A sturdy leather helmet is a good choice for a beginner. You can either Comprar it from {Dixi} and {Lee'Delle}, or, once you are strong eNãough, {loot} them from {trolls}.",
  ["BJN"] = "I fear you have to Comprar your first shield by yourself. A wooden shield from {Dixi} or {Lee'Delle} is a good choice.",
  ["BJO"] = "Leather boots are basic shoes which will protect you well. You can either Comprar them from {Dixi} and {Lee'Delle}, or, once you are strong eNãough, {loot} them from {trolls}.",
  ["BJP"] = "Leather legs might be a good basic protection. You can Comprar them from {Dixi} or {Lee'Delle}. Or, once you are strong eNãough, hunt {trolls}. They sometimes carry them in their {loot}.",
  ["BJQ"] = "Many Monstros, such as rabbits or deer, are excellent food providers. You can also Comprar food from {Willie} or {Billy}, the farmers.",
  ["BJR"] = "[PT] Paying for your Tibia account will turn it into a premium account. This means access to more areas and functions of the game as well as other neat features.",
  ["BJS"] = "Hail to King Tibianus! Long live our king! Nãot that he cares for an old veteran who is stuck on this godforsaken island...",
  ["BJT"] = "[PT] Brilliant! We need fine adventurers like you! If you are ready to learn, just ask me for a lesson. You can always ask for the differently coloured words - such as this one - to continue the lesson.",
  ["BJU"] = "Use a small health potion in case of emergencies to fill up around 75 health points. You can Comprar them at {Lily}'s shop. She also has {antidote} potions.",
  ["BJV"] = "Some Monstros poison you. To heal poison, use an antidote potion on yourself. Comprar them at {Lily}'s store.",
  ["BJW"] = "[PT] Rookgaard is the name of this {village} as well as of the whole {island}. It belongs to the kingdom of {Thais}, in our world which is called {Tibia}.",
  ["BJX"] = "The island is separated into a {premium} side and a Nãon-premium side. On both sides you will find {dungeons}, but the premium side tends to be a little less crowded with other Jogadors.",
  ["BJY"] = "[PT] The city of Thais is reigned by King Tibianus. Of course, there are many other cities but you will learn about them later.",
  ["BJZ"] = "[PT] The most important places in this village are the {temple}, the different {shops}, the {academy} and the {bridges}.",
  ["BJa"] = "There is a bridge to the Nãorth and one to the west which lead outside the village. You should only leave once you are well {equipped} and at least level 2.",
  ["BJb"] = "[PT] You can leave for mainland once you are level 8. To do so talk to the {oracle}.",
  ["BJc"] = "You have to fight {Monstros} to train your {skills} and {level}. If you lose {health}, eat {food} to regain it or use a {potion}.",
  ["BJd"] = "The more you fight with a weapon, the better will be your skill handling this weapon. Don't worry about that right Nãow though, this will become important once you have a {vocation}.",
  ["BJe"] = "Only Nãonsense on your mind, eh?",
  ["BJf"] = "Once you gained eNãough experience for a level, you will advance. This means - among other things - more {health} points, a faster walking speed and more strength to carry things.",
  ["BJg"] = "The farms are west of here. You can Comprar and Vender {food} there which you need to regain {health}.",
  ["BJh"] = "To attack a rat, simply click on it in your battle list. Make sure that you have proper {equipment}, though! Also, I give you 2 Ouro coins for each {dead rat}.",
  ["BJi"] = "I personally don't have anything to Comércio, but you can ask {merchants} for a Comércio. That will open a window where you can see their offers and the things they Comprar from you.",
  ["BJj"] = "Well, I could give you valuable {lessons} or some general {hints} about the game, or a small {Missão} if you're interested.",
  ["BJk"] = "[PT] Shall I try and take a guess at your destiny?",
  ["BJl"] = "[PT] Well, like I told you before, I really think you got that spirit of a sorcerer in you. But of course it's completely up to you!",
  ["BJm"] = "[PT] Well, like I told you before, I really think you got that spirit of a druid in you. But of course it's completely up to you!",
  ["BJn"] = "[PT] Well, like I told you before, I really think you got that spirit of a paladin in you. But of course it's completely up to you!",
  ["BJo"] = "[PT] Well, like I told you before, I really think you got that spirit of a knight in you. But of course it's completely up to you!",
  ["BJp"] = "Good bye, |JogadorNAME|! And remember: Não running up and down in the academy!",
  ["BJq"] = "Obi Venders and Comprars {weapons}. You can find his shop south of the academy.",
  ["BJr"] = "Nãorma has recently opened a bar here meaning she Venders drinks and snacks. Nãothing of importance to you, young student.",
  ["BJs"] = "Oh, let's Nãot talk about Loui.",
  ["BJt"] = "A fine and Ajudaful man. Without him, many new adventurers would be quite clueless.",
  ["BJu"] = "[PT] This is Tom the tanner's mother. Other than that, I don't think she is of importance.",
  ["BJv"] = "Al Dee has a general {equipment} store in the Nãorth-western part of the village. He Venders useful stuff such as {ropes}.",
  ["BJw"] = "A traveller from the {main} continent. I wonder what brought her here. Não one comes here of his own free will.",
  ["BJx"] = "[PT] Billy is {Willie}'s cousin, but he has his farm on the {premium} side of the village.",
  ["BJy"] = "Willie is a fine farmer, although he is short-tempered. He Venders and Comprars {food}.",
  ["BJz"] = "[PT] A humble monk living in the {temple} south of here. He can heal you if you are wounded or poisoned.",
  ["BK"] = "Their mages are so close to the truth. Closer then they kNãow and closer then it's good for them.",
  ["BK0"] = "[PT] Don't forget to deposit your money here in the Global Bank before you head out for adventure.",
  ["BK1"] = "[PT] Where did I put my broom? Mother?",
  ["BK2"] = "Mother?! Oh Não, Nãow I have to do this all over again",
  ["BK3"] = "[PT] Mhmhmhmhm.",
  ["BK4"] = "[PT] Lalala...",
  ["BK5"] = "[PT] Precisely.",
  ["BK6"] = "The people of Edron were digging there for minerals and Ouro. It seemed all that work was of Não avail when they finally hit the motherlode. Gems, rare crystals and... water. So much that it flooded the whole system. And Nãot a single soul escaped.",
  ["BK7"] = "I heard rumours of a fabled creature whose traces were found on an island near Carlin. It lives solely to collect all kinds of rare gems, crystals and minerals. Offering an item it does Nãot already own, reportedly allows passage into its lair.",
  ["BK8"] = "[PT] So my initial calculations had been correct!",
  ["BK9"] = "Looks like I have to find aNãother way then.",
  ["BKA"] = "[PT] If you have a crime to report and clues, then do it, but don't waste my time.",
  ["BKB"] = "[PT] If you have a crime to report and clues, then do it, but don't waste my time.",
  ["BKC"] = "[PT] If you have a crime to report and clues, then do it, but don't waste my time.",
  ["BKD"] = "[PT] If you have a crime to report and clues, then do it, but don't waste my time.",
  ["BKE"] = "[PT] The castle is one of the safest places in Carlin.",
  ["BKF"] = "[PT] Our people are fine and peaceful.",
  ["BKG"] = "I bet they spy on us... Nãot my business, however.",
  ["BKH"] = "[PT] I scared this bigmouth so much that he left the town by night. HO, HO, HO!",
  ["BKI"] = "[PT] The city is is a peaceful place, and it's up to me to keep it this way.",
  ["BKJ"] = "[PT] HAIL TO QUEEN ELOISE!",
  ["BKK"] = "[PT] He is the guy responsible to keep the sewers working. Someone has to do such kind of jobs. I can't handle all the garbage of the city myself.",
  ["BKL"] = "[PT] Rowenna is one of our local smiths. When you look for weapons, look for Rowenna.",
  ["BKM"] = "[PT] Rowenna is one of our local smiths. When you look for weapons, look for Rowenna.",
  ["BKN"] = "[PT] Cornelia is one of our local smiths. When you look for armor, look for Cornelia.",
  ["BKO"] = "[PT] Cornelia is one of our local smiths. When you look for armor, look for Cornelia.",
  ["BKP"] = "[PT] She has the sharpest eye in the region, I'd say.",
  ["BKQ"] = "[PT] Her peacefulness is sometimes near stupidity.",
  ["BKR"] = "I worship BaNãor of course.",
  ["BKS"] = "[PT] For me, he's the god of justice.",
  ["BKT"] = "[PT] His cult is forbidden in our town.",
  ["BKU"] = "[PT] HAIL TO QUEEN ELOISE!",
  ["BKV"] = "[PT] Wouldn't wonder if some males worship him secretly. HO, HO, HO!",
  ["BKW"] = "I deal more with the human mosters, you kNãow? HO, HO, HO!",
  ["BKX"] = "[PT] Would certainly make a good butterknife. HO, HO, HO!",
  ["BKY"] = "The only thing that rebels here Nãow and then is the stomach of a male after trying to make illegal alcohol. HO, HO, HO!",
  ["BKZ"] = "[PT] For obvious reasons it's forbidden in our city.",
  ["BKa"] = "[PT] Just fine.",
  ["BKb"] = "Would you like to Comprar the general key to the town?",
  ["BKc"] = "[PT] Yeah, I bet you'd like to do that! HO, HO, HO!",
  ["BKd"] = "[PT] If they make trouble, I'll put them behind bars like all others.",
  ["BKe"] = "[PT] If they make trouble, I'll put them behind bars like all others.",
  ["BKf"] = "[PT] The Bonecrusher family is ideally suited for military jobs.",
  ["BKg"] = "[PT] Isn't this a beautiful day? Perfect for farming.",
  ["BKh"] = "[PT] Containers, decoration and general goods, all here!",
  ["BKi"] = "Adeus, |JogadorNAME|.",
  ["BKj"] = "Greetings, |JogadorNAME|.",
  ["BKk"] = "[PT] Good bye!.",
  ["BKl"] = "Greetings, |JogadorNAME|.",
  ["BKm"] = "[PT] *mumbles*",
  ["BKn"] = "That astroNãomer of the academy simply has Não idea what he is dealing with...",
  ["BKo"] = "[PT] Some secrets should better be left uncovered.",
  ["BKp"] = "[PT] Ha, ha... *mumbles* Hmm.",
  ["BKq"] = "[PT] Don't forget to deposit your money here in the Tibian Bank before you head out for adventure.",
  ["BKr"] = "[PT] Hiho adventurers, get your runes, potions, wands and rods here!",
  ["BKs"] = "[PT] Alms! Alms for the poor!",
  ["BKt"] = "Sir, Ma'am, have a Ouro coin to spare?",
  ["BKu"] = "I need Ajuda! Please Ajuda me!",
  ["BKv"] = "[PT] Chuqua jamjam!! Tiyopa Sinatuki?",
  ["BKw"] = "[PT] Indeed, there has to be some other way.",
  ["BKx"] = "[PT] Mmh, interesting.",
  ["BKy"] = "Sim indeed, all of the equipment should be checked and calibrated regularly.",
  ["BKz"] = "Não, we have to give this aNãother go.",
  ["BL"] = "[PT] Good tools to work with ... After their death, that is.",
  ["BL0"] = "[PT] I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, {Edron} or to {Marapur} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BL1"] = "[PT] Never heard about a place like this.",
  ["BL2"] = "[PT] Do you seek a passage to ",
  ["BL3"] = "[PT] We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["BL4"] = "[PT] I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, {Edron} or to {Marapur} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BL5"] = "[PT] I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, {Edron} or to {Marapur} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
