  ["BLn"] = "[PT] I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["BLo"] = "Well, you see me standing behind a bar. Vendering drinks. Food. And stuff. Nãow try figuring out what I could be making a living of down here.",
  ["BLp"] = "I can offer you bread, cheese, ham, or meat. And as drinks we serve beer and water. If you'd like to see what we have to offer, just ask me for a Comércio.",
