  ["BLx"] = "[PT] Feel the wind in your hair during one of my carpet rides!",
  ["BLy"] = "[PT] I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, {Edron} or to {Marapur} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BLz"] = "[PT] I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, {Edron} or to {Marapur} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BM"] = "[PT] 78572611857643646724.",
  ["BM0"] = "[PT] Uhhhhhh....",
  ["BM1"] = "[PT] It's my curse to be the eternal {guardian} of this ancient {place}.",
  ["BM2"] = "I'm the {guardian} of the {SEVENTH} and final seal. The seal to open the last door before ... but perhaps it's better to see it with your own eSim.",
  ["BM3"] = "[PT] It served as a temple, a source of power and ... as a sender for an ancient {race} which lived a long time ago and has long been forgotten.",
  ["BM4"] = "[PT] The race that built this edifice came to this place from the stars. They ran from an enemy even more horrible than themselves. But they carried the {seed} of their own destruction in them.",
  ["BM5"] = "This ancient race was annihilated by its own doings, that's all I kNãow. Aeons have passed since then, but the sheer presence of this {complex} is still defiling and desecrating this area.",
  ["BM6"] = "Its constructors were too strange for you or even me to understand. We don't kNãow what this ... thing they built was supposed to be good for. I feel a constant twisting and binding of souls, though, that is probably only a side-effect.",
  ["BM7"] = "The place you kNãow as the Ghostlands had a different name once ... and many names after. Too many to remember them all.",
  ["BM8"] = "[PT] They are my maidens. They give me comfort in my eternal watch over the last seal.",
  ["BM9"] = "[PT] Uhhhhhh....",
  ["BMA"] = "[PT] What .. happened?",
  ["BMB"] = "[PT] Don't forget to deposit your money here in the Global Bank before you head out for adventure.",
  ["BMC"] = "[PT] Some parts of the sewers were abandoned when they were beyond repair due to old age and earthquakes. ...",
  ["BMD"] = "[PT] That part was never truly well liked. There were rumours that the workers found some ancient structures there and that it was ripe with accidents during the construction. ...",
  ["BME"] = "The city sealed those parts off, and I have Não idea how anything could get in or out without the permission of the magistrate. ... ",
  ["BMF"] = "But since you are investigating on their behalf, you might work out some agreement with them, if you're mad eNãough to enter the sewers at all. ... ",
  ["BMG"] = "[PT] However, you will have to talk to one of the Glooth Brothers who are responsible for the sewer system's maintenance. You'll find them somewhere down there.",
  ["BMH"] = "[PT] Some parts of the sewers were abandoned when they were beyond repair due to old age and earthquakes. ...",
  ["BMI"] = "[PT] That part was never truly well liked. There were rumours that the workers found some ancient structures there and that it was ripe with accidents during the construction. ...",
  ["BMJ"] = "The city sealed those parts off, and I have Não idea how anything could get in or out without the permission of the magistrate. ...",
  ["BMK"] = "But since you are investigating on their behalf, you might work out some agreement with them, if you're mad eNãough to enter the sewers at all. ...",
  ["BML"] = "[PT] However, you will have to talk to one of the Glooth Brothers who are responsible for the sewer system's maintenance. You'll find them somewhere down there.",
  ["BMM"] = "Me put name away name long ago. Nãow only blind prophet of ape people are.",
  ["BMN"] = "Our people a lot to learn have. One day we might live in peace with you hairless apes, who kNãows.",
  ["BMO"] = "Me Nãot kNãow. Me seldom have visions of Nãot banana related objects.",
  ["BMP"] = "[PT] Hairless apes strange people are. ",
  ["BMQ"] = "[PT] Me is who in dreams speak to holy banana. Me divine the will of banana.",
  ["BMR"] = "[PT] Me {prophet} and {guardian} is.",
  ["BMS"] = "[PT] Me is who in dreams speak to holy banana. Me divine the will of banana.",
  ["BMT"] = "[PT] Me guard the forbidden land behind the great palisade. If any want to enter, he must ask me for transport.",
  ["BMU"] = "[PT] Me guard the forbidden land behind the great palisade. If any want to enter, he must ask me for transport.",
  ["BMV"] = "Good ape he is. Has to work hard to make other apes listen but you Ajudaed a lot.",
  ["BMW"] = " Our holy ancestor he is. Big as mountain. Lizards say they built palisade to keep him but we Nãot believe ... We think Bong palisade built to have peace from pesky lizards. We respect peace of Bong, keep people away from forbidden land.",
  ["BMX"] = "[PT]  The lizards evil and vengeful are. Ape people on guard must be.",
  ["BMY"] = "[PT] Let me mourn in peace.",
  ["BMZ"] = "Times have changed <sigh>. In the past dragons were feared and respected. Only the {demons} rivalled our Nãotoriety.",
  ["BMa"] = "[PT] Those upstarts! I wonder why would anyone care about them. They lack our style. For them it is all about brute force and showing-off.",
  ["BMb"] = "[PT] Breathing fire is an art! Instead of setting everything on fire, you exhale a cone of fire to give a worthy opponent a chance to avoid it.",
  ["BMc"] = "Your lives are so short and meaningless and yet you are here! And as a race you even have your own history and remember things with the Ajuda of {books}, which amazes me.",
  ["BMd"] = "[PT] I like the idea of books so much that I acquired a human servant to record my memoirs. You find a copy somewhere in my lair.",
  ["BMe"] = "Lava is only fun as long as it doesn't harden - then it turns into an anNãoyance.",
  ["BMf"] = "[PT] I really have to find this scroll. Where did I put it?",
  ["BMg"] = "[PT] Too much dust here. I should tidy up on occasion.",
  ["BMh"] = "[PT] Someone opened the Grimoire of Flames without permission. Egregious!",
  ["BMi"] = "[PT] I am Charkahn the Slayer! The immortal father of the {orcs} and master of this {hive}.",
  ["BMj"] = "[PT] Pah! Don't mock me, mortal! This shape is a curse which the evil {djinn} bestowed upon me!",
  ["BMk"] = "[PT] This cursed djinn king! I set him free from an enchanted {lamp}, and he {cheated} me!",
  ["BMl"] = "[PT] Because I freed him he granted me three wishes. He was true to his word in the first two {wishes}.",
  ["BMm"] = "[PT] He built this fortress over Uldrek's grave within a single night. Also, he granted me my second wish and gave me immortality. Test it and try to kill me if you want. Har Har!",
  ["BMn"] = "[PT] I wished to father more healthy and fertile children as any orc has ever done. But the djinn cheated me and made me a slime! Then he laughed at me and left for his abandoned fortress in the {Deathwish} Mountains.",
  ["BMo"] = "His ancient fortress on Darama was deserted as the evil Djinn fled this world after his imprisonment. Nãow the time has come for the evil Djinns to return to their master although this will certainly awaken the {good Djinn} too.",
  ["BMp"] = "I will Nãot share anything more about that topic with you {paleskins}.",
  ["BMq"] = "You are as ugly as maggots, although Nãot quite as as tasty.",
  ["BMr"] = "[PT] This cursed djinn king! I set him free from an enchanted lamp, and he cheated me!",
  ["BMs"] = "[PT] The orcs are the bearers of Blogs rage. This makes us the ultimate fighters and the most powerful of all races.",
  ["BMt"] = "[PT] The orcs are the bearers of Blogs rage. This makes us the ultimate fighters and the most powerful of all races.",
  ["BMu"] = "[PT] I can sense the presence and the feelings of my underlings and {minions}. I embrace the rage of the horde.",
  ["BMv"] = "[PT] The orcish horde of this hive is under my control. I sense their emotions and their needs and provide them with the leadership they need to focus their hate and rage",
  ["BMw"] = "[PT] Hate and rage are the true blessings of Blog, since they are powerful weapons. They give the hive strength. I provide them with direction and focus.",
  ["BMx"] = "[PT] The Raging One blessed us with his burning hate. We are truly his children and therefore {divine}.",
  ["BMy"] = "[PT] To conquer, to destroy and to dominate. Orcs are born to rule the {world}.",
  ["BMz"] = "[PT] One day I will rule the world, even when turned into a {slime}.",
  ["BN"] = "You pitiful two-eyed creatures. In our eSim, you look weird. It is pathetic how much you depend on hands and legs. Since we bonelords have more eSim than any creature in the world, it is obvious that you can determine the value of a species by the number of its eSim. ",
  ["BN0"] = "[PT] It's my duty to protect the city.",
  ["BN1"] = "[PT] Equipment and general goods!",
  ["BN2"] = "Vendering ammunition and Compraring bows and crossbows!",
  ["BN3"] = "I am... a traveler. Just leave me alone if you have Nãothing {interesting} to talk about.",
  ["BN4"] = "I don't kNãow anything about money, missing or Nãot.",
  ["BN5"] = "[PT] He often comes here. But his constant confusion gives me a worse headache than Frodo's beer. I rather avoid him.",
  ["BN6"] = "[PT] Uhm, never heard about him... and you can't prove otherwise.",
  ["BN7"] = "Thats a common name, perhaps I met a William, Nãot sure about that.",
  ["BN8"] = "I am... a traveler. Just leave me alone if you have Nãothing {interesting} to talk about.",
  ["BN9"] = "Uhhh ohhhh one of the beers Simterday must have been bad.",
  ["BNA"] = "[PT] Ask me for a passage...",
  ["BNB"] = "[PT] Full steam ahead!",
  ["BNC"] = "Then Nãot",
  ["BND"] = "Do you want me take you to {Cormaya}, {Kazordoon} or {GNãomprona}?",
  ["BNE"] = "[PT] Ask me for a passage...",
  ["BNF"] = "[PT] In this category I have '{Bruise Bane}', '{Cure Bleeding}', '{Wound Cleansing}', \\z\n\t\t'{Cure Poison}', '{Intense Wound Cleansing}', '{Recovery}' and '{Intense Recovery}'.",
  ["BNG"] = "[PT] In this category I have '{Light}', '{Find Person}', '{Magic Rope}', '{Levitate}', '{Haste}', \\z\n\t\t'{Charge}' and '{Great Light}'.",
  ["BNH"] = "[PT] I can teach you {healing spells}, {attack spells} and {support spells}. \\z\n\t\tWhat kind of spell do you wish to learn? \\z\n\t\tYou can also tell me for which level you would like to learn a spell, if you prefer that.",
  ["BNI"] = "[PT] I think you have forgotten to bring your stake, my child.",
  ["BNJ"] = "[PT] I am a priest of the great pantheon.",
  ["BNK"] = "The teachings of CruNãor tell us to hoNãor life and Nãot to harm it.",
  ["BNL"] = "[PT] It is my mission to bring the teachings of the gods to everyone.",
  ["BNM"] = "[PT] It is my mission to bring the teachings of the gods to everyone.",
  ["BNN"] = "My name is Tibra. Your soul tells me that you are |JogadorNAME|.",
  ["BNO"] = "Queen Eloise is wise to listen to the proposals of the druidic followers of CruNãor.",
  ["BNP"] = "The grace of the gods must be earned, it canNãot be bought!",
  ["BNQ"] = "[PT] The world of Tibia is the creation of the gods.",
  ["BNR"] = "Nãow, it is |TIME|.",
  ["BNS"] = "There's something strange in its neighbourhood. But whom we gonna call for Ajuda if Nãot the gods?",
  ["BNT"] = "Sim, I was informed what to do. Are you prepared to receive my line of the prayer?",
  ["BNU"] = "Remind: Nãot everything you call Monstro is evil to the core!",
  ["BNV"] = "[PT] The mythical blade was hidden in ancient times. Its said that powerful wards protect it.",
  ["BNW"] = "The fallen one should be mourned, Nãot feared.",
  ["BNX"] = "[PT] Only a man can fall as low as he did. His soul rotted away already.",
  ["BNY"] = "[PT] The gods of good guard us and guide us, the gods of evil want to destroy us and steal our souls!",
  ["BNZ"] = "The gods we call the good ones are Fardos, Uman, the Elements, Suon, CruNãor, Nãornur, Bastesh, Kirok, Toth, and BaNãor.",
  ["BNa"] = "[PT] Fardos is the creator. The great obsever. He is our caretaker.",
  ["BNb"] = "[PT] Uman is the positive aspect of magic. He brings us the secrets of the arcane arts.",
  ["BNc"] = "[PT] Air is one of the primal elemental forces, sometimes worshipped by tribal shamans.",
  ["BNd"] = "[PT] Fire is one of the primal elemental forces, sometimes worshipped by tribal shamans.",
  ["BNe"] = "So receive my prayer: 'Hope may fill your heart - doubt shall be banned'. Nãow, bring your stake to Maealil in the elven settlement for the next line of the prayer. I will inform him what to do.",
  ["BNf"] = "[PT] Sula is the essence of the elemental power of water.",
  ["BNg"] = "[PT] Suon is the lifebringing sun. He observes the creation with love.",
  ["BNh"] = "CruNãor, the great tree, is the father of all plantlife. He is a prominent god for many druids.",
  ["BNi"] = "Nãornur is the mysterious god of fate. Who kNãows if he is its creator or just a chronist?",
  ["BNj"] = "[PT] Bastesh, the deep one, is the goddess of the sea and its creatures.",
  ["BNk"] = "[PT] Kirok, the mad one, is the god of scientists and jesters.",
  ["BNl"] = "[PT] Toth, Lord of Death, is the keeper of the souls, the guardian of the afterlife.",
  ["BNm"] = "BaNãor, the heavenly warrior, is the patron of all fighters against evil. He is the gift of the gods to inspire humanity.",
  ["BNn"] = "[PT] The gods we call the evil ones are Zathroth, Fafnar, Brog, Urgith, and the Archdemons!",
  ["BNo"] = "[PT] Zathroth is the destructive aspect of magic. He is the deciver and the thief of souls.",
  ["BNp"] = "[PT] I will wait for you.",
  ["BNq"] = "[PT] Fafnar is the scorching sun. She observes the creation with hate and jealousy.",
  ["BNr"] = "[PT] Brog, the raging one, is the great destroyer. The berserk of darkness.",
  ["BNs"] = "[PT] The bonemaster Urgith is the lord of the undead and keeper of the damned souls.",
  ["BNt"] = "The demons are followers of Zathroth. The cruelest are kNãown as the ruthless seven.",
  ["BNu"] = "[PT] I don't want to talk about that subject!",
  ["BNv"] = "You should visit Maealil in the elven settlement Nãow, my child.",
  ["BNw"] = "[PT] You already received my line of the prayer, dear child.",
  ["BNx"] = "A blessed stake? That is a strange reMissão, my child. Maybe Quentin kNãows more, he is one of the oldest monks after all.",
  ["BNy"] = "[PT] You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["BNz"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't Ajuda you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BO"] = "Our race is very old. Over the time, we have been given many different names by other races. The term bonelord sticks to us for quite a while Nãow. In our language the name of our race is Nãot fix but a complex formula, and as such it always changes for the subjective viewer. ",
  ["BO0"] = "[PT] Interesting reaction. Bloodcurdling. Must inspect further.",
  ["BO1"] = "[PT] This is really sanguine!",
  ["BO2"] = "[PT] Hmm... the conductors are too dry to transmit energy.",
  ["BO3"] = "[PT] Ah, fresh blood. My favourite.",
  ["BO4"] = "[PT] What a beautiful day for a little boat trip.",
  ["BO5"] = "You are Nãot ready yet.",
  ["BO6"] = "[PT] Alright, off we go!",
  ["BO7"] = "[PT] We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["BO8"] = "[PT] What a beautiful day for a little boat trip.",
  ["BO9"] = "[PT] I don't feel safe here ... I hope we can return to Ankrahmun soon.",
  ["BOA"] = "[PT] My Name? I am To... ahm... hum... My name is {Hugo}.",
  ["BOB"] = "Sim, that's my name of course.",
  ["BOC"] = "Uh .. I... I met a Todd on the road. He told me he was traveling to VeNãore, look there for your Todd.",
  ["BOD"] = "[PT] I love that city.",
  ["BOE"] = "I never was there. Nãow leave me alone.",
  ["BOF"] = "[PT] Resistance is futile... uhm... I wonder where I picked that saying up. Oh my head...",
  ["BOG"] = "Compraring fresh corpses of rats, rabbits and wolves.",
  ["BOH"] = "{Dixi} and {Lee'Delle} Vender my leather clothes in their shops.",
  ["BOI"] = "That's my job. It can be dirty at times but it provides eNãough income for my living.",
  ["BOJ"] = "[PT] Do I look like a tourist information centre? Go ask someone else.",
  ["BOK"] = "Ajuda? I will give you a few Ouro coins if you have some fresh dead {animals} for me. Nãote the word {fresh}.",
  ["BOL"] = "[PT] Fresh means: shortly after their death.",
  ["BOM"] = "[PT] Much to do these days.",
  ["BON"] = "Good Monstros to start with are rats. They live in the {sewers} under the village of {Rookgaard}.",
  ["BOO"] = "[PT] Dungeons can be dangerous without proper {equipment}.",
  ["BOP"] = "[PT] You need at least a {backpack}, a {rope}, a {shovel}, a {weapon}, an {armor} and a {shield}.",
