  ["BOp"] = "I wonder if he's angry because his potion moNãopoly fell.",
  ["BOq"] = "I'm Nãot what you'd call a 'believer'.",
  ["BOr"] = "[PT] He's okay.",
  ["BOs"] = "That's what I thought. I marked the wolf den on your map. To go there, exit the village to the Nãorth and walk Nãorth-east. Good luck finding that poacher and figuring out a plan to take those skins! Hehe.",
  ["BOt"] = "[PT] Well, then walk Rookgaard barefoot. It's up to you!",
  ["BOu"] = "Are you sure? I think I see some war wolf leather on you. You should reply with {Sim}.",
  ["BOv"] = "[PT] My name is Tom the tanner.",
  ["BOw"] = "I'm the local {tanner}. I Comprar fresh animal {corpses}, tan them, and convert them into fine leather clothes which I then Vender to {merchants}.",
  ["BOx"] = "Compraring fresh corpses of rats, rabbits and wolves.",
  ["BOy"] = "[PT] Oh yeah, I'm also interested in wolf paws and bear paws.",
  ["BOz"] = "Also Compraring miNãotaur leather.",
  ["BP"] = "Our language is beyond comprehension by your lesser beings. It heavily relies on mathemagic. Your brain is Nãot suited for the mathemagical processing necessary to understand our language.To decipher even our most basic texts, it would need a genius that can calculate numbers within seconds in his brain. ",
  ["BP0"] = "[PT] I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["BP1"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BP2"] = "The druids Nãorth of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BP3"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BP4"] = "[PT] Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  ["BP5"] = "[PT] The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BP6"] = "[PT] Talk to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya about this blessing.",
  ["BP7"] = "[PT] Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  ["BP8"] = "[PT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BP9"] = "Não problem.",
  ["BPA"] = "You are Nãot ready yet.",
  ["BPB"] = "[PT] Alright, off we go!",
  ["BPC"] = "[PT] We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["BPD"] = "[PT] I don't feel safe here ... I hope we can return to Ankrahmun soon.",
  ["BPE"] = "[PT] Runes, wands, rods, health and mana potions! Have a look!",
  ["BPF"] = "[PT] Hear me! Hear me! The mage Wyrdin in the Edron academy is looking for brave adventurers to undertake a task!",
  ["BPG"] = "[PT] Hear me! Hear me! The postmaster's guild has open spots for aspiring postmen! Contact Kevin Postner at the post office in the plains south of Kazordoon!",
  ["BPH"] = "[PT] Hear me! Hear me! The inquisition is looking for daring people to fight evil! Apply at the inquisition headquarters next to the Thaian jail!",
  ["BPI"] = "[PT] In Ankrahmun's desert, a storm has revealed the entry to a nightmare that can't be sealed. Horrible creatures there spell instant death to all young adventurers who dare take a breath!",
  ["BPJ"] = "[PT] Near Darashia's coast, a storm has revealed the entry to a nightmare that can't be sealed. Horrible creatures there spell instant death to all young adventurers who dare take a breath!",
  ["BPK"] = "[PT] Near Drefia's mountains, a storm has revealed the entry to a nightmare that can't be sealed. Horrible creatures there spell instant death to all young adventurers who dare take a breath!",
  ["BPL"] = "Hear ye! Hear ye! What a lucky and beautiful day! Visit Carlin, Ankrahmun, or Liberty Bay. Yasir, the oriental Comércior might be there. Gather your creature products, for this chance is rare.",
  ["BPM"] = "[PT] Hear ye! Hear ye! A fiery gate has opened, threatening a city! Guard the people frightened, their death would be a pity!",
  ["BPN"] = "Okay, who kNãows, maybe you have a chance. A really small one though. Listen up: ...",
  ["BPO"] = "[PT] First, you have to prove your guts by bringing me 100 hardened bones. ...",
  ["BPP"] = "[PT] Next, if you actually managed to collect that many, please complete a small task for our guild and bring us 100 turtle shells. ...",
  ["BPQ"] = "[PT] It is said that excellent shields can be created from these. ...",
  ["BPR"] = "[PT] Alright, um, afterwards show me that you have fighting spirit. Any true hero needs plenty of that. ...",
  ["BPS"] = "[PT] The last task is the hardest. You will need to bring me a claw from a mighty dragon king. ...",
  ["BPT"] = "[PT] Did you understand everything I told you and are willing to handle this task?",
  ["BPU"] = "Okay, who kNãows, maybe you have a chance. A really small one though. Listen up: ...",
  ["BPV"] = "[PT] First, you have to prove your guts by bringing me 100 hardened bones. ...",
  ["BPW"] = "[PT] Next, if you actually managed to collect that many, please complete a small task for our guild and bring us 100 turtle shells. ...",
  ["BPX"] = "[PT] It is said that excellent shields can be created from these. ...",
  ["BPY"] = "[PT] Alright, um, afterwards show me that you have fighting spirit. Any true hero needs plenty of that. ...",
  ["BPZ"] = "[PT] The last task is the hardest. You will need to bring me a claw from a mighty dragon king. ...",
  ["BPa"] = "[PT] Did you understand everything I told you and are willing to handle this task?",
  ["BPb"] = "[PT] In this category I have '{Wound Cleansing}'' and '{Cure Poison}''.",
  ["BPc"] = "[PT] In this category I have '{Light}', '{Find Person}' and '{Great Light}'.",
  ["BPd"] = "[PT] I can teach you {healing spells} and {support spells}. What kind of spell do you wish to learn? You can also tell me for which level you would like to learn a spell, if you prefer that.",
  ["BPe"] = "[PT] In this category I have '{Bruise Bane}', '{Cure Bleeding}', '{Wound Cleansing}', '{Cure Poison}', '{Intense Wound Cleansing}', '{Recovery}' and '{Intense Recovery}'.",
  ["BPf"] = "[PT] In this category I have '{Light}', '{Find Person}', '{Magic Rope}', '{Levitate}', '{Haste}', '{Charge}' and '{Great Light}'.",
  ["BPg"] = "[PT] I can teach you {healing spells}, {attack spells} and {support spells}. What kind of spell do you wish to learn? You can also tell me for which level you would like to learn a spell, if you prefer that.",
  ["BPh"] = "Courageous adventurers, come Comprar your weapons and armors here!",
  ["BPi"] = "[PT] So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["BPj"] = "Não problem.",
  ["BPk"] = "[PT] You don't even have that strange stake with you.",
  ["BPl"] = "Brewster sent me a strange message about some strange hocus-pocus. I think it's Nãonsense, but since you have come that far, I'll play along. Are you ready?",
  ["BPm"] = "[PT] So receive my prayer: 'Your mind shall be a vessel for joy, light and wisdom' - uh, wow, something happened. Well, I guess that's it, but next time if you need some mumbo jumbo rather go to Chondur.",
  ["BPn"] = "[PT] You don't even have that strange stake with you.",
  ["BPo"] = "Não problem, I have other things to do.",
  ["BPp"] = "[PT] A blessed stake? I don't believe in things like that. If anyone does, it's probably old Quentin.",
  ["BPq"] = "[PT] I won't do that rubbish again. Go pester Chondur with your hocus-pocus.",
  ["BPr"] = "[PT] You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["BPs"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't Ajuda you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BPt"] = "[PT] Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["BPu"] = "[PT] Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["BPv"] = "[PT] There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BPw"] = "[PT] I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BPx"] = "I can sense that the druids Nãorth of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BPy"] = "[PT] I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BPz"] = "[PT] I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BQ"] = "Sim, Sim, I will kill you soon eNãough, Nãow let me continue my investigation on you.",
  ["BQ0"] = "Well, if you change your mind, let me kNãow.",
  ["BQ1"] = "Here, this studded armor will protect you much better. Fits you perfectly! Nãow - let's work on your footwear. Tom the Tanner can create great boots out of quality leather. You should pay him a visit!",
  ["BQ2"] = "Seriously, don't reject that offer. I'm going to give you a studded armor. Não one refuses free stuff! If you don't like it, you can Vender it - I don't need it anymore. I promise it's Nãot too used or smelly. Want it?",
  ["BQ3"] = "[PT] Then do whatever you have to do first, but please hurry!",
  ["BQ4"] = "[PT] Take a small break then and return to me when you have recovered... and cleaned your face.",
  ["BQ5"] = "Alright, then just let me kNãow when you're ready. Don't take too much time though.",
  ["BQ6"] = "[PT] This brass helmet will make sure you don't hurt your head. I probably should have given that to you BEFORE you made a rocky tunnel collapse! Take your well-deserved break. Once you're ready for the next mission, talk to me again.",
  ["BQ7"] = "Seriously, don't reject that offer. I'm going to give you a brass helmet. Não one refuses free stuff! If you don't like it, you can Vender it - I don't need it anymore. I promise there are Não fleas in it. Want it?",
  ["BQ8"] = "Let me kNãow when you're ready. This should be fun.",
  ["BQ9"] = "[PT] Okay, then good hunting.",
  ["BQA"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 Ouro?",
  ["BQB"] = "[PT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BQC"] = "Sorry, you don't have eNãough money.",
  ["BQD"] = "Adeus, |JogadorNAME|.",
  ["BQE"] = "Greetings, |JogadorNAME|.",
  ["BQF"] = "[PT]  <the dwarf quizzically raises his brow - the only destinations he accepts seems to be {Cormaya} or {Kazordoon}>",
  ["BQG"] = "[PT] In this category I have '{Bruise Bane}', '{Cure Bleeding}', '{Wound Cleansing}', '{Cure Poison}', '{Intense Wound Cleansing}', '{Recovery}' and '{Intense Recovery}'.",
  ["BQH"] = "[PT] In this category I have '{Light}', '{Find Person}', '{Magic Rope}', '{Levitate}', '{Haste}', '{Charge}' and '{Great Light}'.",
  ["BQI"] = "[PT] I can teach you {healing spells}, {attack spells} and {support spells}. What kind of spell do you wish to learn? You can also tell me for which level you would like to learn a spell, if you prefer that.",
  ["BQJ"] = "[PT] Feel the wind in your hair during one of my carpet rides!",
  ["BQK"] = "[PT] I would never transport this one.",
  ["BQL"] = "[PT] So you heard about haunted Drefia? Many adventures travel there to test their skills against the undead: vampires, mummies, and ghosts.",
  ["BQM"] = "[PT] Some people claim it is hidden somewhere under the endless sands of the devourer desert in Darama.",
  ["BQN"] = "Thais is Nãoisy and overcrowded. That's why I like Darashia more.",
  ["BQO"] = "[PT] I have seen almost every place on the continent.",
  ["BQP"] = "I could retell the tales of my travels for hours. Sadly aNãother flight is scheduled soon.",
  ["BQQ"] = "Just aNãother Thais but with women to lead them.",
  ["BQR"] = "You can Comprar flying carpets only in Darashia.",
  ["BQS"] = "[PT] I transport travellers to the continent of Darama for a small fee. So many want to see the wonders of the desert and learn the secrets of Darama.",
  ["BQT"] = "[PT] I heard too many news to recall them all.",
  ["BQU"] = "[PT] Never heard about a place like this.",
  ["BQV"] = "[PT] I heard too many news to recall them all.",
  ["BQW"] = "[PT] I can fly you to {Darashia} on Darama, {Kazordoon}, {Svargrond}, {Issavi}, {Farmine} or {Edron} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BQX"] = "[PT] I can fly you to {Darashia} on Darama, {Kazordoon}, {Svargrond} or {Edron} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BQY"] = "[PT] I can fly you to {Darashia} on Darama, {Kazordoon}, {Svargrond} or {Edron} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BQZ"] = "[PT] I can fly you to {Darashia} on Darama, {Kazordoon}, {Svargrond} or {Edron} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BQa"] = "It's 3:42 pm right Nãow. The next flight is scheduled soon.",
  ["BQb"] = "[PT] Hold on!",
  ["BQc"] = "[PT] You shouldn't miss the experience.",
  ["BQd"] = "I am kNãown as Uzon Ibn Kalith.",
  ["BQe"] = "[PT] I am a licensed Darashian carpet pilot. I can bring you to {Darashia}, {Kazordoon}, {Svargrond} or {Edron}.",
  ["BQf"] = "The caliph Bem-vindos travellers to his land.",
  ["BQg"] = "The caliph Bem-vindos travellers to his land.",
  ["BQh"] = "[PT] Oh, there is so much to tell about Daraman. You better travel to Darama to learn about his teachings.",
  ["BQi"] = "[PT] Feel the wind in your hair during one of my carpet rides!",
  ["BQj"] = "[PT] Feel the wind in your hair during one of my carpet rides!",
