  ["BQl"] = "[PT] Hold on!",
  ["BQm"] = "[PT] You shouldn't miss the experience.",
  ["BQn"] = "I am kNãown as Uzon Ibn Kalith.",
  ["BQo"] = "[PT] I transport travellers to the continent of Darama for a small fee. So many want to see the wonders of the desert and learn the secrets of Darama.",
  ["BQp"] = "[PT] I heard too many news to recall them all.",
  ["BQq"] = "[PT] I heard too many news to recall them all.",
  ["BQr"] = "It's 3:42 pm right Nãow. The next flight is scheduled soon.",
  ["BQs"] = "[PT] Feel the wind in your hair during one of my carpet rides!",
  ["BQt"] = "[PT] Love is beautiful, we are loved.",
  ["BQu"] = "I am kNãown as the saleswoman of love, as a cupid.",
  ["BQv"] = "[PT] Love is beautiful, we are loved.",
  ["BQw"] = "[PT] Im eager for a bath in the lake.",
  ["BQx"] = "[PT] Im interested in shiny precious things, if you have some.",
  ["BQy"] = "Não, you cant have this cloak.",
  ["BQz"] = "Talk to me if you want to Ajuda protecting the village.",
  ["BR"] = "[PT] They will mourn the day they abandoned us.",
  ["BR0"] = "Ah, what the heck.Make sure you kNãow what you want before you bug me.",
  ["BR1"] = "I try out old and new {recipes}. You can Vender all {food} to me.",
  ["BR2"] = "[PT] I'd love to try a banana pie but I lack the {bananas}. If you get me one, I'll reward you.",
  ["BR3"] = "[PT] Which one?",
  ["BR4"] = "[PT] This island would be wonderful if there weren't a constant flood of newcomers.",
  ["BR5"] = "[PT] If I were you, I'd stay here.",
  ["BR6"] = "I kNãow how to spell.",
  ["BR7"] = "[PT] I'm a magician in the kitchen.",
  ["BR8"] = "I'm Nãot in the weapon business, so stop disturbing me.",
  ["BR9"] = "[PT] I'm glad that we don't see many officials here.",
  ["BRA"] = "Rookgaard needs your Ajuda more than ever.",
  ["BRB"] = "[PT] Well done, this bone is exactly what I needed! Great. I have to do some preparations, but as reward for your great work, I have a shiny new weapon for you. Here, would you like to have this sword?",
  ["BRC"] = "[PT] Ah... well, if you lost that bone on the way, that's too bad. I just hope you didn't get hungry and nibbled on it. I wouldn't eat cursed flesh if I were you. Anyway, you can still have this old sword as reward, do you want it?",
  ["BRD"] = "This sword has Ajudaed me in many fierce battles. I hope you can put it to good use. Once you're ready for the next mission, talk to me again.",
  ["BRE"] = "Seriously, don't reject that offer. Just take that sword, it's free. If you don't like it, you can Vender it - I don't need it anymore. I promise there are Não blood stains on it. Want it?",
  ["BRF"] = "Well, then just let me kNãow when you're ready.",
  ["BRG"] = "[PT] Alright. Here is the empty flask to use on a dead wasp. I also marked the wasps' nest on your map. Be careful and don't forget to wear your silver amulet for poison protection!",
  ["BRH"] = "[PT] Should I explain it again?",
  ["BRI"] = "[PT] Oh, but there you have it in your inventory! Yeah, your backpack is a bit of a mess. I understand you overlooked it. Dig deeper!",
  ["BRJ"] = "Não problem. Here's a new one. I can only give you one per hour though, so try Nãot to lose it again this time.",
  ["BRK"] = "[PT] Great, then please find the wasps' nest, kill one and use the empty flask on its dead body.",
  ["BRL"] = "Well, if you change your mind you kNãow where to find me. Remember that if you Ajuda Rookgaard, Rookgaard might be able to Ajuda you.",
  ["BRM"] = "Well, please come back with the poison soon. We won't have much time until KraknakNãork's next attack.",
  ["BRN"] = "[PT] Oh, but you don't carry any - did you lose the flask? I can give you a new empty one, but that will also reset your mission, meaning you have to extract new poison. Would you like that?",
  ["BRO"] = "[PT] Alright. Here is the empty flask to use on a dead wasp. Don't lose it this time!",
  ["BRP"] = "[PT] Great, then please find the wasps' nest, kill one and use the empty flask on its dead body.",
  ["BRQ"] = "[PT] This brass shield is actually brand-new. It's never been used! I hope it will serve you well. Take a small break, regenerate your health, and then talk to me again for your final mission!",
  ["BRR"] = "Seriously, don't reject that offer. Just take that shield, it's free. If you don't like it, you can Vender it - I don't need it anymore. I promise it's really brand-new. Want it?",
  ["BRS"] = "[PT] Rest for a bit, but don't take too much time to come back.",
  ["BRT"] = "[PT] Alright. Talk to me again to continue with your mission, but heed my words!",
