  ["BSu"] = "[PT] <mumbles> So where was I again?",
  ["BSv"] = "[PT] <mumbles> Typical - you can never find a hero when you need one!",
  ["BSw"] = "[PT] <mumbles> Could the bonelord language be the invention of some madman?",
  ["BSx"] = "<mumbles> The curse algorithm of triplex shadowing has to be two times higher than an overcharged naNãoquorx on the peripheral...",
  ["BSy"] = "[PT] Make sure that you have ",
  ["BSz"] = "[PT]  free slot and that you can carry ",
  ["BT"] = "[PT] It's a fine library, isn't it?",
  ["BT0"] = "[PT] Hey mate, up for a game of dice?",
  ["BT1"] = "[PT] So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["BT2"] = "Não problem.",
  ["BT3"] = "[PT] You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["BT4"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't Ajuda you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BT5"] = "[PT] Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["BT6"] = "[PT] There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BT7"] = "[PT] I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BT8"] = "I can sense that the druids Nãorth of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BT9"] = "[PT] I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BTA"] = "The powerful bundle for the strike imbuement consists of 20 protective charms, 25 sabreteeth and 5 vexclaw talons. Would you like to Comprar it for 6 Ouro tokens??",
  ["BTB"] = "The basic bundle for the vampirism imbuement consists of 25 vampire teeth. Would you like to Comprar it for 2 Ouro tokens??",
  ["BTC"] = "The intricate bundle for the strike imbuement consists of 20 protective charms and 25 sabreteeth. Would you like to Comprar it for 4 Ouro tokens??",
  ["BTD"] = "The powerful bundle for the vampirism imbuement consists of 25 vampire teeth, 15 bloody pincers and 5 pieces of dead brain. Would you like to it for 6 Ouro tokens??",
  ["BTE"] = "The basic bundle for the void imbuement consists of 25 rope belts. Would you like to Comprar it for 2 Ouro tokens??",
  ["BTF"] = "The intricate bundle for the void imbuement consists of 25 rope belts and 25 silencer claws. Would you like to Comprar it for 4 Ouro tokens??.",
  ["BTG"] = "[PT] So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["BTH"] = "Não problem.",
  ["BTI"] = "[PT] I think you have forgotten to bring your stake.",
  ["BTJ"] = "Sim, I was informed what to do. Are you prepared to receive my line of the prayer?",
  ["BTK"] = "So receive my prayer: 'Protection will be granted - from dangers at hand'. Nãow, bring your stake to Isimov in the dwarven settlement for the next line of the prayer. I will inform him what to do.",
  ["BTL"] = "[PT] I will wait for you.",
  ["BTM"] = "You should visit Isimov in the dwarven settlement Nãow.",
  ["BTN"] = "[PT] You already received my line of the prayer.",
  ["BTO"] = "A blessed stake? That is a strange reMissão. Maybe Quentin kNãows more, he is one of the oldest monks after all.",
  ["BTP"] = "[PT] You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["BTQ"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't Ajuda you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BTR"] = "[PT] Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["BTS"] = "[PT] Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["BTT"] = "[PT] There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BTU"] = "[PT] I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
