  ["Hl"] = "[PT] He's a fisherman and somehow his hut is always infested with cockroaches.",
  ["Hm"] = "That old hag always finds someone to do her work. I have Não clue how she is doing that.",
  ["Hn"] = "Decent guy. He Venders general equipment such as {ropes}, {shovels} and so on.",
  ["Ho"] = "[PT] She's pretty indeed! I wonder if she likes bearded men.",
  ["Hp"] = "[PT] Gotta love that name.",
  ["Hq"] = "[PT] Don't listen to this old wannabe, I'm the best cook around.",
  ["Hr"] = "[PT] He never leaves the temple. He spends his time caring for those who newly arrive here. You can ask him for a heal if you are badly injured or poisoned.",
  ["Hs"] = "That's {Obi's} granddaughter. She Ajudas him out by Vendering {armors} and {shields}. I think she'll be a beauty when she's grown up.",
  ["Ht"] = "[PT] I never see that guy around.",
  ["Hu"] = "[PT] Her shop is super-duper exclusive. If you're a premium adventurer, check it out in the western part of town. Lotsa nice offers there.",
  ["Hv"] = "Compraring many types of food and ingredients, too!",
  ["Hw"] = "She lives in the very south of this town, Vendering her potions. Sweet - well, sweet-loving girl.",
  ["Hx"] = "[PT] You can find the oracle on the top floor of the {academy}, just above {Seymour}. Go there when you are level 8.",
  ["Hy"] = "[PT] He must have the most boring job there is.",
  ["Hz"] = "[PT] I don't like his headmaster behaviour. Then again, he IS the headmaster of the {academy}.",
  ["I0"] = "I kNãow a lot of Monstro jokes. Just tell me a Monstro's name, come on.",
  ["I1"] = "Bem-vindo, Bem-vindo, step closer!",
  ["I2"] = "[PT] Why are the experienced heroes quicker than others? ... The demons love fast food!",
  ["I3"] = "Where do ghouls Comprar their robes? ... In a boooohtique!",
  ["I4"] = "[PT] Why do dragons breathe fire? ... They ate too many sorcerers in chilli sauce!",
  ["I5"] = "[PT] Why do orcs have green skin? ... They ate at Frodo's!",
  ["I6"] = "How many eSim does a cyclops have? ... One for each IQ point they have!",
  ["I7"] = "[PT] If you believe half the rumours he's spreading, you will get in a lot of trouble.",
  ["I8"] = "If you are a bad jester, you get a chance to visit them Nãow and then.",
  ["I9"] = "What do all little miNãotaurs want to become when they are grown-ups? ... Cowboys, of course!",
  ["IA"] = "[PT] Add one fresh dead rat and stir it well... ",
