  ["IT"] = "Nãow, where was I...",
  ["IU"] = "[PT] Come chat with ol' Bozo!",
  ["IV"] = "[PT] I wonder if they love my water squirt flowers as much as all other plants.",
  ["IW"] = "They are the king's favourites, because they kNãow how to 'bow'.",
  ["IX"] = "Did you Nãotice that old knights have their scars just on their backs?",
  ["IY"] = "[PT] A fitting place for a {jester}. I guess there are worse {jobs} around.",
  ["IZ"] = "Bozo: Nah, Não jests about His Royal Highness.",
  ["Ia"] = "[PT] I rarely leave the castle. It's really stressful to be as popular as me.",
  ["Ib"] = "This castle is my home. A fitting place for a jester and all other fools. Feel Bem-vindo.",
  ["Ic"] = "I'm a jester, Nãot a doctor!",
  ["Id"] = "[PT] My name is Bozo. But it's more than a name, it's a lifestyle for me!",
  ["Ie"] = "[PT] That's me: Bozo, the jester!",
  ["If"] = "Do you kNãow the one with the dragon? Where - and then ... hahahaha! Oh Não, I guess I ruined it.",
  ["Ig"] = "[PT] Ever since the first guild was created, there is a great demand of jesters and fools to join them.",
  ["Ih"] = "Vender? Hmm, I kNãow a little about magic and by chance I can Vender you a truly unusual {weapon}.",
  ["Ii"] = "I kNãow some 'monstrous' jokes!",
  ["Ij"] = "I kNãow the newest jokes in tibia.",
  ["Ik"] = "Obrigado, I'm fine, the gods are with me.",
  ["Il"] = "[PT] Pheeew! That sounds disgusting! Are you a cook at Frodo's?",
  ["Im"] = "[PT] Don't feed the necromants.",
  ["In"] = "Are we talking about Nãoodles?",
  ["Io"] = "Are we talking about Nãoodles?",
  ["Ip"] = "[PT] Hey, the little one is almost as funny as me!",
  ["Iq"] = "The fools' guild? Are you serious? Não, of course Nãot! Hahaha!",
  ["Ir"] = "[PT] Better don't mess with sorcerers!",
  ["Is"] = "[PT] She's pretty but too serious for my taste.",
  ["It"] = "[PT] Humourless old guy! Once, he turned me into a frog for painting his distasteful cave in pink.",
  ["Iu"] = "[PT] A man of steel with a stomach of wax. Never offer him a beer!",
  ["Iv"] = "[PT] He's my baby brother. If you tell him I sent you, he will grant you an extra spell or two.",
  ["Iw"] = "He Venders spell scrolls each day at midnight, but you have to address him that very second.",
  ["Ix"] = "I better make Não jokes about THIS matter.",
  ["Iy"] = "Did you kNãow that he Venders a 'power axe of doom' Nãow? Run and Comprar it, he only has got three in store.",
  ["Iz"] = "[PT] He would make a fine jester, too.",
  ["J0"] = "[PT] So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["J1"] = "Não problem.",
  ["J2"] = "[PT] I think you have forgotten to bring your stake, pilgrim.",
  ["J3"] = "Sim, I have been informed and haven't yet drunk eNãough to forget, so you can count yourself lucky. Are you prepared to <hicks> receive my line of the prayer?",
  ["J4"] = "So receive my prayer: 'Your hand shall be guided - your feet shall walk in <hicks> harmony'. Nãow, take your stake to Tyrias in <hicks> Liberty Bay for the next line of the prayer. I shall let him kNãow what he is to do.",
  ["J5"] = "[PT] I'll wait for you.",
  ["J6"] = "You should visit Tyrias in Liberty Bay Nãow.",
  ["J7"] = "[PT] You have already received my line of the prayer. Don't make me do more work than necessary!",
  ["J8"] = "A blessed stake? That's a <hicks> strange reMissão. Maybe Quentin kNãows more, he is one of the oldest monks after all.",
  ["J9"] = "[PT] You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["JA"] = "[PT] Why do trolls live underground? ... Because there are so many pks on the surface!",
  ["JB"] = "[PT] Why are bonelords so ugly? ... Because their mom and dad were bonelords, too!",
  ["JC"] = "[PT] I wanted to become a sorcerer, too, but I was overqualified!",
