  ["Jr"] = "[PT] Life takes many forms. Plants are a very basic form of life. Its simplicity makes them close to the core of nature.",
  ["Js"] = "[PT] We abandoned the gods a long time ago. A short time after they abandoned us.",
  ["Jt"] = "[PT] They are lost, and if they still exist they are alone in the cold and the darkness.",
  ["Ju"] = "[PT] The Kuridai left the true path and can't see their error. Their way of living may have been suitable in the past, but if they don't come back to us, their path will lead into darkness.",
