  ["Jw"] = "The Cenath forgot as many as they learned. I doubt they find the wisdom they are looking for without the things they neglected in their pursuit of kNãowledge.",
  ["Jx"] = "[PT] I don't claim to understand this creatures but sometimes they are more close to the roots than we are.",
