  ["LK"] = "This is Não funhouse. Leave the miners and their drilling-worms alone and get out! We have already eNãough trouble without you.",
  ["LL"] = "We understand the ways of the earth like Nãobody else.",
  ["LM"] = "I'm a miner, Nãot your mother. Go ask someone else.",
  ["LN"] = "The hideout of the Horned Fox is probably a dangerous if Nãot lethal place for inexperienced adventurers. It is the source of all the {trouble} around here.",
  ["LO"] = "He is a miNãotaur who was kicked out of Mintwallin. He must have some kind of {hideout} nearby.",
  ["LP"] = "This is Nãot an amusement park! Leave the miners and their drilling-worms alone and get out! We've already got eNãough {trouble} without you.",
  ["LQ"] = "[PT] We occasionally come across nasty beasts in the deepest mines.",
  ["LR"] = "[PT] My name is Budrik Deepdigger, Son of Earth, from the Molten Rock.",
  ["LS"] = "[PT] The {Horned Fox} is leading his bandits in sneak attacks and raids on us.",
  ["LT"] = "Salutations, commoner |JogadorNAME|!",
  ["LU"] = "[PT] Our city blends in with the nature surrounding it. Our {druids} take care of that.",
  ["LV"] = "[PT] They are our main magic support and play a major role in our battle {tactics}.",
  ["LW"] = "[PT] Our tactic is to kiss.",
  ["LX"] = "[PT] K.I.S.S.! Keep It Simple, Stupid! Complicated tactics are too easy to be crushed by a twist of fate.",
  ["LY"] = "[PT] Our elite forces are trained by rangers and druids. In the woods they come a close second to elves.",
  ["LZ"] = "[PT] Join what?",
  ["La"] = "[PT] Sorry, we don't recruit foreigners. Maybe you can join if you prove yourself in a mission for the queen.",
  ["Lb"] = "[PT] We are in constant training and in perfect health.",
  ["Lc"] = "[PT] I am the general of the queen's army. I don't have time to explain this concept to you.",
  ["Ld"] = "[PT] Our family has been serving the Carlin army since countless generations!",
  ["Le"] = "[PT] Our family has been serving the Carlin army since countless generations!",
  ["Lf"] = "[PT] She is one of my beloved sisters and serves Carlin as a town guard.",
  ["Lg"] = "HAIL TO QUEEN ELOISE, OUR NãoBLE {LEADER}!",
  ["Lh"] = "[PT] Queen Eloise is a fine leader for our fair town, indeed!",
  ["Li"] = "[PT] The army protects the defenceless males of our {city}. Our elite forces are the {Green Ferrets}.",
  ["Lj"] = "[PT] Behave yourself as long as you are in Carlin, commoner!",
  ["Lk"] = "[PT] I wish I could learn more about this strange world.",
  ["Ll"] = "[PT] Those different cultures are amazing.",
  ["Lm"] = "[PT] What an interesting continent.",
  ["Ln"] = "[PT] The goal is for Canary to be an 'engine', that is, it will be \\z\n\t\t\t\ta server with a 'clean' datapack, with as few things as possible, \\z\n\t\t\t\tthus facilitating development and testing.",
  ["Lo"] = "[PT] This the our discord group link: {https://discordapp.com/invite/3NxYnyV}",
  ["Lp"] = "[PT] The goal is for Canary to be an 'engine', that is, it will be a server with a 'clean' datapack, with as few things as possible, thus facilitating development and testing.",
  ["Lq"] = "[PT] See more on our {discord group}.",
  ["Lr"] = "I can promote you for 20000 Ouro coins. Do you want me to promote you?",
  ["Ls"] = "[PT] Alright then, come back when you are ready.",
  ["Lt"] = "Bem-vindo to the Canary Server!",
  ["Lu"] = "Passages to Carlin, Ab'Dendriel, Edron, VeNãore, Port Hope, Liberty Bay, Yalahar, Roshamuul, Krailos, Oramond and Svargrond.",
  ["Lv"] = "[PT] The Royal Tibia Line connects all seaside towns of Tibia.",
  ["Lw"] = "[PT] The Royal Tibia Line connects all seaside towns of Tibia.",
  ["Lx"] = "[PT] We can transport everything you want.",
  ["Ly"] = "We would like to Bem-vindo you on board.",
  ["Lz"] = "Where do you want to go? To {Carlin}, {Ab'Dendriel}, {VeNãore}, {Port Hope}, {Liberty Bay}, {Svargrond}, {Yalahar}, {Roshamuul}, {Oramond} or {Edron}?",
  ["M0"] = "[PT] She's pretty, isn't she? Will ship you safely to any port. Though a young landlubber such as you should \\z\n\tconsider to travel to Thais first. The travel is for free. Just once though! You have to ask for a {passage}.",
  ["M1"] = "You chose a peaceful world. Nãot much danger from other adventurers. Just beware the Monstros. \\z\n\tWant go there, ask for a {passage}.",
