  ["O9"] = "[PT] Do you want go back to {Liberty Bay}?",
  ["OA"] = "It lets me forget the long years, the lost years. The years I was chasing after THAT Monstro, the sea serpent.",
  ["OB"] = "[PT] Ye, I command 'is ship!",
  ["OC"] = "[PT] Our last ship has been destroyed by the most evil creature of the ocean: the sea serpent. To continue our hunt, I've bought this ship here.",
  ["OD"] = "[PT] Never seen one.",
  ["OE"] = "I'm faithful - I'll catch that Monstro one day. Sim I will, as sure as my name is Captain Haba!!",
