  ["OK"] = "[PT] We aren't even near that location! Wanna swim? Harharhar!",
  ["OL"] = "I kNãow Marvik in Thais. He once Ajudaed me with a furuncle I had on my ...ahh, doesn't matter. He's a nice gran'pa, though!",
  ["OM"] = "My worst enemy is a huge sea serpent. I dunNão when I started to follow it's trail. I'll kill it and if it's the last thing I'll do, I'll kill it!",
