  ["fM"] = "He advices newcomers to Comprar at my store. I love that guy!",
  ["fN"] = "Strong as an ox, could armwrestle a miNãotaur, I bet.",
  ["fO"] = "He owns the magic shop here. But be aware: The prices are eNãormous.",
