  ["fQ"] = "[PT] Magic? Ask a sorcerer or druid about that.",
  ["fR"] = "I am Gorn. My goods are kNãown all over Tibia.",
  ["fS"] = "It is exactly |TIME|. Maybe you want to Comprar a watch?",
  ["fT"] = "[PT] This druids are nice people, you will find them in the east of the town.",
  ["fU"] = "[PT] Even the strong knights need my equipment on their travels though Tibia.",
  ["fV"] = "[PT] You can find him in the sorcerer guild.",
  ["fW"] = "[PT] General goods and paperware for sale!",
  ["fX"] = "[PT] My name is Graubart, captain of the great SeaHawk!",
  ["fY"] = "BruNão is one of the best sailors I kNãow. He is nearly as good as me. *laughs loudly*",
  ["fZ"] = "[PT] Ah, my whole proud: My ship named SeaHawk. We rode out so many stormy nights together. I think I couldn't live without it.",
  ["fa"] = "[PT] Ah, my whole proud: My ship named SeaHawk. We rode out so many stormy nights together. I think I couldn't live without it.",
  ["fb"] = "I'm a merchant. I sail all over the world with my ship and Comércio with many different races!",
  ["fc"] = "A merchant is someone who Comércios goods with other people and tries to make a little profit. *laughs*",
  ["fd"] = "I Comércio nearly everything, for example weapons, food, water, and even magic runes.",
  ["fe"] = "You kNãow; elves, dwarfs, lizardmen, miNãotaurs and many others.",
  ["ff"] = "[PT] Sorry, sold out.",
  ["fg"] = "Pssst. Marlene is Nãot near right Nãow...? You kNãow... she is a lovely woman, but she talks too much! So I always try to keep distance from her because she can't stop talking.",
  ["fh"] = "[PT] Well then, listen closely. First, you will have to prove that you are a fierce and restless warrior by bringing me 100 perfect behemoth fangs. ...",
  ["fi"] = "[PT] Secondly, please retrieve a helmet for us which has been lost a long time ago. The famous Ramsay the Reckless wore it when exploring an ape settlement. ...",
  ["fj"] = "[PT] Third, we need a new flask of warrior's sweat. We've run out of it recently, but we need a small amount for the show battles in our arena. ...",
  ["fk"] = "Lastly, I will have our smith refine your helmet if you bring me royal steel, an especially Nãoble metal. ...",
  ["fl"] = "[PT] Did you understand everything I told you and are willing to handle this task?",
  ["fm"] = "[PT] Well then, listen closely. First, you will have to prove that you are a fierce and restless warrior by bringing me 100 perfect behemoth fangs. ...",
  ["fn"] = "[PT] Secondly, please retrieve a helmet for us which has been lost a long time ago. The famous Ramsay the Reckless wore it when exploring an ape settlement. ...",
  ["fo"] = "[PT] Third, we need a new flask of warrior's sweat. We've run out of it recently, but we need a small amount for the show battles in our arena. ...",
  ["fp"] = "Lastly, I will have our smith refine your helmet if you bring me royal steel, an especially Nãoble metal. ...",
  ["fq"] = "[PT] Did you understand everything I told you and are willing to handle this task?",
  ["fr"] = "[PT] Gather around me, young knights! I'm going to teach you some spells!",
  ["fs"] = "Beautiful Tibia. And with our Ajuda everyone is save.",
  ["ft"] = "[PT] It is time to join the Knights!",
  ["fu"] = "Knights are the warriors of Tibia. Without us, Não one would be safe. Every brave and strong man or woman can join us.",
  ["fv"] = "[PT] Some day someone will make something happen to him...",
  ["fw"] = "A bow might be a fine weapon for someone Nãot strong eNãough to wield a REAL weapon.",
  ["fx"] = "[PT] I and my students often share a cask of beer or wine at Frodo's hut.",
  ["fy"] = "[PT] Always concerned with his profit. What a loss! He was adventuring with baxter in the old days.",
  ["fz"] = "[PT] He was an adventurer once.",
  ["g0"] = "The temple is just Nãorth west of the depot. You can't miss it.",
  ["g1"] = "[PT] Jefrey, our bank clerk, can be found inside the depot. Easy to find.",
  ["g2"] = "You can Comprar weapons, armor, tools, gems, magical equipment, furniture and food here.",
  ["g3"] = "[PT] The depot is a place where you can safely store your belongings. You are also protected against attacks there. I escort newcomers there.",
  ["g4"] = "I'm informed about the status the world is in. If you have Missãoions, let me kNãow.",
  ["g5"] = "Need some Ajuda finding your way through Liberty Bay? Let me assist you.",
  ["g6"] = "[PT] Free escort to the depot for newcomers!",
  ["g7"] = "Olá, is this your first visit to Liberty Bay? I can show you around the town.",
  ["g8"] = "Want to kNãow the status of all the world changes? Ask me.",
  ["g9"] = "[PT] Currently, I can tell you all about the town, its temple, the bank, shops, spell trainers and the depot, as well as about the world status.",
  ["gA"] = "[PT] In this category I have '{Light}', '{Find Person}' and '{Great Light}'.",
  ["gB"] = "[PT] I can teach you {healing spells} and {support spells}. What kind of spell do you wish to learn? You can also tell me for which level you would like to learn a spell, if you prefer that.",
  ["gC"] = "[PT] I am the first knight. I trained some of the greatest heroes of Tibia.",
  ["gD"] = "[PT] Of course, you heard of them. Knights are the best fighters in Tibia.",
  ["gE"] = "[PT] Hail to our King!",
  ["gF"] = "You are joking, eh? Of course, you kNãow me. I am Gregor, the first knight.",
  ["gG"] = "[PT] A great name, isn't it?",
  ["gH"] = "[PT] Gather around me, young knights! I'm going to teach you some spells!",
  ["gI"] = "[PT] It's my duty to protect the city.",
  ["gJ"] = "[PT] Praised be Suon, the Benevolent King!",
  ["gK"] = "[PT] Free escort to the depot for newcomers!",
  ["gL"] = "[PT] The depot is a place where you can safely store your belongings. You are also protected against attacks there. I escort newcomers there.",
  ["gM"] = "I'll Ajuda you find your way through Carlin, the amazon town. I can mark important locations on your map and give you some information about the town and the world status.",
  ["gN"] = "This city is ruled by Queen Eloise with the Ajuda of her female brigade. We have a lot of shops here as well as the usual facilities like depot, temple and so on.",
  ["gO"] = "[PT] I'm Alexena, at your service!",
