  ["gU"] = "The temple can be found in one of the uptown districts. Look for stairs up from the lower city, you'll find the temple in the Nãorthwest of the upper city.",
  ["gV"] = "[PT] The bank is on the left side of the depot. Eva will be at your service there.",
