  ["gc"] = "Olá, is this your first visit to Darashia? I can show you around a little.",
  ["gd"] = "[PT] I'll show you around Darashia if you like. I can mark important locations on your map and give you some information about the town and the world status.",
  ["ge"] = "[PT] Darashia is an oriental settlement ruled by Caliph Kazzan Ibn Gadral. We have a lot of shops, carpet travel and a rotworm plague, that sums it about up.",
  ["gf"] = "[PT] My name is Behil. Glad to be your guide.",
  ["gg"] = "[PT] I'm well informed about the status of the world despite all the recent changes.",
  ["gh"] = "Need some Ajuda finding your way through Darashia? Let me assist you.",
  ["gi"] = "[PT] Free escort to the depot for newcomers!",
  ["gj"] = "[PT] Currently, I can tell you all about the town, its temple, the bank, shops, spell trainers and the depot, as well as about the world status.",
  ["gk"] = "[PT] The temple is a few floors over the depot. Just walk up the numerous stairs there.",
  ["gl"] = "Muzir takes care of our bank business. His office is in the Nãorth-western part of the caliph's palace.",
  ["gm"] = "You can Comprar weapons, armor, tools, gems, magical equipment, furniture, spells and food here.",
  ["gn"] = "[PT] The depot is a place where you can safely store your belongings. You are also protected against attacks there. I escort newcomers there.",
