  ["gr"] = "[PT] Free escort to the depot for newcomers!",
  ["gs"] = "I'm informed about the status the world is in. If you have Missãoions, let me kNãow.",
  ["gt"] = "[PT] Well, I'm a guide. I can mark important locations on your map and give you some information about the town. I do this for free, but I'm always happy about a small donation if you can spare some money.",
  ["gu"] = "This city has three main districts - a Nãoble district, a merchant district and the slums. The class difference is clearly visible here. Most shops are in the merchant district. There are also large sugarcane plantations.",
  ["gv"] = "I'm Davina. Glad to Ajuda you today.",
