  ["gx"] = "[PT] Free escort to the depot for newcomers!",
  ["gy"] = "Olá, is this your first visit to Liberty Bay? I can show you around the town.",
  ["gz"] = "[PT] Currently, I can tell you all about the town, its temple, the bank, shops, spell trainers and the depot, as well as about the world status.",
  ["h0"] = "[PT] Talk to me if you need directions.",
  ["h1"] = "Olá, is this your first visit to Rathleton? I can show you around a little.",
  ["h2"] = "[PT] Free escort to the depot for newcomers!",
  ["h3"] = "[PT] Free escort to the depot for newcomers!",
  ["h4"] = "[PT] I'm a guide, overworked and underpaid. I can mark important locations on your map and give you some information about the town and the world status.",
  ["h5"] = "[PT] Thais is the oldest settlement in Tibia. You can hear its history whisper when walking through the streets. Beware of criminals, but else it's a fine city.",
  ["h6"] = "I'm Luke. Não jokes, please, I heard them all!",
  ["h7"] = "Olá, is this your first visit to Thais? I can show you around a little.",
  ["h8"] = "Need some Ajuda finding your way through Thais? Let me assist you.",
  ["h9"] = "[PT] Talk to me if you need directions.",
  ["hA"] = "[PT] The temple is just south west of here. Actually, it's a temple raft and the priestess is somewhat... meow... you'll see what I mean.",
  ["hB"] = "Our bank clerk ZNãozel is somewhat... special. You can find him Nãorth of this harbour and then to the right, past the tavern.",
  ["hC"] = "You can Comprar weapons, armor, tools, gems, magical equipment, furniture, spells and food here.",
  ["hD"] = "The depot is a place where you can safely store your belongings. You are also protected against attacks there. I escort newcomers there, but it's just Nãorth of here.",
  ["hE"] = "I'm the only feline guide in Tibia. I might Nãot have fingers anymore, but with my paw I can still mark important locations on your map and give you some information about the town and the world status.",
  ["hF"] = "[PT] Yalahar is a very old city of gigantic size, consisting of a city centre and eight quarters. The beings that are closest to be called rulers of the city are the Yalahari.",
  ["hG"] = "[PT] I'm Jonathan. Pleased to meet you.",
  ["hH"] = "Want to kNãow the status of all the world changes? Ask me.",
  ["hI"] = "[PT] I can inform you about the status of this world, if you're interested.",
  ["hJ"] = "[PT] The depot is a place where you can safely store your belongings. You are also protected against attacks there. I escort newcomers there.",
  ["hK"] = "I will Ajuda you find your way in the buzzing city of VeNãore. I can mark important locations on your map and give you some information about the town and the world status.",
  ["hL"] = "[PT] This trading city has been built directly over a swamp and basically stands on stone pillars. We have many large warehouses here. To speak of 'shops' would be an understatement.",
  ["hM"] = "I'm Elena, sweetheart. I love your name, |JogadorNAME|.",
  ["hN"] = "Olá, is this your first visit to VeNãore? I can show you around a little.",
  ["hO"] = "[PT] Talk to me if you need directions.",
  ["hP"] = "Need some Ajuda finding your way through VeNãore? Let me assist you.",
  ["hQ"] = "[PT] Free escort to the depot for newcomers!",
  ["hR"] = "Currently, I can tell you all about the town, its temple, the bank, shops - well, warehouses - spell trainers and the depot, as well as about the adventurer's guild, hunting grounds, Missãos and the world status.",
  ["hS"] = "The temple is pretty much in the middle of VeNãore. If you go south from this harbour, you can't miss it.",
  ["hT"] = "The bank as well as jewel stores can be found in the House of Wealth, in the Nãorth-eastern part of VeNãore. I can mark it on your map if you want.",
  ["hU"] = "You can Comprar almost everything here! Visit one of our warehouses for weapons, armors, magical equipment, spells, gems, tools, furniture and everything else you can imagine.",
  ["hV"] = "[PT] I can inform you about the status of this world, if you're interested.",
  ["hW"] = "Olá, is this your first visit to VeNãore? I can show you around a little.",
