  ["iB"] = "[PT] The temple is in the centre of Thais. Walk east from the harbour and pass by the {depot} until you reach the infamous crossroads, then turn south.",
  ["iC"] = "[PT] We have two bankers, Suzy and Naji. Naji is right in the depot. For Suzi, exit the {depot} to the west and walk south-west. Don't forget that I can {mark} important locations on your map.",
