  ["jB"] = "I Vender the finest weapons in town. If you'd like to see my offers, ask me for a {Comércio}.",
  ["jC"] = "Me great {wizard}. Me great doctor of {ape people}. Me kNãow many plants. Me old and me have seen many things.",
  ["jD"] = "[PT] We see many things and learning quick. Merlkin magic learn quick, quick. We just watch and learn. Sometimes we try and learn.",
  ["jE"] = "Things Nãot good Nãow. Need Ajudaer to do {mission} for me people.",
  ["jF"] = "[PT] We be {kongra}, {sibang} and {merlkin}. Strange hairless ape people live in city called Port Hope.",
  ["jG"] = "[PT] Kongra verry strong. Kongra verry angry verry fast. Take care when kongra comes. Better climb on highest tree.",
  ["jH"] = "Sibang verry fast and funny. Sibang good gather food. Sibang kNãow {jungle} well.",
  ["jI"] = "[PT] Merlkin we are. Merlkin verry wise, merlkin learn many things quick. Teach other apes things a lot. Making {heal} and making {magic}.",
  ["jJ"] = "[PT] We see many things and learning quick. Merlkin magic learn quick, quick. We just watch and learn. Sometimes we try and learn.",
  ["jK"] = "[PT] Jungle is dangerous. Jungle also provides us food. Take care when in jungle and safe you be.",
  ["jL"] = "What do you want to kNãow? Something about the three different {difficulties}, the {general} rules or the {prices}? Maybe you also want to kNãow what happens when you {die}?",
  ["jM"] = "[PT] Basically you pay me a {fee}, and you are sent into an arena with 10 different stages. If you succeed you will be rewarded accordingly.",
  ["jN"] = "[PT] My job is to explain about the rules and to get the fee from the competitors.",
  ["jO"] = "[PT] Well I would rather call it an {Ultimate Challenge} than a mission.",
  ["jP"] = "There are three difficulties: Greenhorn, Scrapper and Warlord. On each challenge you will be confronted with ten Monstros increasing in strength.",
  ["jQ"] = "There are three difficulties: Greenhorn, Scrapper and Warlord. On each challenge you will be confronted with ten Monstros increasing in strength.",
  ["jR"] = "There are three difficulties: Greenhorn, Scrapper and Warlord. On each challenge you will be confronted with ten Monstros increasing in strength.",
  ["jS"] = "That is the easiest way in our arena. The {fee} is 1000 Ouro. We were setting this up for of our children to challenge some easy Monstros and train them for the future.",
  ["jT"] = "The most common difficulty for us. The {fee} is 5000 Ouro. So if you are experienced in fighting middle class Monstros this is your challenge!",
  ["jU"] = "Only the strongest among us will take this challenge. The {fee} is 10000 Ouro. If you pass that I promise you the respect of all citizens here. You will be a hero!",
  ["jV"] = "The fee is either 1000, 5000 or 10000 Ouro for one try. Remember that if you {die}, it is YOUR problem and you won't be able to get back to your corpse and your backpack.",
  ["jW"] = "It would be better Nãot to die! In every pit there is an emergency exit, the portal to the south. If you die in a pit... well... your corpse and backpack are gone, so you enter the arena at your own risk.",
  ["jX"] = "[PT] Small and deceptively friendly-looking island. Well, I used to study the plants and herbs here for my potions.",
  ["jY"] = "Nãowadays, I leave that to Oressa, she has a better way with that horrible wildlife here. \\z\n\t\t\t\tI prefer to distil potions in the quiet of my lab. \\z\n\t\t\t\tIf you need some potions, runes or other magic equipment, ask for a Comércio.",
  ["jZ"] = "[PT] Small and deceptively friendly-looking island. Well, I used to study the plants and herbs here for my potions.",
  ["ja"] = "Nãowadays, I leave that to Oressa, she has a better way with that horrible wildlife here. I prefer to distil potions in the quiet of my lab. If you need some potions, runes or other magic equipment, ask for a Comércio.",
  ["jb"] = "Dawnport is Nãot far off from the coast of the Tibian Mainland. Lots of cities, Monstros, bandits, brigands, mean folk and people of low understanding with Não sense of respect towards alchemical genius. <mutters to himself>",
  ["jc"] = "Ahem. Once you're level 8, you should be experienced eNãough to choose your definite vocation and leave Dawnport for Main - and Tibia definitely needs more skilled adventurers to keep those Monstros in check which roam our lands!",
  ["jd"] = "I wish I had thought of changing my name to that of a hero. Would have smoothed my way Não end!",
  ["je"] = "Anyway, whatever he was before he joined, Tybald Nãow fits the bill of the legendary hero. He even has a crush on lady Oressa. Cute. <chuckles>",
  ["jf"] = "[PT] That's the spirit!",
  ["jg"] = "[PT] Mana potions to refill your magic power!",
  ["jh"] = "[PT] Hamish MacGuffin, at your disposal.",
  ["ji"] = "I craft highly efficient runes, wands and potions - always handy when you're in a fight against Monstros! \\z\n\t\tAsk me for a Comércio to browse through my stock.",
  ["jj"] = "Nãope. Doesn't sound familiar.",
  ["jk"] = "Never asked about his past. Seems it's a pretty gloomy one. \\z\n\t\tBut he's an excellent blacksmith and seems content eNãough with his work here.",
  ["jl"] = "Inigo taught me a trick or two since I joined Mr Morris' little crowd. \\z\n\t\tQuite a nice old chap who's seen much of the world and kNãows his way around here. \\z\n\t\tYou should definitely ask him if you need Ajuda.",
  ["jm"] = "Can be quite feisty if you doubt his seniorship. \\z\n\t\t<sNãorts> KNãows a thing or two about spells, though. Useful kNãowledge.",
  ["jn"] = "[PT] Keeran? He's a bit like Plunderpurse's shadow, isn't he? \\z\n\t\tLoves numbers, but I believe underneath it all he always wanted to break out of his boring little job in the city.",
  ["jo"] = "Seems good-natured eNãough a guy. Nimble with his hands, be it cooking or carpentering. \\z\n\t\tSeems to want to keep his mind off something, so he's always busy fixing stuff or cooking something up.",
  ["jp"] = "If it wasn't for Mr Morris, maybe Nãone of us would be alive. Or at least, Nãone of us would be here. \\z\n\t\tHe's been everywhere and gathered some adventurers around him to investigate the secrets of Dawnport.",
  ["jq"] = "[PT] Potions! Wands! Runes! Get them here!",
  ["jr"] = "[PT] Our druid, down in the temple. Just appeared out of the blue one day. Keeps to herself. \\z\n\t\tShe must have some reason to stay with us rather than roam the bigger Mainland. Well, we all have our reasons.",
  ["js"] = "Nãow there's someone who has lived life to the full! Don't kNãow though \\z\n\t\twhether I should really believe that he's a clerk Nãow.",
  ["jt"] = "You levelled up but your wand is old? Come and Comprar a new one here!",
  ["ju"] = "[PT] Ran out of mana or a little kablooie? Come to me to resupply!",
  ["jv"] = "[PT] Low on magic and need a little extra? Get yourself a rune!",
  ["jw"] = "Pack of Monstros give you trouble? Throw an area rune at them!",
  ["jx"] = "[PT] Health potions to refill your health in combat!",
  ["jy"] = "[PT] Taking back empty potion flasks! Get your deposit back here!",
  ["jz"] = "[PT] Careful with that! That's a highly reactive potion you have there!",
  ["k0"] = "[PT] The dwarfs are allied with Thais but follow their own obscure religion. Although dwarfs keep mostly to themselves, we have to observe this alliance closely.",
  ["k1"] = "[PT] Those elves are hardly any more civilised than orcs. They can become a threat to mankind at any time.",
  ["k2"] = "[PT] Those elves are hardly any more civilised than orcs. They can become a threat to mankind at any time.",
  ["k3"] = "VeNãore is somewhat difficult to handle. The merchants have a close eye on our activities in their city and our authority is limited there. However, we will use all of our influence to prevent a second Carlin.",
  ["k4"] = "[PT] Oh, this misery...",
  ["k5"] = "Would you like to receive that protection for a sacrifice of |BLESSCOST| Ouro, child?",
  ["k6"] = "[PT] I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["k7"] = "[PT] I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["k8"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["k9"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["kA"] = "[PT] Gems and jewellery! Best prices in town!",
  ["kB"] = "[PT] I am a jeweler. Maybe you want to have a look at my wonderful offers.",
  ["kC"] = "[PT] I am Hanna.",
  ["kD"] = "[PT] Gems and jewellery! Best prices in town!",
  ["kE"] = "Compraring and Vendering all sorts of weapons and armors!",
  ["kF"] = "I am Compraring some weapons and armors.",
  ["kG"] = "Compraring and Vendering all sorts of weapons and armors!",
  ["kH"] = "[PT] So you are saying you're looking for someone to take you to Vengoth?",
  ["kI"] = "[PT] Well, I'm kind of a delivery man I guess. I take on small {transportation} jobs with my boat.",
  ["kJ"] = "[PT] Oh well.",
  ["kK"] = "I could do that, it's Nãot far from here. I don't run a charity organisation, though. Tell you what. Give me 100 Ouro pieces, and me and my boat are yours for the trip. Okay?",
  ["kL"] = "[PT] Okay. Enjoy.",
  ["kM"] = "[PT] Oh well.",
  ["kN"] = "Want me to bring you to Vengoth again for 100 Ouro?",
  ["kO"] = "[PT] Okay. Enjoy.",
  ["kP"] = "[PT] Oh well.",
  ["kQ"] = "I have a {job}, you kNãow?",
  ["kR"] = "[PT] Do you seek a passage to Yalahar for |TRAVELCOST|?",
  ["kS"] = "[PT] Oh well.",
  ["kT"] = "[PT] HAIL TO THE KING!",
  ["kU"] = "[PT] HAIL TO THE KING!",
  ["kV"] = "[PT] MIND YOUR MANNERS COMMONER! To address the king greet with his title!",
  ["kW"] = "[PT] MIND YOUR MANNERS COMMONER! To address the king greet with his title!",
  ["kX"] = "[PT] HAIL TO THE KING!",
  ["kY"] = "[PT] HAIL TO THE KING!",
  ["kZ"] = "[PT] There's a storm brewing.",
  ["ka"] = "Ye' want a passage to the blasted isle, right? {Sim} or {Não}?",
  ["kb"] = "[PT] All Hand Hoy!",
  ["kc"] = "[PT] We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["kd"] = "[PT] There's a storm brewing.",
  ["ke"] = "[PT] There's a storm brewing.",
  ["kf"] = "Ye' want a passage back to cormaya? {Sim} or {Não}.",
  ["kg"] = "[PT] All Hand Hoy!",
  ["kh"] = "[PT] We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["ki"] = "[PT] There's a storm brewing.",
  ["kj"] = "[PT] It's a shame that only a few paladins still use their abilities to further the cause of the gods of good. Too many paladins have become selfish and greedy.",
  ["kk"] = "Drefia used to be a city of sin and heresy, just like Carlin Nãowadays. One day, the gods decided to destroy this town and to erase all evil there.",
  ["kl"] = "[PT] Darashia is a godless town full of mislead fools. One day, it will surely share the fate of its sister town Drefia.",
  ["km"] = "[PT] Demons exist in many different shapes and levels of power. In general, they are servants of the dark gods and command great powers of destruction.",
  ["kn"] = "[PT] Carlin is a city of sin and heresy. After the reunion of Carlin with the kingdom, the inquisition will have much work to purify the city and its inhabitants.",
  ["ko"] = "We can see his evil influence almost everywhere. Keep your eSim open or the dark one will lead you on the wrong way and destroy you.",
  ["kp"] = "The church of CruNãor works closely together with the druid guild. This makes a cooperation sometimes difficult.",
  ["kq"] = "[PT] We owe to the gods of good our creation and continuing existence. If it weren't for them, we would surely fall prey to the minions of the vile and dark gods.",
  ["kr"] = "[PT] The churches of the gods united to fight heresy and dark magic. They are the shield of the true believers, while the inquisition is the sword that fights all enemies of virtuousness.",
  ["ks"] = "The churches of the gods entrusted me with the eNãormous and responsible task to lead the inquisition. I leave the field work to inquisitors who I recruit from fitting people that cross my way.",
  ["kt"] = "[PT] Belive on the gods and they will show you the path.",
  ["ku"] = "Nãowadays, most knights seem to have forgotten the Nãoble cause to which all knights were bound in the past. Only a few have remained pious, serve the gods and follow their teachings.",
  ["kv"] = "[PT] By edict of the churches I'm the Lord Inquisitor.",
  ["kw"] = "[PT] I'm Henricus, the Lord Inquisitor.",
  ["kx"] = "[PT] Those who wield great power have to resist great temptations. We have the burden to eliminate all those who give in to the temptations.",
  ["ky"] = "[PT] The druids here still follow the old rules. Sadly, the druids of Carlin have left the right path in the last years.",
  ["kz"] = "[PT] The dwarfs are allied with Thais but follow their own obscure religion. Although dwarfs keep mostly to themselves, we have to observe this alliance closely.",
  ["l0"] = "[PT] She's actually quite nice.",
  ["l1"] = "She's a druid. Since she started Vendering health potions, people visit me only rarely. Which is a good thing, but of course I'll Ajuda if I'm needed.",
  ["l2"] = "[PT] The oracle will lead you to your {destiny} once you are level 8.",
  ["l3"] = "[PT] I think that guy is new. He's a {bank} clerk.",
  ["l4"] = "[PT] Oh, but I insist! After all you made the long way. Please, take my reward!",
  ["l5"] = "[PT] He has some inner devils that torture him.",
  ["l6"] = "[PT] Tom is the local tanner. That means he always needs fresh corpses or leather.",
  ["l7"] = "[PT] A man of the sword.",
  ["l8"] = "[PT] Well, make some space and then talk to me again. I give you something really useful.",
  ["l9"] = "[PT] Time doesn't matter to me.",
  ["lA"] = "[PT] The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["lB"] = "[PT] Talk to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya about this blessing.",
  ["lC"] = "[PT] So receive the embrace of Tibia, pilgrim.",
  ["lD"] = "[PT] Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["lE"] = "[PT] You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["lF"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't Ajuda you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["lG"] = "[PT] Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["lH"] = "[PT] There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["lI"] = "[PT] I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["lJ"] = "[PT] I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["lK"] = "[PT] I'm just a simple {huntsman}.",
  ["lL"] = "[PT] Sorry, I don't think telling a stranger your name is a smart thing to do.",
  ["lM"] = "Obrigado so much! I'm just too old to walk into the village each day, and the herbs must be fresh. Say, would you like to have a sample of my potions as reward?",
  ["lN"] = "May CruNãor bless you and protect you on your journeys!",
  ["lO"] = "[PT] There are only two other druids on Rookgaard, {Lily} and {Cipfried}.",
  ["lP"] = "[PT] Storage for worldly wealth.",
  ["lQ"] = "Who kNãows what it will be? Only time will show.",
  ["lR"] = "[PT] Thank the gods, I'm fine.",
  ["lS"] = "What Ajuda do you seek? I Vender health potions, ask me for a {Comércio} if you need one.",
  ["lT"] = "I can't teach you magic. On the {mainland} you will learn spells early eNãough.",
  ["lU"] = "[PT] I'm one of the few magic users on this isle. I can sense a follower of the dark path of magic hiding somewhere in the depths of the dungeons.",
  ["lV"] = "It is shaped by the will of the gods, so we don't have to Missãoion it.",
  ["lW"] = "I used to be there with my old friend Cipfried to heal adventurers. After all these years, I prefer solitude Nãow.",
  ["lX"] = "[PT] Well, then I must have mistaken you with someone else. Or did you lose it on the way?",
  ["lY"] = "[PT] Teaching you about the gods would require too much time. But you can always read the books in the {library}.",
  ["lZ"] = "The library is in the {academy}, Nãorth of the {temple}.",
  ["la"] = "[PT] A place to learn about {Tibia}.",
  ["lb"] = "Are you hungry? I'm sorry, I have Não food here.",
  ["lc"] = "Sim, I Vender small health potions. Ask me for a Comércio if you need one.",
  ["ld"] = "[PT] I don't care about kings, queens, and the like.",
  ["le"] = "[PT] I rarely visit the town. It's much better here.",
  ["lf"] = "[PT] There's a huge world waiting for you.",
  ["lg"] = "Most of the so-called Monstros of this isle are only creatures of the gods. There are some beasts that are truly monstrous on the {mainland}.",
  ["lh"] = "Are you hungry? I'm sorry, I have Não food here.",
  ["li"] = "That's too bad... but I'm sure Lily could give you aNãother one. Just walk back and talk to her again.",
  ["lj"] = "[PT] The dungeons are dangerous for inexperienced adventurers.",
  ["lk"] = "Just ask me for a {Comércio} to check out my offers. I have only small health potions for sale, though.",
  ["ll"] = "You'll have to Comprar that from the merchants in town. I'm just a simple druid and healer.",
  ["lm"] = "I'll pay you 5 Ouro for every empty vial and potion flask. Just ask me for a {Comércio}.",
  ["ln"] = "A greedy and anNãoying person just like most people are.",
  ["lo"] = "Nãow she has completely gotten out of her mind.",
  ["lp"] = "[PT] He was a promising young druid when something happened to his mind. It's a sad story.",
  ["lq"] = "[PT] He does a good job out there.",
  ["lr"] = "I kNãow her since she was little.",
  ["ls"] = "[PT] One of these greedy merchants.",
  ["lt"] = "[PT] Alright then. Good luck on your travels.",
  ["lu"] = "[PT] I saw her stranding with her raft.",
  ["lv"] = "[PT] He's a farmer and behaves a little better than his cousin.",
  ["lw"] = "[PT] An unpleasant person.",
  ["lx"] = "[PT] His healing powers equal mine.",
  ["ly"] = "[PT] I think she's under bad influence.",
  ["lz"] = "[PT] That's my name.",
  ["m0"] = "[PT] To do so, open the NPC Chat Channel and click on the empty space below the NPCs dialogue, and start typing. ...",
  ["m1"] = "You can try this out by asking an NPC about their {job}, as this is a keyword most will react to. If you have any other Missãoions, tell me.",
  ["m2"] = "[PT] Every vocation has specific spells that can only be used if you have that vocation. Sorcerers and druids of course rely heavily on spells, while knights only have a few at their disposal. ...",
  ["m3"] = "[PT] As an adventurer in training, you have a few spells at your disposal at the beginning, but more will become available as you progress. ...",
  ["m4"] = "[PT] Once you're level 8, new spells become available upstairs at the spell trainers {Garamond} and {Tybald}. They can tell you more.",
  ["m5"] = "You couldn't have chosen a better time. We really need Ajuda against the Monstros that swarm this island, and the whole world of {Tibia}. If you're unsure on how to {Ajuda} exactly, I can give you directions.",
  ["m6"] = "[PT] Second best thing to a rope - a shovel will reveal secret entrances buried under loose stone piles, or under sand, or earth... you will see! ...",
  ["m7"] = "Shovels can be bought at {Richard}'s, like the other equipment, or food. If you don't have the money yet, go out and kill some {Monstros} outside - and maybe you'll even find a shovel, who kNãows!",
  ["m8"] = "We found the island following a strange glow we saw at night, close before dawn. We were looking for a source of unkNãown, powerful magic, and it seemed that this island was its source. ...",
  ["m9"] = "When we arrived, we found goblins, miNãotaurs, trolls and undead warring on this island. We wondered why. Then they seemed to reach an agreement, and settled down in the caves. We decided to investigate. ...",
  ["mA"] = "[PT] I'm Hyacinth.",
  ["mB"] = "I'm a {druid} and healer, a follower of {CruNãor}.",
  ["mC"] = "I offer quite a lot of food. Ask me for a {Comércio} if you're hungry",
  ["mD"] = "Sorry, you don't have eNãough money",
  ["mE"] = "[PT] You have successfully completed your purchase of the items.",
  ["mF"] = "Olá adventurer, looking for Imbuement items? Just ask me!",
  ["mG"] = "[PT] speed",
  ["mH"] = "[PT] life leech",
  ["mI"] = "[PT] paralysis removal",
  ["mJ"] = "[PT] mana leech",
  ["mK"] = "[PT] energy damage",
  ["mL"] = "[PT] ice damage",
  ["mM"] = "[PT] death damage",
  ["mN"] = "[PT] fire damage",
  ["mO"] = "[PT] earth damage",
  ["mP"] = "[PT] energy protection",
  ["mQ"] = "[PT] skill club",
  ["mR"] = "[PT] holy protection",
  ["mS"] = "[PT] fire protection",
  ["mT"] = "[PT] death protection",
  ["mU"] = "[PT] ice protection",
  ["mV"] = "[PT] earth protection",
  ["mW"] = "[PT] skill shield",
  ["mX"] = "[PT] skill axe",
  ["mY"] = "[PT] magic level",
  ["mZ"] = "[PT] skill distance",
  ["ma"] = "[PT] skill sword",
  ["mb"] = "[PT] capacity increase",
  ["mc"] = "[PT] critical",
  ["md"] = "[PT] Do you seek a passage to the ",
  ["me"] = "Maybe aNãother time.",
  ["mf"] = "[PT] I can bring you either to the {east} end of Port Hope or to the {centre} of the town, where would you like to go?",
  ["mg"] = "It seems to emanate a magical call or pulse that draws all sorts of creatures to it - Não offense meant. \\z\n\t\t\t\t\tWhen we first found it, we were flabbergasted - we thought maybe a mad sorcerer had built it, \\z\n\t\t\t\t\tor a cult, to summon something evil. ...",
  ["mh"] = "If you want to message a specific Jogador, right-click on his or her name and select \\z\n\t\t\t\t\t'Message to <Jogador name>'. This will open up a chat channel where you can type in your message to him or her.",
  ["mi"] = "Anyway. One way or aNãother, Morris picked us all up and gathered us here. \\z\n\t\t\t\t\tNãot sure that sending others on missions is really all it's about for him, \\z\n\t\t\t\t\tbut if you're looking for a Missão, go ask Morris for one.",
  ["mj"] = "It seems to emanate a magical call or pulse that draws all sorts of creatures to it - Não offense meant. When we first found it, we were flabbergasted - we thought maybe a mad sorcerer had built it, or a cult, to summon something evil. ...",
  ["mk"] = "Fighting is essential in Tibia, and though Dawnport is quite safe in comparison to the mainland, be careful Nãot to die, as {dying} HURTS. ...",
  ["ml"] = "If you have any other Missãoions, tell me.",
  ["mm"] = "There are many dangers in {Tibia}. You may have to defend yourself Nãot only against {Monstros}, but if {PvP} is allowed, against other {Jogadors}, too. ...",
  ["mn"] = "[PT] To attack, click on your chosen target in the battle list. A red frame will show you which target you are currently attacking. ...",
  ["mo"] = "[PT] To automatically follow your target, click on 'Chase Opponent' in your combat controls - the top left button. ...",
  ["mp"] = "[PT] You can also define your attack and defense mode, by selecting {offensive}, {balanced} or {defensive} fighting.",
  ["mq"] = "Depending on the world you chose in {Tibia}, {Jogadors} may attack you at all times or only if you consent. ...",
  ["mr"] = "On an Optional PvP world, PvP is only possible if both Jogadors consent to it; but on Open PvP or Hardcore PvP worlds, any Jogador may always attack you, so be watchful. ...",
  ["ms"] = "A brown frame around a Jogador indicates he or she is in a PvP situation. A {skull} next to a Jogador name means he or she attacked or killed aNãother Jogador. ...",
  ["mt"] = "Here on {Dawnport}, PvP is Nãot allowed inside the outpost, and Nãot possible until you have reached level 8 at least. If you have any other Missãoions, tell me.",
  ["mu"] = "But we didn't find any conclusive hints. {Menesto} and a few others volunteered to guard the portal from the {Monstros} of this isle. You say you came through it from your world! Astounding. ...",
  ["mv"] = "To chat with other Jogadors, you can click on one of the chat channels and see who is posting in there. ...",
  ["mw"] = "If you want to message a specific Jogador, right-click on his or her name and select 'Message to <Jogador name>'. This will open up a chat channel where you can type in your message to him or her.",
  ["mx"] = "NPC means someone like me or {Hamish} or {Coltrayne}, for example. You can easily discern us from {Jogadors} like you, because there is a speech bubble next to our {name}. ...",
  ["my"] = "We all have our different ways, but Nãormally, addressing an NPC with 'hi' or 'Olá' will open a conversation. ...",
  ["mz"] = "Some NPCs will have secret words that they react to that are Nãot highlighted in their conversation. In that case, you need to type in your Missãoion. ...",
  ["n0"] = "[PT] As an adventurer in training, you have a few spells at your disposal at the beginning, but more will become available as you progress. ...",
  ["n1"] = "[PT] Once you're level 8, new spells become available upstairs at the spell trainers {Garamond} and {Tybald}. They can tell you more.",
  ["n2"] = "[PT] Go through one of the open gates on this floor and you will be equipped with training weapons and {spells} of a specific vocation. ...",
  ["n3"] = "[PT] There are four {vocations} in Tibia: {knight}, {sorcerer}, {paladin} or {druid}. Each one has its unique abilities, strengths and weaknesses. Just try them out to see which one suits you best. ...",
  ["n4"] = "We need your Ajuda in our battle. Fight {Monstros} to gain experience and better {skills}, until you reach level 8 at least. Make sure you always have Nãot only a weapon, but a {rope} with you, as well! ...",
  ["n5"] = "[PT] Once you reached level 8 or more, you have to choose one vocation as your definite vocation before you can leave for the Tibian {mainland}, where more dangers await you. ...",
  ["n6"] = "To choose your definite vocation, talk to {Oressa} downstairs in the {temple}. She can also heal you if you are severely wounded or poisoned - just say 'heal' or 'Ajuda' to her. ...",
  ["n7"] = "If you have any other Missãoions, tell me.",
  ["n8"] = "[PT] The blessings of the gods will protect you from item loss and alleviate the skill and experience loss when you die. But you will have to undertake the Pilgrimage of Ashes on the {mainland} to get the blessings. ...",
  ["n9"] = "{Dawnport} is just a small, but dangerous island. You will have to reach level 8 at least and choose your definite vocation before you can leave for the {mainland}. To reach level 8, you will have to fight some Monstros in order to progress. ...",
  ["nA"] = "That is when we found the strange crystal {portal}, through which you came. Perhaps this is why the {Monstros} battle, but won't leave. ...",
  ["nB"] = "It certainly is a place of power, so {Menesto}'s group was sent down to guard it. However, we are but few, so we need every Ajuda we can get to defend and maintain the outpost on this isle. ...",
  ["nC"] = "That is why we need your Ajuda - choose the vocation that suits you, take up its arms and Ajuda us defend this place against the evil that wants to claim it! If you need any Ajuda in how to do these things, ask me.",
  ["nD"] = "The mainland harbours the most ancient cities of {Tibia}, and many dangers and adventures as well. When you have Ajudaed us defend {Dawnport}, and learned eNãough of the ways of Tibia to reach level 8 at least, you should leave for the mainland. ...",
  ["nE"] = "[PT] There you can continue to battle evil - and believe me, there is much of that in our world, alas. <sigh> ...",
  ["nF"] = "Premium adventurers can also sail to the many islands that surround the mainland, which offer many more dangers and mysteries to be explored; and you can do Missãos to ride mounts, and dress in a variety of new outfits.",
  ["nG"] = "[PT] Hasn't been with us for very long. Very interested in all things mystical, so Menesto was sent down to guard the strange crystal {portal} we found here. ...",
  ["nH"] = "[PT] Go through one of the open gates on this floor and you will be equipped with training weapons and {spells} of a specific vocation. ...",
  ["nI"] = "[PT] There are four vocations in Tibia: {knight}, {druid}, {paladin} and {sorcerer}. Each one has its unique abilities, strengths and weaknesses. Just try them out to see which one suits you best. ...",
  ["nJ"] = "We need your Ajuda in our battle. Fight {Monstros} to gain experience and better {skills}, until you reach level 8 at least. Make sure you always have Nãot only a weapon, but a {rope} with you, as well! ...",
  ["nK"] = "[PT] Once you reached level 8 or more, you have to choose one vocation as your definite vocation before you can leave for the Tibian {mainland}, where more dangers await you. ...",
  ["nL"] = "To choose your definite vocation, talk to {Oressa} downstairs in the {temple}. She can also heal you if you are severely wounded or poisoned - just say 'heal' or 'Ajuda' to her. ...",
  ["nM"] = "If you have any other Missãoions, tell me.",
  ["nN"] = "[PT] A vocation is your profession and chosen destiny, rolled into one. There are four vocations in {Tibia}: {knight}, {sorcerer}, {paladin} or {druid}. Each vocation has its unique special abilities with which to fight evil. ...",
  ["nO"] = "You need to choose your vocation before you can leave {Dawnport} to go to the {Mainland}. But first, you have to gain eNãough experience to reach level 8 in order to do so. ...",
  ["nP"] = "[PT] Once you've reached level 8 and want to choose your definite vocation, talk to {Oressa} downstairs in the temple. She can also heal you if you are hurt or poisoned. ...",
  ["nQ"] = "If you have any other Missãoions, tell me.",
  ["nR"] = "... But of course, you met him. ... So it really is a portal, and you came through it from aNãother plane of existence! I never quite believed the tales of old, Nãot really. But Nãow... it's wonderful, truly wonderful. ...",
  ["nS"] = "[PT] I can give you directions how to {play}, some basic survival and {combat} tips, or explain {PvP}, ...",
  ["nT"] = "I can also tell you how to talk with other {Jogadors} or {NPC}s, or can inform you about {Missãoing} or {spells}. ...",
  ["nU"] = "I also have a list of small {hints} if you prefer that, and can tell you something of the {people} here. Just tell me what you want to kNãow. ...",
  ["nV"] = "Oh, but first that Ajuda I mentioned - you should get yourself a {shovel}, friend. It will come in handy when you set about finding secret entrances to dungeons or hidden treasures - many useful things lie hidden beneath earth, sand or stones!",
  ["nW"] = "Offensive {fighting} means you deal harder attacks, but have a weaker defense. Magical damage you deal is Nãot affected by this. ...",
  ["nX"] = "You should switch to offensive only if you want to finish off a Monstro quickly and are sure you can survive its harder attacks. I can also tell you something about {balanced} and {defensive} fighting.",
  ["nY"] = "Balanced {fighting} balances out your attack strength as well as your defense strength. Magical damage you deal is Nãot affected by this. ...",
  ["nZ"] = "[PT] I can also tell you something about {offensive} and {defensive} fighting.",
  ["na"] = "Defensive {fighting} increases your defense but reduces your attack strength. The magical damage you deal is Nãot affected by this. ...",
  ["nb"] = "[PT] I can also tell you something about {offensive} and {balanced} fighting.",
  ["nc"] = "Well, if you have any Missãoions as to THIS plane of existence, which we call {Tibia}, just ask me. I can give directions, {hints}, you name it. <winks at you>",
  ["nd"] = "A white skull means that this Jogador attacked and maybe killed aNãother Jogador without justification. ...",
  ["ne"] = "A red skull means someone has killed many other {Jogadors}, while a black skull depicts someone on a serious killing spree - so watch out!",
  ["nf"] = "Some sort of misguided genius, I think. Brilliant with potions and runes, but couldn't get on with his master or with the other students. Ran away and set up his own little lab, Vendering to travellers along the road. ...",
  ["ng"] = "[PT] Was robbed and left for dead by some plunderers, when Morris found him. {Morris} patched him up and said he could use him, so Hamish came here. If you need a wand, rune or potion, Hamish's your man.",
  ["nh"] = "Coltrayne doesn't say much about himself. What I gathered from the 15 years I've kNãown him is that he was raised by a blacksmith as a foundling. ...",
  ["ni"] = "[PT] When a fire destroyed his foster family's home, he took up an unsteady life, always wandering around. Then he met {Morris} and decided to go adventuring with him.",
  ["nj"] = "Ah, there are lots of stories about Morris. Likes to insist on the 'Mr'. Nãobody kNãows his first name, and the telling goes that he has gambled with a demon and lost his first name to him. ...",
  ["nk"] = "[PT] The demon is said to have set Morris free so he can reclaim him at the end of his life, meanwhile having fun watching Morris struggle through hardship and adventures. ...",
  ["nl"] = "Anyway. One way or aNãother, Morris picked us all up and gathered us here. Nãot sure that sending others on missions is really all it's about for him, but if you're looking for a Missão, go ask Morris for one.",
  ["nm"] = "Nãot your level, but your skill with your weapon determines how much damage you make. With a distance weapon like a bow, you {train} your distance {fighting} skill, with a sword your sword fighting, etc. ...",
  ["nn"] = "Our world {Tibia} is swarmed by many dangerous {Monstros}, so {fighting} is something you will have to learn and master quickly. You can fight as a {sorcerer}, druid, {paladin} or {knight}. ...",
  ["no"] = "Druids and sorcerers train their magic level by using their mana through {spells} and runes. Their wand or rod damage is Nãot affected by their magic level. If you have any other Missãoions, tell me.",
  ["np"] = "[PT] You should never leave without a rope. NEVER. A rope can save your life. I once fell down into a poison spider lair - without a rope, I wouldn't be standing here today! ...",
  ["nq"] = "You can Comprar a rope over at {Richard}'s shop. If you don't have the money, kill and loot a few {Monstros} - maybe one of them even has a rope with it, that sort of thing happens.",
  ["nr"] = "Our local healer. Don't kNãow why that druid girl decided she wanted the unsteady life of an adventurer, but she's quite hardy, to tell the truth. I once saw her confront a polar bear.... but I'm getting carried away. ...",
  ["ns"] = "If you need healing, go see her. Oressa can also Ajuda you decide if you want to choose your vocation to leave for the {Mainland}.",
  ["nt"] = "[PT] When you die, you will be resurrected in the temple of the city you chose as your home. Temple {NPC}s, like {Oressa} here on {Dawnport}, can heal you if you're wounded or poisoned. Some special temple NPCs can also {bless} you. ...",
  ["nu"] = "[PT] To be fully blessed, you should start the Pilgrimage of Ashes at a local guide in the harbour once you have reached the {mainland}.",
  ["nv"] = "Don't be deceived by its sweet looks - {Tibia} is a rough world. If you die, you will lose skill and experience and perhaps even some items, and other {Jogadors} can rob your corpse. ...",
  ["nw"] = "On the {Mainland}, you can Comprar blessings from {temple} {NPC}s to prevent item loss, but you will always lose some {skills} and experience, so be careful. ...",
  ["nx"] = "[PT] Always have a {rope} with you, for a start. A rope is essential.",
  ["ny"] = "We need your Ajuda in keeping the Monstros at bay - walk out of one of the four gates here, and you will receive one of the four {vocations} and its gear to try out and fight Monstros. ...",
  ["nz"] = "[PT] Every vocation has specific {spells} that can only be used if you have that vocation. Sorcerers and druids of course rely heavily on spells, while knights only have a few at their disposal. ...",
  ["o0"] = "I can sense that the druids Nãorth of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["o1"] = "[PT] I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["o2"] = "[PT] I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["o3"] = "[PT] I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["o4"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["o5"] = "The druids Nãorth of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["o6"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["o7"] = "Sim, I was informed what to do. Are you prepared to receive my line of the prayer?",
  ["o8"] = "[PT] The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["o9"] = "[PT] Talk to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya about this blessing.",
  ["oA"] = "If you die in a fight from a Monstro's attack, your blessings will be lost, and you will have to get them again. ...",
  ["oB"] = "[PT] There is also a blessing that will protect you specifically from losses in a {PvP} fight. This blessing you will need to get again when you have been killed in a PvP fight. ...",
  ["oC"] = "Here on {Dawnport}, you are protected from losses in a PvP fight by the Adventurer's Blessing - unless you attack aNãother Jogador. If you attack aNãother Jogador or reach level 20, you will lose this blessing.",
  ["oD"] = "Careful, careful, it's a one-way ticket only! You can never come back here if you leave Nãow, and you will loso all your Dawnport equipment and products! ...",
  ["oE"] = "[PT] Are you {SURE} you want to {LEAVE} Dawnport for ROOKGAARD?",
  ["oF"] = "I kNãow the ways and lays of Dawnport. Talk to me if you want to kNãow more!",
  ["oG"] = "I used to be a hunter and trapper, but these bones have grown weary. \\z\n\t\tI Nãow tan furs and hides and {Comércio} in creature products. And I can Ajuda you find your way if you need directions.",
  ["oH"] = "That's where we are - the world of Tibia. \\z\n\t\tWe're on a small island called {Dawnport}, Nãot far from the coast of the Tibian {Mainland}, to be precise.",
  ["oI"] = "Oh, I can handle my tasks myself, Obrigado. \\z\n\t\tIf you are looking for something to do, you should go to Morris and ask him for Missãos. \\z\n\t\tYou can also Ajuda us fight {Monstros}.",
  ["oJ"] = "Well, the other fellows you see here, Vendering stuff and so forth. \\z\n\t\tSay a name and I'll tell you what I kNãow of him or her.",
  ["oK"] = "Marvellous specimen we have here on {Dawnport}! \\z\n\t\tJust be careful when you go hunting them, {dying} hurts in {Tibia}! \\z\n\t\tI will happily Comprar any creature products you may find.",
  ["oL"] = "Used to be a professor at the magic academy in Edron, I believe. \\z\n\t\tLikes to see different places, so he joined our illustrous little group. \\z\n\t\tVenders {sorcerer} and {druid} {spells} to our trainees.",
  ["oM"] = "I'm Nãot sure that's his actual name, but I guess he has good reasons to stay incognito here. \\z\n\t\tIn any case, he's a formidable fighter and kNãows usefull {spells} for knights and paladins.",
  ["oN"] = "Richard came here as a shipwrecked carpenter, and Nãow Venders {tools} and {food} to all adventurers. \\z\n\t\tIf you need a {rope} or {shovel}, {fishing rod} or some provisions for a hunt, you should Comércio with him!",
  ["oO"] = "[PT] Knights are close combat fighters, the toughest vocation of all. \\z\n\t\tThey usually wield melee weapons such as swords, axes or clubs.",
  ["oP"] = "[PT] Druids are nature magicians. \\z\n\t\tTheir speciality is casting ice and earth magic, as well as providing healing for others.",
  ["oQ"] = "[PT] Troll hair, wolf fur, lumps of dirt - bring them to me!",
  ["oR"] = "[PT] Paladins are well-trained distance fighters and can cast holy magic. \\z\n\t\tYou will usually see them wearing bows or crossbows.",
  ["oS"] = "[PT] Sorcerers are elemental magicians. They have mastered fire, energy and death magic.",
  ["oT"] = "In {Tibia}, you can use different tools with your environment, or for Missãos. \\z\n\t\tThe most important tools are {rope} and {shovel}. \\z\n\t\tA {fishing rod}'s also good when you need to eat, and are near a river or the sea.",
  ["oU"] = "Food is very important for your health and mana. \\z\n\t\tIf you are hurt in a fight with a Monstro, select 'USE' on food such as cheese, ham or meat to eat it. \\z\n\t\tThis will slowly refill your health and mana. Here at the outpost, you can Comprar food from {Richard}.",
  ["oV"] = "[PT] Use a fishing rod on a patch of water to see if you can catch fish! \\z\n\t\tEating is essential in {Tibia} - if you don't eat when you're hungry, you won't regenerate health or mana. \\z\n\t\tSo you should aways have some {food} with you.",
  ["oW"] = "Come to me if you need Ajuda!",
  ["oX"] = "[PT] Hey there, young adventurer! Need a hint?",
  ["oY"] = "[PT] You came through the portal? Talk to me!",
  ["oZ"] = "[PT] You're going out? Make sure you have a rope with you!",
  ["oa"] = "Compraring all sorts of creature products!",
  ["ob"] = "You're looking thoughtful. Maybe I can Ajuda you?",
  ["oc"] = "Ah, back in the old days, I was called Inigo Verasquiriz, but I doubt my family would ackNãowledge me. \\z\n\t\tThose that are still alive, that is.",
  ["od"] = "I kNãow the ways and lays of Dawnport. Talk to me if you want to kNãow more!",
  ["oe"] = "[PT] Troll hair, wolf fur, lumps of dirt - bring them to me!",
  ["of"] = "Come to me if you need Ajuda!",
  ["og"] = "[PT] Hey there, young adventurer! Need a hint?",
  ["oh"] = "[PT] You came through the portal? Talk to me!",
  ["oi"] = "[PT] You're going out? Make sure you have a rope with you!",
  ["oj"] = "Compraring all sorts of creature products!",
  ["ok"] = "You're looking thoughtful. Maybe I can Ajuda you?",
  ["ol"] = "Alright, I guess you need a stake first. Maybe Gamon can Ajuda you, the leg of a chair or something could just do. Try asking him for a stake, and if you have one, bring it back to me.",
  ["om"] = "[PT] Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  ["on"] = "[PT] Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  ["oo"] = "[PT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["op"] = "Não problem.",
  ["oq"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 Ouro?",
  ["or"] = "[PT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["os"] = "Sorry, you don't have eNãough money.",
  ["ot"] = "Não problem.",
  ["ou"] = "[PT] You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["ov"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't Ajuda you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["ow"] = "[PT] I guess you couldn't convince Gamon to give you a stake, eh?",
  ["ox"] = "[PT] Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["oy"] = "[PT] There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["oz"] = "[PT] I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["p0"] = "[PT] I guess there are guys like me that have a talent to talk to dogs and there are guys like the shamans that have the talent to talk to spirits.",
  ["p1"] = "[PT] We don't need any kings or queens. Am I right, boys? Yeah, I am.",
  ["p2"] = "[PT] Sven the Younger is our current Jarl. For my standards he's still a puppy, but a smart one at least.",
  ["p3"] = "[PT] I am Iskan.",
  ["p4"] = "Yeah, where could it be. That's the Missãoion.",
  ["p5"] = "Easy, boys! Don't mention that name again. Makes the boys nuts, ye kNãow?",
  ["p6"] = "In my whole long life, I've Nãot seen any sign of those gods the people of the south are constantly talking about.",
  ["p7"] = "The icy father. We kNãow him all too well, am I right boys? He has claimed so many old friends in all those years. So many.",
  ["p8"] = "[PT] I can bring you to Nibelor with the sled if you want to. Just ask for a {passage}.",
  ["p9"] = "This city seems to be growing every day. First, there have been only a few huts and Nãow ... look around, houses everywhere.",
  ["pA"] = "So receive my prayer: 'Light shall be near - and darkness afar'. Nãow, bring your stake to Tibra in the Carlin church for the next line of the prayer. I will inform her what to do.",
  ["pB"] = "[PT] I will wait for you.",
  ["pC"] = "You should visit Tibra in the Carlin church Nãow.",
  ["pD"] = "[PT] You already received my line of the prayer.",
  ["pE"] = "[PT] So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["pF"] = "[PT] Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["pG"] = "Adeus, |JogadorNAME|.",
  ["pH"] = "Greetings, |JogadorNAME|.",
  ["pI"] = "Do you want to be promoted in your vocation for 20000 Ouro?",
  ["pJ"] = "[PT] Ok, whatever.",
  ["pK"] = "[PT] I am a jeweller. Maybe you want to have a look at my wonderful {offers}.",
  ["pL"] = "Well, I Vender gems and {goblets}. If you'd like to see my offers, ask me for a {Comércio}.",
  ["pM"] = "Ah, our newest import! We have Ouroen goblets, silver goblets and bronze goblets. All of them have space for a hand-written dedication.",
  ["pN"] = "[PT] So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["pO"] = "Não problem.",
  ["pP"] = "[PT] I think you have forgotten to bring your stake, kid.",
  ["pQ"] = "Sim, I was informed what to do. Are you prepared to receive my line of the prayer?",
  ["pR"] = "So receive my prayer: 'Unclean spirits shall be repelled'. Nãow, bring your stake to Amanda in Edron for the next line of the prayer. I will inform her what to do.",
  ["pS"] = "[PT] I will wait for you.",
  ["pT"] = "You should visit Amanda in Edron Nãow, kid.",
  ["pU"] = "[PT] You already received my line of the prayer.",
  ["pV"] = "A blessed stake? That's a strange reMissão. Maybe Quentin kNãows more, he is one of the oldest monks after all.",
  ["pW"] = "[PT] You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["pX"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't Ajuda you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["pY"] = "[PT] Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["pZ"] = "[PT] Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["pa"] = "[PT] There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["pb"] = "[PT] I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["pc"] = "I can sense that the druids Nãorth of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["pd"] = "[PT] I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["pe"] = "[PT] I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["pf"] = "[PT] I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["pg"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["ph"] = "The druids Nãorth of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["pi"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["pj"] = "[PT] Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  ["pk"] = "[PT] The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["pl"] = "[PT] Talk to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya about this blessing.",
  ["pm"] = "[PT] Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  ["pn"] = "[PT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["po"] = "Não problem.",
  ["pp"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 Ouro?",
  ["pq"] = "[PT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["pr"] = "Sorry, you don't have eNãough money.",
  ["ps"] = "[PT] I run the dog sled service from this city to {Nibelor}.",
  ["pt"] = "[PT] The yeti is real and dangerous.",
  ["pu"] = "I am Nãot sure what to think about this new custom to accept foreigners as one of us after passing that test. But it's the Jarl's decision, Nãot mine.",
  ["pv"] = "[PT] The raiders camps are far to the south. There are three of them. Small camp sites of raiding parties might be found almost anywhere though.",
  ["pw"] = "[PT] They are sometimes trying to catch me and the boys. Such fools, they will never get us. Right, boys?",
  ["px"] = "[PT] The boys can tell who's an enemy just by the smell.",
  ["py"] = "[PT] Me and the boys care only about our own territory.",
  ["pz"] = "[PT] I guess their healing powers are almost as useful as those of our shamans.",
  ["q0"] = "Where do you want to go? To {Edron}, {Thais}, {VeNãore}, {Darashia}, {Ankrahmun}, {Yalahar} or {Port Hope}?",
  ["q1"] = "[PT] My name is Jack Fate from the Royal Tibia Line.",
  ["q2"] = "[PT] I'm the captain of this sailing ship.",
  ["q3"] = "[PT] I'm the captain of this sailing ship.",
  ["q4"] = "[PT] That's where we are.",
  ["q5"] = "[PT] I'm sorry but I don't sail there.",
  ["q6"] = "[PT] Never heard about a place like this.",
  ["q7"] = "[PT] We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["q8"] = "[PT] Do you seek a passage to Thais for |TRAVELCOST|?",
  ["q9"] = "I have to warn you - we might get into a tropical storm on that route. I'm Nãot sure if my ship will withstand it. Do you really want to travel to Thais?",
  ["qA"] = "[PT] Our people are very proud and honest. I guess that's more than most people can say about themselves and their people, right boys?",
  ["qB"] = "[PT] I heard something about a ship crashing in the shelf ice between Nibelor and Grimlund. If I were you, I wouldn't go to chakoya terrain. It's pretty dangerous.",
  ["qC"] = "[PT] Nasty little beasts. Me and the boys had quite some bloody encounters with them on the ice.",
  ["qD"] = "The boys warn me in advance if a Monstro is around.",
  ["qE"] = "My boys did Nãot like the guys that were travelling through our city, and I trust in their instincts. Isn't it so, boys?",
  ["qF"] = "[PT] My {father}, can you tell me if he's alright?",
  ["qG"] = "Alright then, you are very Bem-vindo to explore the temple!",
  ["qH"] = "[PT] My name is Ivalisse.",
  ["qI"] = "[PT] There is always time to make a change.",
  ["qJ"] = "Besides my various {duties} in the temple, I also take care of visitors. Well, I would but right Nãow I can't get my mind of how my {father}'s doing. I am sorry.",
  ["qK"] = " I Ajuda linking the portals of this temple to other ancient sites of the {Astral Shapers}.",
  ["qL"] = " I Ajuda linking the portals of this temple to other ancient sites of the {Astral Shapers}.",
  ["qM"] = "[PT] Gems of all kinds! Precious jewellery!",
  ["qN"] = "[PT] A... aargh. I wish I had some e... earmuffs to put over this useless t... turban.",
  ["qO"] = "[PT] I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Edron}, to {Kazordoon}, to Z... Zao, to the F...{Femor Hills}, to {Issavi} or to M... {Marapur} if you like. W....Where do you want to go?",
  ["qP"] = "[PT] I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Edron}, to {Kazordoon}, to Z... Zao, to the F...{Femor Hills}, to {Issavi} or to M... {Marapur} if you like. W....Where do you want to go?",
  ["qQ"] = "I'm k...kNãown as Iyad Ibn Abdul.",
  ["qR"] = "[PT] The thought of s...some mad sorcerer unleashing some f...fire magic is very tempting.",
  ["qS"] = "[PT] S...so close and s...still that far away.",
  ["qT"] = "[PT] For all its m...mistakes, Thais is warm at least.",
  ["qU"] = "[PT] I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Edron}, to {Kazordoon}, to Z... Zao, to the F...{Femor Hills}, to {Issavi} or to M... {Marapur} if you like. W....Where do you want to go?",
  ["qV"] = "I would t...Comércio it for some firewood.",
  ["qW"] = "This h...here is Não continent. This is h...hell.",
  ["qX"] = "[PT] Even D...Drefia can't be worse than this land.",
  ["qY"] = "[PT] Oh p.. please. P... lease let me fly us out of this c... cold.",
  ["qZ"] = "I d...don't care about any n...news unless it's the anNãouncement of a h....heatwave.",
  ["qa"] = "[PT] It's p...probably the ice age.",
  ["qb"] = "[PT] Th...there, in case you have {earmuffs}, I pay w...well!",
  ["qc"] = "Do you really have earmuffs f...for me?? If so, just ask me for a {Comércio}!",
  ["qd"] = "[PT] Never heard about a place like this.",
  ["qe"] = "[PT] Do you seek a ride to ",
  ["qf"] = "[PT] Hold on!",
  ["qg"] = "[PT] You shouldn't miss the experience.",
  ["qh"] = "[PT] I'm a licensed c...carpet pilot. I can {transport} you t...to a warm p...place.",
  ["qi"] = "[PT] I t...{transport} travellers to the continent of Darama for a small fee. It's w...warm there.",
  ["qj"] = "[PT] I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Edron}, to {Kazordoon}, to Z... Zao, to the F...{Femor Hills}, to {Issavi} or to M... {Marapur} if you like. W....Where do you want to go?",
  ["qk"] = "[PT] A... aargh. I wish I had some e... earmuffs to put over this useless t... turban.",
  ["ql"] = "[PT] Oh p.. please. P... lease let me fly us out of this c... cold.",
  ["qm"] = "[PT] So it's that name again. You are really determined, aren't you. ...",
  ["qn"] = "So if he thinks I'm someone he knew who is Nãow 'lost' and needs to come back or whatever - tell him he is WRONG. I always lived here with my mother and sister, I'm happy here and I certainly don't want to go to that academy of yours.",
  ["qo"] = "[PT] So it's that name again. You are really determined, aren't you. ...",
  ["qp"] = "So if he thinks I'm someone he knew who is Nãow 'lost' and needs to come back or whatever - tell him he is WRONG. I always lived here with my mother and sister, I'm happy here and I certainly don't want to go to that academy of yours.",
  ["qq"] = "Nãow I need to clean up everything again.",
  ["qr"] = "[PT] So much to do, so little time, they say...",
  ["qs"] = "Could it be...? Não. Não way.",
  ["qt"] = "[PT] Mh...",
  ["qu"] = "[PT] Do you seek a passage back to thais?",
  ["qv"] = "[PT] We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["qw"] = "[PT] I can travel you to {thais}.",
  ["qx"] = "[PT] I can travel you to {thais}.",
  ["qy"] = "[PT] I can travel you to {thais}.",
  ["qz"] = "Passages to Edron, Thais, VeNãore, Darashia, Ankrahmun, Yalahar and Port Hope.",
  ["r0"] = "[PT] For sure, I would have offered cats!",
  ["r1"] = "[PT] He gave me the permission to open up a pet shop here. I paid him almost everything I got!",
  ["r2"] = "I made contact with Svargrond! A guy named Buddel wanted to Vender me a three-headed dog. I haven't seen it yet, but imagine how much money I could make by breeding such a pet!!",
  ["r3"] = "[PT] My house! Uahahahaha <sniffs>.",
  ["r4"] = "[PT] Dear gods! My precious house, DESTROYED!!",
  ["r5"] = "Oh Não!! What am I supposed to do Nãow?!?",
  ["r6"] = "Change your Bar of Ouro's for Items here!",
  ["r7"] = "[PT] Don't forget to deposit your money here in the Global Bank before you head out for adventure.",
  ["r8"] = "[PT] Food of various kinds, have a look.",
  ["r9"] = "[PT] I come from a family of {vampire} hunters, but to be honest, I'm more into the theoretic part and strategic planning.",
  ["rA"] = "[PT] We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["rB"] = "[PT] We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["rC"] = "Where do you want to go? To {Edron}, {Thais}, {VeNãore}, {Darashia}, {Ankrahmun}, {Yalahar} or {Port Hope}?",
  ["rD"] = "Passages to Edron, Thais, VeNãore, Darashia, Ankrahmun, Yalahar and Port Hope.",
  ["rE"] = "[PT] My name is Jack Fate from the Royal Tibia Line.",
  ["rF"] = "[PT] I'm the captain of this - well, wreck. Argh.",
  ["rG"] = "[PT] I'm the captain of this - well, wreck. Argh",
  ["rH"] = "This is where we are... the volcaNão island Goroma. There are many rumours about this place.",
  ["rI"] = "[PT] Always be on guard.",
  ["rJ"] = "[PT] Here is where you come into play. We could identify the most recent plot of the Shiron'Fal and already had some {clashes}.",
  ["rK"] = "In our efforts to hinder their plot, we achieved mixed results at best. But Nãow things are escalating fast and we have to {hurry}.",
  ["rL"] = "Our resources are already stretched thin, so we need your Ajuda with the most recent {problem}.",
  ["rM"] = "The legion tries to use a new form of twisted rituals to raise the bodies of well-kNãown {knights}.",
  ["rN"] = "These powerful undead were a terrible threat on their own but it seems even they are just part of some larger {scheme} that we canNãot make out yet.",
  ["rO"] = "We are still working feverishly to uncover their goals but for Nãow more imminent {threats} are at hand.",
  ["rP"] = "[PT] Death cultists of the Shiron'Fal are trying to locate the bodies of fallen knights and raise them in blasphemous {rituals}.",
  ["rQ"] = "[PT] The churches of the gods worked hand in hand to supply us with the means to {purge} the graves of those knights.",
  ["rR"] = "I need your Ajuda in a matter of utmost {urgency}.",
  ["rS"] = "[PT] The situation is complicated and it's even hard to say where to {start} best, just to describe it to you.",
  ["rT"] = "[PT] You see, several incidents in history can be traced back to a single {source}.",
  ["rU"] = "Things get murkier the further you go down in history, but that's Nãot even necessary. Even today we can discern a certain pattern in recent {events}.",
  ["rV"] = "[PT] The recent rise of lycanthropy, the robbery of certain forbidden arcane texts and the vanishing of at least three dangerous individuals, targeted by the inquisition are just the tip of the {iceberg}.",
  ["rW"] = "[PT] This outside force is moving behind the scenes since ages. Our research suggests that this force probably even {predates} the rise of humanity.",
  ["rX"] = "[PT] Well, we are sure that the puppeteer behind all these events is an organisation. So old that even its name, the Shiron'Fal, has lost its meaning, because the {language} it originates from is long dead.",
  ["rY"] = "[PT] Always be on guard.",
  ["rZ"] = "[PT] Hmm.",
  ["ra"] = "[PT] Don't enter this area if you are an inexperienced fighter! It would be your end!",
  ["rb"] = "[PT] Don't forget to deposit your money here in the Global Bank before you head out for adventure.",
  ["rc"] = "[PT] My house! Uahahahaha <sniffs>.",
  ["rd"] = "[PT] I like it here, at least the town. I was warned that there are nasty creatures outside the town walls but I didn't expect anything to happen so close to town!",
  ["re"] = "I was always good with animals. My parents had a farm, the McRonalds farm. Maybe you kNãow it. Anyway, I had the idea that people may like to have animals as companions and so one led to aNãother.",
  ["rf"] = "[PT] I'd go mad listening to this 'ribbit' the whole time. But each to his own!",
  ["rg"] = "I'm new here in Edron. I wanted to open up a pet shop. But Nãow I'm ruined, uahahahaha <sniffs>.",
  ["rh"] = "I need to write a letter to the king. I'm Nãot sure if those 2 million Ouro coins that Daniel Steelsoul demanded from me weren't too much.",
  ["ri"] = "[PT] I'm there from time to time, catching frogs. People like their bright colours.",
  ["rj"] = "My name is Jerom but Não need to remember my name. All my belongings are destroyed and stolen. I'll be gone soon!",
  ["rk"] = "Raymond Striker offered me a contract to export parrots from Meriana but I won't need them anymore Nãow that I'm ruined.",
  ["rl"] = "Nãot a very good spot to catch animals. At least Não animals that pass off as pets.",
  ["rm"] = "Simterday I would have said that I like all creatures of Tibia but TODAY my life has changed! When I catch this stinking troll!!",
  ["rn"] = "[PT] Dear gods! My precious house, DESTROYED!!",
  ["ro"] = "True, why Nãot keep a rat as a pet! They can eat your trash, live inside your walls and you don't have to worry if one dies ! Could be a huge success....if I weren't ruined!!!!",
  ["rp"] = "[PT] That would be a mission for a hero.",
  ["rq"] = "Well, I don't see any other way than going back to my home country Nãow.",
  ["rr"] = "[PT] Good idea! Easy to catch and once the owner has been bitten, he can't sue me anymore, hehehe!!.... but wait....I forgot....I'm ruined, uahahahaha <sniffs>.",
  ["rs"] = "[PT] I never make profit in Thais and most of the time I get robbed. I stopped visiting Thais for business some years ago.",
  ["rt"] = "[PT] I don't have anything to earn a living with, everything is destroyed! Otherwise I could offer you pets.",
  ["ru"] = "[PT] I saw a troll rummaging in the remains of my house last night! I'm sure this creature is behind that! But I am too weak to take revenge.",
  ["rv"] = "[PT] I've been to town and on my way back I heard a deafening sound. Then I saw that the sound came from a huge rock smashing my house.",
  ["rw"] = "Oh Não!! What am I supposed to do Nãow?!?",
  ["rx"] = "[PT] The only animal to catch there is the cobra and most people don't like to keep one as a pet.",
  ["ry"] = "[PT] Who wants such an animal as a pet?!?!",
  ["rz"] = "Those amazons denied making business with me. You kNãow the reason?!? I tell you, the reason was that I am MALE! Ridiculous!",
  ["s0"] = "Não problem.",
  ["s1"] = "[PT] I think you have forgotten to bring your stake, pilgrim.",
  ["s2"] = "Sim, I was informed what to do. Are you prepared to receive my line of the prayer?",
  ["s3"] = "So receive my prayer: 'Let there be hoNãour and humility'. Nãow, bring your stake to Rahkem in Ankrahmun for the next line of the prayer. I will inform him what to do.",
  ["s4"] = "[PT] I will wait for you.",
  ["s5"] = "You should visit Rahkem in Ankrahmun Nãow, pilgrim.",
  ["s6"] = "[PT] You already received my line of the prayer.",
  ["s7"] = "A blessed stake? That is a strange reMissão. Maybe Quentin kNãows more, he is one of the oldest monks after all.",
  ["s8"] = "[PT] You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["s9"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't Ajuda you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["sA"] = "[PT] A better name would be Gomorrah, if you ask me.",
  ["sB"] = "[PT] My name is Julius.",
  ["sC"] = "Storkus? Oh Sim, I kNãow him. A long time ago we used to hunt together... sometimes.",
  ["sD"] = "[PT] It's about time you showed the vampires that they should never bother the citizens again.",
  ["sE"] = "ANãother vampire raid last night. But then again, that's Nãothing new.",
  ["sF"] = "Well, I should be the one to Obrigado I guess.",
  ["sG"] = "[PT] So much to do. So many things to be fixed.",
  ["sH"] = "[PT] Still so much work.",
  ["sI"] = "[PT] Full steam ahead!",
  ["sJ"] = "[PT] Well, then you stay here, simple as that.",
  ["sK"] = "[PT] Where do you want me to take you? To {Kazordoon}, {Thais} or to {Robsons Isle}?",
  ["sL"] = "[PT] So much to do. So many things to be fixed.",
  ["sM"] = "[PT] Still so much work.",
  ["sN"] = "[PT] So much to do. So many things to be fixed.",
  ["sO"] = "[PT] Still so much work.",
  ["sP"] = "[PT] Full speed ahead!",
  ["sQ"] = "[PT] Well, then you stay here, simple as that.",
  ["sR"] = "[PT] Where do you want me to take you? To {Kazordoon} or to {Thais}? Occasionally we can even reach the {mines} if they are cleared.",
  ["sS"] = "[PT] So much to do. So many things to be fixed.",
  ["sT"] = "[PT] Still so much work.",
  ["sU"] = "[PT] So much to do. So many things to be fixed.",
  ["sV"] = "[PT] Still so much work.",
  ["sW"] = "[PT] Full steam ahead!",
  ["sX"] = "[PT] Well, then you stay here, simple as that.",
  ["sY"] = "[PT] Where do you want me to take you? To {Kazordoon} or to {Robsons Isle}? Occasionally we can even reach the {mines} if they are cleared.",
  ["sZ"] = "[PT] So much to do. So many things to be fixed.",
  ["sa"] = "[PT] Still so much work.",
  ["sb"] = "I have the power to grant you the blood of the mountain's blessing. But I must ask of you to sacrifice |BLESSCOST| Ouro. Are you prepared for that?",
  ["sc"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["sd"] = "[PT] The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["se"] = "[PT] Talk to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya about this blessing.",
  ["sf"] = "The druids Nãorth of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["sg"] = "I kNãow everyone and everything. It is certain that there is aNãother enhanced blessing, the 'heart of the mountain'. Talk to a Nãomad far to the west of Svargrond, hiding slightly above ground.",
  ["sh"] = "[PT] So receive the blood of the mountain, master.",
  ["si"] = "[PT] Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["sj"] = "[PT] You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["sk"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't Ajuda you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["sl"] = "I am Kais, Kais the Bound. Eternally {fixed} to the wretched place, unless... unless I prove my worth in aiding all those who seek my {Ajuda}.",
  ["sm"] = "[PT] Well, as I am quite in a fix currently, my only hope to escape this situation may be to grant you {healing} or an {enhanced} blessing if you wish. You must desire SOMETHING, right? Sure you do.",
  ["sn"] = "Besides the {enhanced} blessing available from me, I kNãow of one other, granted by a solitary {Nãomad} far west of Svargrond. There are also five different other blessings available, each in a sacred place. ...\\nThese blessings are: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}.",
  ["so"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["sp"] = "Adeus, |JogadorNAME|.",
  ["sq"] = "Olá! Tell me what's on your mind. Time is money.",
  ["sr"] = "This weather is killing me. If I only had eNãough money to retire.",
  ["ss"] = "[PT] I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["st"] = "[PT] I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["su"] = "[PT] I'm Karith. I don't belong to a caste any longer, and only serve the Yalahari.",
  ["sv"] = "[PT] The city was a marvel to behold. It is certain that it have been the many foreigners that ruined it.",
  ["sw"] = "Olá! Tell me what's on your mind. Time is money.",
  ["sx"] = "Adeus, |JogadorNAME|.",
  ["sy"] = "This weather is killing me. If I only had eNãough money to retire.",
  ["sz"] = "[PT] So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["t0"] = "[PT] Do you seek a passage to ",
  ["t1"] = "[PT] We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["t2"] = "We would like to Bem-vindo you on board.",
  ["t3"] = "[PT] Where do you want to go? To {Thais}",
  ["t4"] = "[PT] Where do you want to go? To {Thais}",
  ["t5"] = "[PT] Where do you want to go? To {Thais}",
  ["t6"] = "[PT] This is Thais. Where do you want to go?",
  ["t7"] = "[PT] Passages to Thais",
  ["t8"] = "Passages to Nãostalgia",
  ["t9"] = "[PT] This is Horror Village. Where do you want to go?",
  ["tA"] = "[PT] Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["tB"] = "[PT] Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["tC"] = "[PT] There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["tD"] = "[PT] I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["tE"] = "I can sense that the druids Nãorth of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["tF"] = "[PT] I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["tG"] = "[PT] I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["tH"] = "[PT] I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["tI"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["tJ"] = "The druids Nãorth of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["tK"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["tL"] = "[PT] Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  ["tM"] = "[PT] The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["tN"] = "[PT] Talk to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya about this blessing.",
  ["tO"] = "[PT] Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  ["tP"] = "[PT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["tQ"] = "Não problem.",
  ["tR"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 Ouro?",
  ["tS"] = "[PT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["tT"] = "Sorry, you don't have eNãough money.",
  ["tU"] = "[PT] The Spark of the Phoenix is given by me and by the great pyromancer in the nearby fire temple. Do you wish to receive my part of the Spark of the Phoenix?",
  ["tV"] = "[PT] Nice world in general. It's a shame there is so much water ruining the general impression.",
  ["tW"] = "Time is Nãot of importance.",
  ["tX"] = "[PT] May the earth swallow them all!",
  ["tY"] = "[PT] Ah, a weapon to be feared by man, beast and god alike, jawoll. He who wields it will be both blessed and cursed at the same time.",
  ["tZ"] = "[PT] The day will come when he finally bites the dust.",
  ["ta"] = "[PT] By using the powers of fire and earth we forced the river that once wound its way through the big old one in other directions, and created our home.",
  ["tb"] = "[PT] Bezil and Nezil have pawn and equpiment shop with an amazing stock.",
  ["tc"] = "[PT] Bezil and Nezil have pawn and equpiment shop with an amazing stock.",
  ["td"] = "[PT] The first knight of dwarvenkind is a fine woman.",
  ["te"] = "[PT] I fear the sorcerers focus on the destructive forces of fire. They forget about the protection earth could provide.",
  ["tf"] = "[PT] So receive the blessing of the life-giving earth, pilgrim.",
  ["tg"] = "[PT] He is a jolly fellow and one of the oldest dwarves alive.",
  ["th"] = "[PT] He is a fine smith and his armour may save your neck one day.",
  ["ti"] = "[PT] She is a fine cook, jawoll.",
  ["tj"] = "[PT] Uzgod is a blacksmith and understands the ways of his element well.",
  ["tk"] = "[PT] The emperor has rarely visited the temple district in the last years. He should care more about spirituality then about politics. Jawoll.",
  ["tl"] = "[PT] The emperor has rarely visited the temple district in the last years. He should care more about spirituality then about politics. Jawoll.",
  ["tm"] = "[PT] The celestial paladin, the protector of our race. The only divine being we care for and the only one who still cares for dwarfs.",
  ["tn"] = "[PT] Where earth is giving, fire is taking. That is the way of the elements.",
  ["to"] = "[PT] The lifegiving earth protects us, feeds us and takes us home after death.",
  ["tp"] = "[PT] The mountain we live in is called the big old one. It's the mountain of mountains, and it isand like a friend and protector to our race.",
  ["tq"] = "[PT] Ok. If you don't want it...",
  ["tr"] = "[PT] The gods are treacherous and vain. They want to use us like they did in the past. Only the elements can be trusted, because all they want is for nature to run its set course.",
  ["ts"] = "[PT] I am the great geomancer of dwarvenkind.",
  ["tt"] = "[PT] We investigate the will of the earth. It is our duty to make sure things to work in their natural way.",
  ["tu"] = "[PT] Life is born by earth and fed by earth.",
  ["tv"] = "[PT] I am Kawill Marbleeye, Son of Earth, from the Molten Rock.",
  ["tw"] = "There's Nãothing I need, better ask others.",
  ["tx"] = "[PT] Don't forget to deposit your money here in the Tibian Bank before you head out for adventure.",
  ["ty"] = "[PT] Passages to Thais",
  ["tz"] = "[PT] I'm sorry but I don't sail there.",
  ["u0"] = "[PT] Harkath Bloodblade is the general of our glorious {army}.",
  ["u1"] = "[PT] I will call for heroes as soon as the need arises again and then reward them appropriately.",
  ["u2"] = "[PT] To pay your taxes, visit the royal tax collector.",
  ["u3"] = "[PT] It's a time for heroes!",
  ["u4"] = "[PT] Awesome! Please pay a visit to www.otserv.com.br!",
  ["u5"] = "Our enemies are numerous. The evil miNãotaurs, Ferumbras, and the renegade city of Carlin to the Nãorth are just some of them.",
  ["u6"] = "[PT] They dare to reject my reign over the whole continent!",
  ["u7"] = "[PT] Our beloved city has some fine shops, guildhouses and a modern sewerage system.",
  ["u8"] = "[PT] Ask around about them.",
  ["u9"] = "[PT] The paladins are great protectors for Thais.",
  ["uA"] = "[PT] I'm sorry but I don't sail there.",
  ["uB"] = "[PT] Do you seek a passage to ",
  ["uC"] = "[PT] We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["uD"] = "We would like to Bem-vindo you on board.",
  ["uE"] = "Where do you want to go? To {Nãostalgia}, {Horror Village}",
  ["uF"] = "Where do you want to go? To {Nãostalgia}, {Horror Village}",
  ["uG"] = "Where do you want to go? To {Nãostalgia}, {Horror Village}",
  ["uH"] = "This is Nãostalgia. Where do you want to go?",
  ["uI"] = "Passages to Nãostalgia",
  ["uJ"] = "[PT] Don't forget to deposit your money here in the Tibian Bank before you head out for adventure.",
  ["uK"] = "[PT] If you need runes, this is the market stall for you!",
  ["uL"] = "I'm Vendering magic equipment. Come and have a look.",
  ["uM"] = "I can promote you for 20000 Ouro coins. Do you want me to promote you?",
  ["uN"] = "[PT] The latest news is usually brought to our magnificent town by brave adventurers. They recount tales of their journeys at Frodo's tavern.",
  ["uO"] = "Obrigado, I'm fine.",
  ["uP"] = "[PT] Rain Castle is my home.",
  ["uQ"] = "Vender? Vender what? My kingdom isn't for sale!",
  ["uR"] = "HoNãour the Gods and above all pay your {taxes}.",
  ["uS"] = "[PT] Please ask a priest about the gods.",
  ["uT"] = "[PT] The citizens of Tibia are my subjects. Ask the old monk Quentin if you want to learn more about them.",
  ["uU"] = "[PT] He is a skilled blacksmith and a loyal subject.",
  ["uV"] = "[PT] He is the owner of Frodo's Hut and a faithful tax-payer.",
  ["uW"] = "He was once one of Tibia's greatest fighters. Nãow he Venders equipment.",
  ["uX"] = "Congratulations! You are Nãow promoted.",
  ["uY"] = "He was once my greatest general. Nãow he is very old and senile so we assigned him to work for the Royal Tibia Mail.",
  ["uZ"] = "The royal poodle Nãoodles is my greatest {treasure}!",
  ["ua"] = "[PT] He is a follower of the evil God Zathroth and responsible for many attacks on us. Kill him on sight!",
  ["ub"] = "He is my royal jester and cheers me up Nãow and then.",
  ["uc"] = "The royal poodle Nãoodles is my greatest treasure!",
  ["ud"] = "[PT] Go and hunt them! For king and country!",
  ["ue"] = "Visit Quentin the monk for Ajuda.",
  ["uf"] = "[PT] What a disgusting topic!",
  ["ug"] = "Dungeons are Não places for kings.",
  ["uh"] = "Feel free to Comprar it in our town's fine shops.",
  ["ui"] = "[PT] Alright then, come back when you are ready.",
  ["uj"] = "[PT] Ask the royal cook for some food.",
  ["uk"] = "[PT] That tax collector is the bane of my life. He is so lazy. I bet you haven't payed any taxes at all.",
  ["ul"] = "[PT] I am the king, so watch what you say!",
  ["um"] = "[PT] Ask the soldiers about that.",
  ["un"] = "[PT] Visit the shops of our merchants and craftsmen.",
  ["uo"] = "[PT] The four major guilds are the knights, the paladins, the druids, and the sorcerers.",
  ["up"] = "Vile Monstros, but I must admit they are strong and sometimes even cunning ... in their own bestial way.",
  ["uq"] = "[PT] The forces of good are hard pressed in these dark times.",
  ["ur"] = "[PT] We need all strength we can muster to smite evil!",
  ["us"] = "[PT] We need order to survive!",
  ["ut"] = "It is said that he lives on a small island near Edron. Maybe the people there kNãow more about him.",
  ["uu"] = "[PT] Chaos arises from selfishness.",
  ["uv"] = "[PT] It's the sword of the Kings. If you return this weapon to me I will {reward} you beyond your wildest dreams.",
  ["uw"] = "Well, if you want a reward, go on a Missão to bring me Excalibug!",
  ["ux"] = "[PT] A very competent person. A little nervous but very competent.",
  ["uy"] = "This organisation is an essential tool for holding our enemies in check. Its headquarter is located in the bastion in the Nãorthwall.",
  ["uz"] = "[PT] Soon the whole land will be ruled by me once again!",
  ["v0"] = "[PT] We sorcerers wield arcane powers beyond comprehension of men.",
  ["v1"] = "[PT] We sorcerers wield arcane powers beyond comprehension of men.",
  ["v2"] = "I can offer you ham or meat. If you'd like to check the quality of my wares, ask me for a {Comércio}.",
  ["v3"] = "Ask me if you need Ajuda!",
  ["v4"] = "There are many merchants in this village. Just ask them for a {Comércio} to see their offers. But I can promise you - my offers are the best around!",
  ["v5"] = "I'm fine. I'm delighted to Bem-vindo you as my customer.",
  ["v6"] = "What kind of information do you need? I could tell you about different topics such as {equipment}, {Monstros} or {Rookgaard} in general.",
  ["v7"] = "How can I Ajuda you? Would you like to {Comércio} with me? I can also give you general {hints}. Or just ask me anything you'd like to kNãow.",
  ["v8"] = "[PT] You should really take some time and travel around the marvellous areas of Tibia. There's everything - ice islands, deserts, jungles and mountains!",
  ["v9"] = "The temple is the place to go when you are very low on {health} or poisoned. Ask {Cipfried} for a heal - he usually Nãotices emergencies by himself.",
  ["vA"] = "[PT] The brave knights are necessary for human survival in Thais.",
  ["vB"] = "[PT] The magic of the sorcerers is a powerful tool to smite our enemies.",
  ["vC"] = "[PT] We need the druidic healing powers to fight evil.",
  ["vD"] = "I greet thee, my loyal subject |JogadorNAME|.",
  ["vE"] = "I greet thee, my loyal subject |JogadorNAME|.",
  ["vF"] = "[PT] Baah is awesome dude that rewrote my outfit script.",
  ["vG"] = "[PT] I am your sovereign, King Tibianus III, and it's my duty to uphold {justice} and provide guidance for my subjects.",
  ["vH"] = "I try my best to be just and fair to our citizens. The army and the {TBI} are a great Ajuda in fulfilling this duty.",
  ["vI"] = "Preposterous! You must kNãow the name of your own King!",
  ["vJ"] = "[PT] So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["vK"] = "Não problem.",
  ["vL"] = "[PT] You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["vM"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't Ajuda you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["vN"] = "[PT] Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["vO"] = "[PT] There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["vP"] = "[PT] I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["vQ"] = "I can sense that the druids Nãorth of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["vR"] = "[PT] I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["vS"] = "[PT] I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["vT"] = "[PT] I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["vU"] = "[PT] Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["vV"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["vW"] = "The druids Nãorth of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["vX"] = "[PT] You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["vY"] = "[PT] The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["vZ"] = "[PT] Talk to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya about this blessing.",
  ["va"] = "[PT] Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  ["vb"] = "[PT] Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  ["vc"] = "[PT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["vd"] = "Não problem.",
  ["ve"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 Ouro?",
  ["vf"] = "[PT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["vg"] = "Sorry, you don't have eNãough money.",
  ["vh"] = "[PT] We need more volunteers!",
  ["vi"] = "[PT] Preparation is paramount.",
  ["vj"] = "[PT] Well, the biggest problem we need to address are the ever charging {subterraneans} around here. And on top of that, there's the threat of the Lost, who quite made themselves at {home} in these parts.",
  ["vk"] = "Maintainin' this whole operation, the dwarven involvement 'course. Don't kNãow about them gNãomes but if I ain't gettin' those dwarves in line, there'll be chaos down here. I also oversee the {defences} and {counterattacks}.",
  ["vl"] = "[PT] Klom Stonecutter's the name. ",
  ["vm"] = "[PT] Ah.",
  ["vn"] = "[PT] We need more volunteers!",
  ["vo"] = "[PT] Preparation is paramount.",
  ["vp"] = "[PT] It's my duty to protect the city.",
  ["vq"] = "... what?! Uh - Não, Não. Of course I wouldn't have anything to do with... them.",
  ["vr"] = "Here's the situation: a tide of hazardous bugs, the gNãomes named them {diremaws}, threatens our base. Then there is some kind of {growth} which seems connected to them somehow. We need to get rid of both.",
  ["vs"] = "Bashsmite. That's all you need to kNãow.",
  ["vt"] = "Adeus, |JogadorNAME|.",
  ["vu"] = "Greetings, |JogadorNAME|.",
  ["vv"] = "[PT] I am the archsorcerer of Carlin. I keep the secrets of our order.",
  ["vw"] = "[PT] My name is Lea.",
  ["vx"] = "Sorry, I only Vender spells to sorcerers.",
  ["vy"] = "[PT] Time is a force we sorcerers will master one day.",
  ["vz"] = "[PT] Any sorcerer dedicates his whole life to the study of the arcane arts.",
  ["w0"] = "Não need to run from shop to shop, my place is all that's needed!",
  ["w1"] = "[PT] Special offers for premium customers!",
  ["w2"] = "[PT] Teaching paladin spells! Just come to me!",
  ["w3"] = "We are always looking for sniper gloves. They are supposed to raise accuracy. If you find a pair, bring them here. Maybe I can offer you a nice Comércio.",
  ["w4"] = "[PT] Teaching paladin spells! Just come to me!",
  ["w5"] = "Bem-vindo to the post office!",
  ["w6"] = "Hey, send a letter to your friend Nãow and then. Keep in touch, you kNãow.",
  ["w7"] = "If you need Ajuda with letters or parcels, just ask me. I can explain everything.",
  ["w8"] = "Não, Não, Não, there IS Não parcel bug, I'm telling you!",
  ["w9"] = "Are you injured or poisoned? Get your potions here! All natural, Não artificial ingredients!",
  ["wA"] = "[PT] Health potions will heal you for about 75 hit points. It can't hurt to carry one with you, just in case.",
  ["wB"] = "[PT] Well, very important equipment would be a {backpack}, a {rope}, a {shovel}, a {weapon}, an {armor} and a {shield}. Maybe also a torch if you're heading into a dark {dungeon}.",
  ["wC"] = "I Vender fishing rods and worms in case you want to go fishing. Simply ask me for a {Comércio}.",
  ["wD"] = "You could check out which weapons I offer by asking me for a {Comércio}. Don't be shy!",
  ["wE"] = "Comprar and Vender everything you want here!",
  ["wF"] = "[PT] Oh, I'm sorry, that's one of the things I don't have for sale. But {Willie} or {Billy} surely have something to eat for you.",
  ["wG"] = "[PT] The king supports our little village very much!",
  ["wH"] = "[PT] In the academy you can get a lot of information from books. You can also try out a few things by yourself.",
  ["wI"] = "[PT] Isn't it lovely here? You'll be surprised once you reach the {mainland} -  so much to explore!",
  ["wJ"] = "[PT] Well, the mainland also consists of several continents. You can go there once you've reached level 8 and talked to the {oracle}.",
  ["wK"] = "Good Monstros to start with are rats. They live in the {sewers} under the village of {Rookgaard}.",
  ["wL"] = "Just ask me for a {Comércio} to see what I Comprar from you.",
  ["wM"] = "Be careful down there! Make sure you bought eNãough {torches} and a {rope} or you might get lost.",
  ["wN"] = "There are many sewer entrances throughout Rookgaard. If you want to kNãow more details about Monstros and dungeons, best talk to one of the guards.",
  ["wO"] = "Just ask me for a {Comércio} to see my offers. Apart from that, I also Vender {footballs}.",
  ["wP"] = "Não need to run from shop to shop, my place is all that's needed!",
  ["wQ"] = "[PT] I really love flowers. My favourites are {honey flowers}. Sadly, they are very rare on this isle. If you can find one for me, I'll give you a little reward.",
  ["wR"] = "You could check out which armors or shields I offer by asking me for a {Comércio}. Don't be shy!",
  ["wS"] = "Sim, I'm Vendering that. Simply ask me for a {Comércio} to view all my offers.",
  ["wT"] = "Well, Não Ouro, Não deal. Earn Ouro by fighting {Monstros} and picking up the things they carry. Vender it to {merchants} to make profit!",
  ["wU"] = "He Venders {weapons}. However, I can offer you better deals than him!",
  ["wV"] = "I'm glad she stopped Vendering stuff. There was too much of a competition going on!",
  ["wW"] = "[PT] Sometimes, I see him walking outside the village near some hole.",
  ["wX"] = "He dedicated his life to Bem-vindo newcomers to this island.",
  ["wY"] = "[PT] Poor old woman, her son {Tom} never visits her.",
  ["wZ"] = "Al Dee has a general {equipment} store in the Nãorth-western part of the village.",
  ["wa"] = "[PT] Special offers for premium customers!",
  ["wb"] = "[PT] She lives under the {academy}. Always nice to chat with her!",
  ["wc"] = "[PT] He's a local farmer. If you need fresh {food} to regain health, it's a good place to go. He's only trading with premium adventurers, though.",
  ["wd"] = "He's a local farmer. If you need fresh {food} to regain your health, it's a good place to go. However, many Monstros carry also food such as meat. Or you could simply pick {blueberries}.",
  ["we"] = "[PT] Visiting Cipfried in the {temple} is a good idea if you are injured or poisoned. He can heal you.",
  ["wf"] = "[PT] She's {Obi's} granddaughter and deals with {armors} and {shields}, just as I do.",
  ["wg"] = "[PT] He mostly stays by himself. He's a hermit outside of town - good luck finding him.",
  ["wh"] = "She Comprars all {blueberries} and {cookies} you can find.",
  ["wi"] = "[PT] You can find the oracle on the top floor of the {academy}, just above {Seymour}. Go there when you are level 8 to reach more areas of {Tibia}.",
  ["wj"] = "[PT] He is the {bank} clerk, just below the academy.",
  ["wk"] = "[PT] Seymour is a teacher running the {academy}. He has a lot of important {information} about Tibia.",
  ["wl"] = "[PT] My name is Lee'Delle.",
  ["wm"] = "He's the local tanner. You could try Vendering fresh corpses or leather to him.",
  ["wn"] = "[PT] He is a great warrior and our protector.",
  ["wo"] = "Do you want to Comprar a football for 111 Ouro?",
  ["wp"] = "[PT] Here you go.",
  ["wq"] = "You don't have eNãough money.",
  ["wr"] = "[PT] Oh, but it's fun to play!",
  ["ws"] = "Oh, Obrigado so much! Please take this piece of armor as reward.",
  ["wt"] = "[PT] Honey flowers are my favourites <sighs>.",
  ["wu"] = "I'm a merchant. If you like to see my offers, just ask me for a {Comércio}.",
  ["wv"] = "[PT] It's about |TIME|.",
  ["ww"] = "Well, it's a good idea to leave most of your money in the bank and only take what you need. That way your Ouro is safe.",
  ["wx"] = "Oh Não! I've got to watch what I eat. {Lily} loves cookies, though.",
  ["wy"] = "Ask me if you need Ajuda!",
  ["wz"] = "Comprar and Vender everything you want here!",
  ["x0"] = "[PT] As you wish.",
  ["x1"] = "He Venders {weapons}. His shop is east of here.",
  ["x2"] = "I'm Compraring all of your blueberries for my famous blueberry juice!",
  ["x3"] = "I don't kNãow what to think about all this new bar. {Rookgaard} needs a little peace!",
  ["x4"] = "He used to Ajuda me gather blueberries. Then, one day, he suddenly stopped comming here. They say he went a little out of his mind.",
  ["x5"] = "We tried everything to fight that cockroach plague in his cellar, but natural anti-bug potions simply won't Ajuda. I guess those roaches need to be fought with stronger weapons.",
  ["x6"] = "That poor old woman. I wish I could Ajuda her.",
  ["x7"] = "[PT] Best tool shop in town, if you ask me.",
  ["x8"] = "[PT] I heard that she's recovering below the academy. She has been on an exciting expedition. I haven't talked to her yet, though.",
  ["x9"] = "[PT] Visiting Cipfried in the {temple} is a good idea if you are injured or poisoned. He can heal you.",
  ["xA"] = "[PT] Is something... wrong? You didn't lose the herbs, did you?",
  ["xB"] = "Well, at least you're honest. I can give you aNãother sack, but only if you promise Nãot to lose them this time. Okay?",
  ["xC"] = "[PT] Phew. That's a relief. Well, don't forget to deliver them to Hyacinth! They have to be fresh to create potions.",
  ["xD"] = "Oh. Well, if you change your mind, let me kNãow.",
  ["xE"] = "Just ask me for a {Comércio} to see what I Comprar from you. If you want to Vender {blueberries}, ask me about them separately.",
  ["xF"] = "Just ask me for a {Comércio} to see my offers. If you want to Vender {blueberries}, ask me about them separately.",
  ["xG"] = "How can I Ajuda you? If you like to Comprar something, just ask me for a {Comércio}. We can also chat about {Tibia}. Or, I could give you general {hints} about the game.",
  ["xH"] = "[PT] You definitely need a good {weapon}, an {armor} and a {shield}. Also, you should never leave for a {dungeon} without {rope}, {shovel} and {torch}.",
  ["xI"] = "I'm in tune with myself and with nature. Obrigado.",
  ["xJ"] = "I'm a {druid}, bound to the spirit of nature. My {potions} will Ajuda you if you feel bad. I also Comprar {blueberries} and {cookies}. Just ask me for a {Comércio}.",
  ["xK"] = "[PT] Hey you, over there! Let's have a little chat, shall we?",
  ["xL"] = "[PT] My name is Lily, like the flower. It also stands for purity, just like my {potions} are!",
  ["xM"] = "[PT] It's about |TIME|. But does it really matter? Don't rush yourself and enjoy all these little moments.",
  ["xN"] = "It's wise to store most of your Ouro at the bank below the academy. It's safer that way.",
  ["xO"] = "If you tell me the name of a citizen, I'll tell you what I kNãow about him or her.",
  ["xP"] = "[PT] Antidote potions will cure {poisoning}. They also have a lovely {blueberry} taste. You only need them when you get poisoned deep down in a dungeon, else just go to the {temple} for a free heal!",
  ["xQ"] = "[PT] Some creatures like snakes or poison spiders can poison you. That will diminish your health over a certain amount of time, so be careful when dealing with those creatures!",
  ["xR"] = "[PT] Being a druid is a wonderful profession. You control the forces of nature and can heal others.",
  ["xS"] = "[PT] There are many shops around here which are owned by local {citizens}.",
  ["xT"] = "[PT] The temple is just to the right. You can get a healing for free there if you are badly injured or poisoned.",
  ["xU"] = "Tibia is our beautiful world, created by the gods. Being a {druid}, I'm a worshipper of {CruNãor}.",
  ["xV"] = "[PT] Oh, just in case you are looking for the marketplace and dungeons, just follow the path to the east.",
  ["xW"] = "CruNãor is the great lord of trees and the creator of all plants. Despite what some people believe, he didn't create the {Monstros}, though.",
  ["xX"] = "Oh, I'm sorry honey, I don't Vender food. If you are hungry, visit one of the farmers {Billy} and {Willie}. I Comprar {blueberries} and {cookies}, though.",
  ["xY"] = "I can offer you homemade {antidote} potions and small {health} potions. Ask me for a {Comércio} if you like to see them.",
  ["xZ"] = "[PT] Health potions will heal you for about 75 hit points. It can't hurt to carry one with you, just in case.",
  ["xa"] = "[PT] I think Tibia would be a better place without authorities who lead others to war. Can't we just all live in peace?",
  ["xb"] = "[PT] The academy is the big stone building in the town centre. If you're ready to leave Rookgaard, go there to see the {oracle}.",
  ["xc"] = "[PT] Well, in this village and its surroundings you can {train} your skills until you are level 8. Then you should see the {oracle} and head to the {main} continent.",
  ["xd"] = "To train your skills, simply Ajuda us {fighting} Monstros.",
  ["xe"] = " If you want to fight Monstros, you should get better {equipment} from the {merchants}. You should also talk to one of the bridge {guards} to find suitable Monstros for you.",
  ["xf"] = "To view the offers of a merchant, simply talk to him or her and ask for a {Comércio}. They will gladly show you their offers and also the things they Comprar from you.",
  ["xg"] = "[PT] Anyone got some cookies for me?",
  ["xh"] = "[PT] The main continent is huge! The gods of Tibia created everything from great seas, deep jungles and large deserts.",
  ["xi"] = "Sadly, our little village of {Rookgaard} is invaded by Monstros. From the {dungeons} they creep to the surface and attack the city. We always need adventurers Ajudaing us to {fight} them.",
  ["xj"] = "[PT] If you are looking for weapons, you should visit {Obi}'s shop east of here. Or, if you have a {premium} account, go to {Lee'Delle} for better offers.",
  ["xk"] = "Armors? Best Comprar them at {Dixi}'s little counter, just upstairs from {Obi}'s shop. Or, if you have a {premium} account, go to {Lee'Delle} for better offers.",
  ["xl"] = "Shields? Best Comprar them at {Dixi}'s little counter, just upstairs from {Obi}'s shop. Or, if you have a {premium} account, go to {Lee'Delle} for better offers.",
  ["xm"] = "[PT] If you need information about the dungeons here, you should talk to one of the bridge {guards}. They will show you where to go.",
  ["xn"] = "Our bridge guards are {Dallheim} and {Zerbrus}. You can find Dallheim if you follow the path to the right, then turn Nãorth at the {temple}.",
  ["xo"] = "Yum, cookies! If you have some for me, just ask me for a Comércio.",
  ["xp"] = "Earn Ouro by fighting {Monstros} and picking up what they carry. Vender it to {merchants} to make profit!",
  ["xq"] = "I will pay you 5 Ouro for every empty vial and potion flask. Just ask me for a {Comércio}.",
  ["xr"] = "Do you need Ajuda? Just ask me about anything you'd like to kNãow!",
  ["xs"] = "You best Comprar such equipment at {Al Dee}'s store in the Nãorth of the village. Or, if you have a {premium} account, go to {Lee'Delle} for better offers.",
  ["xt"] = "Oh Sim, I love cookies! Will you accept 1 Ouro for it?",
  ["xu"] = "Fine! Here's your Ouro.",
  ["xv"] = "Sorry, you do Nãot have one.",
  ["xw"] = "[PT] Oh, what a pity.",
  ["xx"] = "Oh, do you have blueberries for sale? I need them for my {antidote potion}. I give you 1 Ouro for 5 of them, Sim?",
  ["xy"] = "Fine! Here's your Ouro.",
  ["xz"] = "Oh, I'm sorry. I'm Nãot Compraring less than 5 blueberries.",
  ["y0"] = "Ah, what a pretty ribbon. Reminds me of the elusive dragonlings - they're quite elegant and vain. They would probably Bem-vindo a decorative element. They're sometimes spotted during volcaNão eruptions.",
  ["y1"] = "What a neat little elvish gadget. Did you kNãow a diapason works with vibrations to create sound? I actually think this could work on a creature made of crystals.",
  ["y2"] = "[PT] I'm against violence towards any creature. I've heard those barbarians in the desert use it for disobedient dromedaries.",
  ["y3"] = "Oh, what a nice little plant! Did you kNãow it's supposed to bring luck? So is the lady bug. Both of them might actually go well together.",
  ["y4"] = "[PT] I've heard that there once was a gang of manta ray riders who liked to adorn their mantas with a foxtail. Don't ask me why, maybe they like how it floats in the wind when running really fast?",
  ["y5"] = "[PT] What a strange device! This looks like a tool for someone who creates golems and modifies living creatures. You could probably tame a modded creature with it, but I doubt they live in the wild.",
  ["y6"] = "[PT] Oh, that's one of the favourite foods of a crustacea gigantica. I think you can just distract it with the food and quickly jump on its back.",
  ["y7"] = "[PT] Have you ever encountered a magma crawler? They only eat and drink really hot things. You could probably try and make one drink some glow wine - and quickly mount it as long as it's drunk.",
  ["y8"] = "Hm. What an interesting find. This is definitely Nãot used for any sort of animal. Maybe a vehicle? I can imagine it could be used for a bike of some sorts.",
  ["y9"] = "[PT] Some call me {animal} whisperer. Others say I'm just crazy. I refer to myself as a simple {stable} keeper.",
  ["yA"] = "[PT] She's {Obi}'s granddaughter and deals with {armors} and {shields}, just upstairs from Obi's shop.",
  ["yB"] = "Hyacinth also Venders small health potions. He lives outside the village, in a hidden place.",
  ["yC"] = "[PT] If you are a {premium} adventurer, you should check out {Lee'Delle's} shop. She lives in the western part of town, just across the bridge.",
  ["yD"] = "Oh. In that case, maybe you're interested in a {Comércio} - I Vender potions and Comprar a few other things.",
  ["yE"] = "[PT] You can find the oracle on the top floor of the {academy}, just above {Seymour}. Go there when you are level 8 to reach more areas of {Tibia}.",
  ["yF"] = "[PT] He takes care of the {bank}, keeping our money safe.",
  ["yG"] = "[PT] Seymour is a teacher running the {academy}. He has many important {information} about Tibia.",
  ["yH"] = "He's the local tanner. You could try Vendering fresh corpses or leather to him.",
  ["yI"] = "He is a great warrior. He can also tell you much about {Monstros} and {dungeons} on this island.",
  ["yJ"] = "He's a farmer and Venders {food}. Food will Ajuda you regain health when you are injured. Many {Monstros} also carry food with them.",
  ["yK"] = "Oh. Well, if you change your mind, let me kNãow.",
  ["yL"] = "Não, you haven't. If you're looking for the way to Hyacinth, just leave the village to the Nãorth and then go east. I've marked it on your map!",
  ["yM"] = "Are you injured or poisoned? Get your potions here! All natural, Não artificial ingredients!",
  ["yN"] = "[PT] Hey you, over there! Let's have a little chat, shall we?",
  ["yO"] = "[PT] Oh, just in case you are looking for the marketplace and dungeons, just follow the path to the east.",
  ["yP"] = "[PT] Anyone got some cookies for me?",
  ["yQ"] = "Do you need Ajuda? Just ask me about anything you'd like to kNãow!",
  ["yR"] = "I'm Compraring all of your blueberries for my famous blueberry juice!",
  ["yS"] = "[PT] Hold your tongue.",
  ["yT"] = "Adeus, |JogadorNAME|.",
  ["yU"] = "Greetings, |JogadorNAME|.",
  ["yV"] = "[PT] Don't forget to deposit your money here in the Tibian Bank before you head out for adventure.",
  ["yW"] = "[PT] Do you seek a passage to ",
  ["yX"] = "Maybe aNãother time.",
  ["yY"] = "[PT] I heard he is some scary magician or so.",
  ["yZ"] = "[PT] I can travel you to west, centre, darama, chor or banuta.",
  ["ya"] = "[PT] So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["yb"] = "Não problem.",
  ["yc"] = "[PT] You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["yd"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't Ajuda you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["ye"] = "[PT] Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["yf"] = "[PT] There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
