  ["yy"] = "I enjoy the peace and solitude out here. You're Bem-vindo to be my guest as long as you behave in a quiet and tolerable manner.",
  ["yz"] = "[PT] I heard that terror birds really love carrots. I'd try waving it in front of one of those.",
  ["z0"] = "[PT] A hermit on the other side of town.",
  ["z1"] = "The oracle! Sim! You should get off this island as fast as you can!",
  ["z2"] = "[PT] Young and inexperienced he is.",
  ["z3"] = "[PT] Seymour is the headmaster of the local {academy}.",
  ["z4"] = "I'm sure he has never seen Monstros like those in this hole before.",
  ["z5"] = "I tried to warn him about these Monstros but he just laughed at me!! It's an outrage!",
  ["z6"] = "[PT] My name is Loui.",
  ["z7"] = "[PT] I'm a {monk}. I wanted to do something here, but I forgot what it was when I fell in that {hole}.",
  ["z8"] = "[PT] I'm a humble servant of the {gods}.",
  ["z9"] = "[PT] They created Tibia and all lifeforms.",
  ["zA"] = "That looks like it might fit a draptor. If you can ever get close eNãough to one to catch it, I'd simply try putting it on while whispering calming words.",
  ["zB"] = "[PT] The sound of a hunting horn is often intimidating to forest creatures, but I heard that wild boars actually like it.",
  ["zC"] = "[PT] Ironblights consist mainly of stone and iron. With a strong magnet like that you can basically force it to walk in the direction you're wanting it to.",
  ["zD"] = "[PT] Try catching a midnight panther using that one. Don't hit the panther, mind you. Just let the whip crack in the air - I think that will work.",
  ["zE"] = "As far as I kNãow, leeches can be found in terrestrial, swampy areas. Leeches often Ajuda large animals such as water buffaloes to get rid of parasites.",
  ["zF"] = "[PT] You should show that giant jaw to a creature looking like the one you got it from. It will respect you when it sees those scary teeth.",
  ["zG"] = "[PT] Where did you get that? What a rare treat. This must have been crafted by someone who truly loves both music and animals. I can't tell you anything else about it.",
  ["zH"] = "[PT] Oh, a nail case..., I hate paring nails. But I heard gravediggers become trusting when they get the right treatment.",
  ["zI"] = "How impressive, a nightmare horn. Have you ever encountered a shock head? Try hypNãotizing them with your horn.",
  ["zJ"] = "[PT] You could probably ride a black sheep with these. Talk to it gently and carefully put on the reins.",
  ["zK"] = "[PT] Some call me {animal} whisperer. Others say I'm just crazy. I refer to myself as a simple {stable} keeper.",
  ["zL"] = "[PT] Wow, that's a rarity. Have you ever met one of those large sandstone scorpions? They're quite impressive. You need such a sceptre to show to one that you're its new master.",
  ["zM"] = "That might be the only way to tame a bear. It has a sensitive spot right between the ears which will calm it down, but you're Nãot strong eNãough for simple acupressure. Using the slingshot is likely to Ajuda you with that.",
  ["zN"] = "As the name indicates - this can be used to make a slug much faster than it Nãormally is! Once you've tamed it, it will race you wherever you want to go.",
  ["zO"] = "[PT] Create sugar oat by just mixing a bunch of sugar cane with a bunch of wheat. All horses love sugar oat! Sometimes when the horses from the horse station in Thais are on the loose, wild horses mix with the herd. Maybe they can be tamed?",
  ["zP"] = "[PT] The interesting part about that bait isn't the sweet stuff - it's the flies attracted to the sweet smell. Spiders love to eat flies, especially the Zaoan ones.",
  ["zQ"] = "Hm! Nãow that's an interesting one. Where did you get that from? I could imagine it winds something up in a factory, but it's definitely Nãot a Nãormal animal.",
  ["zR"] = "[PT] It's on the door.",
  ["zS"] = "[PT] I love all animals, whether small or big. I also believe each one, even the wildest and most ferocious being, can be talked to, understood and {tamed}.",
  ["zT"] = "[PT] It's my dream to shelter many different tamed animals. Maybe one day that dream will come true.",
  ["zU"] = "Well, usually you can tame animals with the Ajuda of a few simple items. If you've found such an {item}, show it to me and I might be able to Ajuda you with instructions on the taming process.",
  ["zV"] = "[PT] Well? Which item have you found and require advice for?",
  ["zW"] = "That's among the favourite foods of donkeys, as far as I kNãow. It's a shame I haven't really seen any donkey around. It could require a magic trick to actually get to meet one.",
  ["zX"] = "Pandas love to eat bamboo leaves, but the Tiquandan pandas are actually Nãot that skilled at climbing, so they have a hard time getting some for themselves. You might be able to tame one with them.",
  ["zY"] = "I enjoy the peace and solitude out here. You're Bem-vindo to be my guest as long as you behave in a quiet and tolerable manner.",
  ["zZ"] = "[PT] BEWARE! Beware of that hole!",
